lling in for us, with light snowstorms and rain over the next few days."gNonetheless, clear weather is predicted to follow this bout, so look forward to the next few days!"^Not all will stay well though, as a blizzard seems to be headed straight for Reborn City!"PWe will be seeing some varied weather therefollowing though, so stay tuned!"bWe will be leading in with some light snow and erratic weather therefollowing, so stay tuned!"7We'll have updates for you over the next few days."åWe'll be seeing a spike in temperature over the next few days with clear skies, high winds, and more sun than you can shake a Solar Beam at."DWe'll be kicking off with light rainstorms all across the city."^Don't fret though, because those storms will soon give way to clear skies and sunny days!"mTemperatures are dropping over the next few days as we come to the intersection between rainy and gusty."FExpect scattered showers on and off throughout the next few days!"EOver the next few days, we could be seeing an entourage of rain!"cThe incoming storm is expected to last just a few days, so grab those umbrellas and buckle in!"fReborn is seeing some snowfall right now, but this dusting is not going to last through the week."ãTemperatures will begin to rise over the next few days, with snow turning into rain. Nonetheless, this downpour shows no signs of stopping!"{Temperatures are at a record low right now, but the skies are clear, so if you plan on heading out, make sure to bundle up!"tThere's no time like snow time in Reborn City! With how much it's coming down, you'd think we were in Ametrine!"tThough accumulation is negligible, this blizzard is expected to last consistently throughout the next few days."VEasterly winds will be coming in over the next few days, bringing rain with them!"gThe storm is not expected to last, however, and we should be back to sunny days in no time at all."gLight snowstorms start us off this week, with high winds coming in, followed by scattered showers."wThere is a silver lining after this tumultuous weather though: expect sunny days coming up just around the corner."(Stay warm and keep on, Reborn City!")Keep cool and carry on, Reborn City!"?The Powder spoiled from being shaken on the unstable rock!"fAYA: I know I'm not good for very much, but I'd appreciate if you didn't use me as a meat-shield.")AYA: The others will be okay, right?"&Uh, don't tell them that I asked.".AYA: It'll be a straight shot, they said."-It's right around the corner, they said."AYA: Hey."'Uh, thanks for putting up with me."HDon't get the wrong idea! I just felt like it was the thing to say."6And now for this week's forecast for Reborn City!"_We've got clear skies over the weekend, but we're looking at high temperatures on Tuesday."äFortunately, this won't last long as strong winds on Wednesday are going to blow in a storm system which will take hold for a couple days."§We've got a storm system hitting us mid-week. Clearing up a couple days later, we risk intense sun mid-day Saturday, but that'll clear out from Sunday's high winds!"øWe're in for a rainy week! Starting Wednesday, we're looking at a huge storm system coming in. Thunderstorms Thursday and lingering showers until strong winds clear it out for us on Saturday."KThis week is gonna be hot, hot, hot! We've got clearskies all week, but that stagnant air in the city is likely to weaken the local atmosphere resulting in spiking temperatures in the city over the weekend! Fortunately we expect some high winds on Sunday to come in and clean out the air, so we should be back to normal afterwards."xScattered showers this week! Look out for slight rainstorms on Monday and Friday, as well as high winds on Tuesday!"çWe're looking at a pretty clear week here in Reborn! We've got high winds on Monday and Thursday, but otherwise this is an ideally calm week!"We've got quite the system coming our way! Clear skies Friday and Saturday, but some pretty intense heat coming in Sunday, followed by 