ulties."(Today we have a very special guest!"1He's strong, mysterious... and totally cute!"OHe's none other than my master, the Psychic Gym Leader of Reborn, Radomus!"1RADOMUS: Thank you for having me, Gardevoir."AGARDEVOIR: Oh, no, Master~ Really, the pleasure is all mine!"JSo, you're a wealthy gentleman who lives alone in a gigantic mansion."%I'm sure everyone wants to know:"'When are you going to take a wife?"MRADOMUS: Tell me, Gardevoir, do you believe in the concept of soulmates?"5GARDEVOIR: Yes! I already know who mine is, too~"FRADOMUS: So you believe that a person has only one true soulmate?"GARDEVOIR: That's right~"_I'm just waiting for mine to realize that the girl of his dreams is right in front of him!"#RADOMUS: I believe so as well."*That is why I won't be taking a wife."I've known my soulmate."KI've danced among her soul, and watched with sorrow as it danced away."LNonetheless, Gardevoir, I do hope that your chosen awakens to you soon."Best wishes to you both."&RADOMUS: Is something the matter?"!GARDEVOIR: No... You just..."How can you be so stupid?!" RADOMUS: I beg your pardon?"7GARDEVOIR: Stupid Master! I can't do this anymore!"eToday, we're here with the soulful Sensei of Reborn's spiritual center, Apophyll Academy-- Kiki!")So, Kiki, tell us about your school!"vKIKI: Firstly, I should clarify that although I am officially the Sensei, at our school there is not one teacher."*All of us teach, and all of us learn."dOne must never think themselves above the lessons of our lives, no matter from where they come."/Apophyll Academy is an institute of peace."8That means, firstly, finding peace within yourself."aOnly once the chaos within is quelled can one even hope to make a difference in the outside."QGARDEVOIR: So you guys do a lot of meditation and that sort of thing, right?"sKIKI: Correct, although meditation and self-reflection are simply one of many ways in which we tune ourselves.",GARDEVOIR: But doesn't that get boring?"=KIKI: The purpose is not