ertaken a huge number of renovation projects, which no doubt everyone within the city limits has noticed."vTell us, after being trapped in time for more than a decade, what inspired you to take on this enormous workload?"AADRIENN: When I grew up-- or rather, in the time I grew up--"5This whole time distortion thing is confusing..."eBack then, Reborn was a region renowned for its beauty, and the city matched that acre for acre."\Since I came back, I've seen so many ways how Reborn City is just not what it once was.""It's shocking-- painful even."KSo, it's only natural that I'm going to do everything I can to fix it."NGARDEVOIR: Well said! Aren't you cute, always playing the good samaritan!"%"I will protect you, Gardevoir!""1ADRIENN: Ahaha, can't we let that go by now?"GARDEVOIR: Nope!"6"I will restore the city!" It's adorable, really!"KADRIENN: Do I really sound like that? You're starting to embarrass me.".GARDEVOIR: Good! That's my job, you know?".ADRIENN: No, I um, didn't know, actually."+I thought this was a formal interview?"&GARDEVOIR: It is! It's so formal!"It's the formal-est!"3There hasn't been a more formal interview yet!"BADRIENN: Based on the ones I've seen, I would believe that..."4GARDEVOIR: What? What's that supposed to mean?!"LNow listen here, before you go saying that, let me explain you a thing!"Wait, first... Cut, cut!"NToday we have a special report with Gym Leader Florinia of the Onyx Ward!"fMany Trainers are well-acquainted with Florinia as the headmistress of the Onyx Trainers' School."cTell us, Florinia, how exactly did you manage to secure a position so prestigious at your age?"lFLORINIA: Principality of the school was requested following the acceptance of the Gym Leader position."{The conversion of city-public property was acknowledged as necessary to be forfeit for the foundation of the Reborn League,"=Thus, what was once solely a school became solely a Gym."lUpon gaining control of the facility, and proper permissions following, the ins