ld count on you!"ALet's see... They require 2 years of social work experience?"UI'd say the Magma Gang's work has been pretty social. That should be no problem!"0Anyway, thanks for stickin' it out with us."oWhen you first showed up in our humble ol' alley, I had no idea you'd be the kind of person that you were."2But by now, I've heard the rumours about you."ÇIt took me too long to even connect them to the person I knew, but you're the one who everyone says has been saving Reborn, right?"7And you don't care about the glory at all, do you?"Magnificent bastard."Take this with you."=It's a final "Thank you" gift we got from the Aqua Gang."8Oh, and the item is just a little bonus I threw in."MAXWELL: See you around!"<And don't you dare ever let your glory slip away, baby!"Hmm..."KI don't want to be rude, since you've gone through all this trouble..."#But where's the glory in this?"iIf it's just another normal job, I don't know whose life I can really make a difference in that way."cOf course, I'm willing to wait until a position where I can make a direct difference opens up."(Glory doesn't come overnight, baby."CHeh, though that does sound like a raunchy slogan, doesn't it?"MAXWELL: Woah, hey there."NYou know I was asking you to find applications for the other guys, right?"4Not me-- Well, maybe I'll think about it later."iTAKA: This would be a decent place to hide... if it weren't for the ton of Pok√©mon strolling about."PI may have many healing items, but I still only have so many healing items."8TAKA: Somehow everywhere we go looks amazing to me."<Maybe living for myself means finally seeing the world."WTAKA: Looking at a place like this, I get the feeling anything could be beyond it."Maybe this is where I run.":TAKA: Something is off in the energy of this place..."3I wonder what it is that makes it so unstable?"Then again, same."FTAKA: This place feels like a huge deja vu trip for me somehow..."OTAKA: How does something like this even keep from collapsing in 