Well."1Then you found the right person for the job."#I won't waste a minute. Ta-ta!"How fascinating!"It's scrap paper!"Laced with ink!".I do love the smell of freshly laden ink."bEspecially after you smell too much of it and start getting loopy. It'll knock you right out!"(That's the best! Maybe not healthy!"YIf you want health, try valerian root. Guaranteed to KO-- plus some health benefits!"\Only problem with that one is, it smells like the south end of a north-facing Skuntank!"*\PN showed the Application to Pierce."PIERCE: ..."Apophyll Beach, huh?"Beats the city."I'll go."A library, huh?"$It's quiet, I'll give you that."'But people need help all the time."6Asking where books are, or for recommendations..."$I don't want to deal with that."So forget it."Too loud."Too many people."Forget it."(\PN showed the Application to Darm."DARM: Hmph!"A circus job!?"No way that's for me."MThen again, it could be fun to be show off in front of so many people..."Lemme see that."""Requirements: Arm-wrestle"?!"6You can get a job for arm-wrestling some shmuck?!"<Who cares about the job? This a personal CHALLENGE now!"I'm off!".A job like this is way below my strength!"SI should be dazzling people with muscles, not taking orders or selling things!"$That's what POWER is all about!"(Wonder and excitement! A true show!"4Find something like that, and then we can talk!")\PN showed the Application to Razzy."3RAZZY: What'd you find? Anything interesting?!"2What? A company job? That's totally boring..."-Connected to the Sweet Kiss Candy Shop?!"JYou think they sell rock candy? I haven't had that since I was a kid!"Oh! What about Red-Hots?!"ZMy grandma used to make a killer applesauce that she'd flavor using blended Red-Hots!"&This sounds awesome! Count me in!"Woah, a circus?!"That sounds radical!"#But it's out of Reborn City..."6There's no way I could work at a place like that."Is there anything else?"0Huh? This doesn't sound interesting at all!"?Isn't there something close by that's upbeat and exciting?"#Good food would be a plus too!""Wait, can you eat on the job?")\PN showed the Application to Nihil."NIHIL: Don't bother."The Nightclub's hiring.""All right, fuck you. You win."I'll go and check it out."And uh,"Thanks, I guess."0Weren't you listening? I said don't bother."=There's not a job in this whole city cool enough for me."Isn't that obvious?"TThere's not many places you'd expect to see someone as exclusive as me working."+So just drop it already. You heard it?"*\PN showed the Application to Archer."ARCHER: Hmm..."OSilph Co. requires at least two years of business management experience..."TWell, seems like the Aqua Gang's been quite the profitable business, hasn't it?"bAhh, that title won't do. I'll just quickly rebrand the now-empty group to Aqua Incorporated."bIt should make a fine qualification, and I'm more than capable of brushing aside the details."0This job will suit me perfectly, thank you.")You've been a true friend to us all.".Please take this as a final parting gift."AIt was one of the Pok√©mon we liberated from the Magma Gang."@The item it's holding is just a personal selection from me."ARCHER: Farewell, \PN."BOh, and don't mind if I list you as a professional reference."'Is this really the best out there?"mCompared to many of the other guys, I would hope I'd be able to get something a little more significant."VI've also managed to keep my record fairly clean, so that shouldn't be a problem."4Was there, by chance, anything more profitable?";ARCHER: Mm? Have you finished with the others already?"/They should be the top priority right now."ôWhile it's true that I will be looking for employment myself shortly, I would rather ensure they all have positions first than risk taking one from them."+\PN showed the Application to Maxwell." MAXWELL: Let's take a look!".SOLICE? Never heard of this place before."PBut the work they do seems to be exactly the sort of thing I'm looking for."Nice catch, \PN!"!I knew I could count on you!"ALet's see... They require 2 years of social work experience?"UI'd say the Magma Gang's work has been pretty social. That should be no problem!"0Anyway, thanks for stickin' it out with us."oWhen you first showed up in our humble ol' alley, I had no idea you'd be the kind of person that you were."2But by now, I've heard the rumours about you."ÇIt took me too long to even connect them to the person I knew, but you're the one who everyone says has been saving Reborn, right?"7And you don't care about the glory at all, do you?"Magnificent bastard."Take this with you."=It's a final "Thank you" gift we got from the Aqua Gang."8Oh, and the item is just a little bonus I threw in."MAXWELL: See you around!"<And don't you dare ever let your glory slip away, baby!"Hmm..."KI don't want to be rude, since you've gone through all this trouble..."#But where's the glory in this?"iIf it's just another normal job, I don't know whose life I can really make a difference in that way."cOf course, I'm willing to wait until a position where I can make a direct difference opens up."(Glory doesn't come overnight, baby."CHeh, though that does sound like a raunchy slogan, doesn't it?"MAXWELL: Woah, hey there."NYou know I was asking you to find applications for the other guys, right?"4Not me-- Well, maybe I'll think about it later."iTAKA: This would be a decent place to hide... if it weren't for the ton of Pok√©mon strolling about."PI may have many healing items, but I still only have so many healing items."8TAKA: Somehow everywhere we go looks amazing to me."<Maybe living for myself means finally seeing the world."WTAKA: Looking at a place like this, I get the feeling anything could be beyond it."Maybe this is where I run.":TAKA: Something is off in the energy of this place..."3I wonder what it is that makes it so unstable?"Then again, same."FTAKA: This place feels like a huge deja vu trip for me somehow..."OTAKA: How does something like this even keep from collapsing in on itself?"-Sorry, I wasn't talking about the cave--"I meant myself."ZTAKA: There has to be something more here... Or else why would I be remembering this?"uTAKA: I swear, one of these sand pits is gonna have a Trapinch at the bottom, and that's gonna be the end of us."?TAKA: By the way, do you have any idea where you're going?"I mean, if not, it's cool."AFrankly, I've never once in my life known where I was going."9TAKA: This place isn't so bad during the night, huh?"&If you can get past all the sand."And the...":Actually I guess that's about all there is here, huh."5TAKA: My heart's racing from escaping like this."(Well, either that or a heat stroke."(TAKA: Nobody's following us, right?"eTAKA: Listen, if you see anyone suspicious, just bury me in the sand and come back for me later."âTAKA: For somewhere that only half-exists and is tossed out in the middle of who knows how many miles of sand, this place is pretty tidy.";TAKA: If you ask me, this place is entirely too clean."YTAKA: I still don't really get that whole sliding block puzzle, but I'm glad you do."CI bet it would be a lot easier if you could see it from above."...Is that your secret?"ITAKA: This doesn't seem like it would be a bad place to hide, but..."3Maybe I just don't want to be alone after all."9TAKA: I relate to these trains on a spiritual level.":TAKA: You think there's food in some of these trains?"FTAKA: I always wanted to crash trains into a pile of scrap metal."9Being with you makes dreams come true, or something.":TAKA: Is there really anything out here in this mess?"?Like, I get there's supposed to be a Gym here, but... why."TTAKA: It feels wrong, traveling with someone who was supposed to be my enemy..."3But then again, my entire life has been wrong."#So this feels right after all."RTAKA: I wonder how long it'll take the others to realize I'm not coming back."'If they haven't already, anyway..."7TAKA: ZEL is gonna get chewed out because of me..."VFather had asked them to keep tabs on me when they weren't working on the PULSEs.":Then again, I heard Zero's not doing too well lately."DTAKA: I know Team Meteor's track record isn't exactly the best,"5But they're still the only family I've ever had."6TAKA: You know, Meteor wasn't always like this..."1Originally we just looked after the Citadel."MMy dad said that his parents were more like shrinekeepers than anything."9TAKA: \PN, I'm sorry for always being such a burden."DTAKA: None of this would have happened if not for that woman..."?She's corrupted Team Meteor-- both our ends and our means."STAKA: My father says none of this would have happened if not for that woman..."tThe Champion of Reborn, who created the League and advertised it across the world like some kind of fairground."CShe closed up the old city's wounds, hiding the Citadel again."bRegardless of anyone's ideals, why bother just building over a ruin instead of preserving it?")That sounds like something I'd pull."PTAKA: My father says that whatever happens to Reborn City is its own fault."pAfter my grandparents' death, the founders built Reborn City on top of the holy Citadel, trying to hide it."<It was the ultimate insult to our forebearers' culture.")Or whatever that's supposed to mean."ETAKA: Hey, in your travels, did you ever meet a girl named Luna?"/She was one of my only friends growing up."Then she ran away..."Just like me now, I guess."I think about her a lot."ITAKA: Hey, this is just a random question, but you know Luna, right?"%If you see her again, tell her--"...Actually, never mind."OI kind of think it's my fault that she's become as delusional as she is..."TAfter all, if I hadn't been born, she wouldn't have had to be in that position."0TAKA: Hey, \PN, what are your parents like?""You've seen how my father is."#And my mother-- was just that."<She was hired to have me, and then she went on her way."$But that's not normal... right?"[TAKA: I know he's done no shortage of destructive things, but my father isn't all bad."qHis dream for Reborn is what his childhood was like-- a small community in reverence to our world's creator."+The one who's really dangerous is Lin."/TAKA: Do you think my father will be okay?"6He's been harsh with me, but only out of concern."1I'm the one that just can't get it together."Not faithfully, anyway..."TAKA: ..."*Oh, sorry \PN, did you say something?"I totally spaced out."KTAKA: I hope my father doesn't take it too hard when he gets the news."=He never really got over losing his parents like he did."8He's always in fear of losing things from the past."7That's why he fights so hard for Reborn's history.")TAKA: Lin's not following us, right?"RThat woman never talks except when she's giving orders or spitting on others."DShe's more like a robot than a human, but even less empathetic."'TAKA: Everything is Lin's fault..."(That woman is chaos inside and out."$Did you know she's narcoleptic?"TI can't tell you how many times we've found her collapsed in some random place."CAnd no matter what we do, she won't wake up except on her own."!TAKA: Do you hate my father?"@TAKA: I know he's not exactly a shining beacon of morals..."1But he's always fighting for his own ideals.")That was something I never could do."Until now, I guess."!TAKA: Even after everything?"...Thank you."eTAKA: He may be subordinate to my father, but you should watch out more for Sirius than for him."{He's always had the "history is written by the winners" mindset, but since he's fallen in with Lin, it's gotten much worse."7TAKA: Elias will probably be looking for me too..."RI don't want to be found by anyone, but at least Elias is loyal to my father."PI can't imagine having someone act towards me the way he does to my father."!I deserve that least of all."STAKA: You had something to do with that doctor guy joining us recently, right?"$That guy creeps me out so much."HHe's almost stalking Lin, like he's obsessed with her or something.".TAKA: Everyone connected to Lin is crazy."Like that girl, Te