s to it?"GIn answer, the energy still transfers even if no target is struck."XThe very action of punching itself carries a force which is understood universally."~Even if you do not punch someone so much as punch at them, some part of them will still feel the impact of the punch's energy."nIt may not manifest as physical pain or damage, but the energy will continue to flow, as always it does."";Okay, I need to get better at this: "How to Meditate"."$Do you wanna be my study buddy?"E"Meditation is simply the art of clearing your head of thoughts."OAlthough this sounds simple, it can be very difficult for the unpracticed."ñTo begin, play calming music, or find a quiet place, or place with some other natural rhythm (for instance, the rhythm of waves dancing on the beach)."=Find a comfortable seated position, and close your eyes."%Then simply think about nothing."dWhen you first try this, you will quickly realize how difficult it is for you to stop thinking."IThoughts will drift in and out despite your efforts. This is normal."_But each time you find yourself thinking again, force yourself to return to a blank slate."hFor beginners, it is also sometimes helpful to instead think only about the rhythm of one's breath."|Continue in this way to practice clearing your head and keeping it free of distraction for as long as you wish to meditate."",There's a guy who's come here recently."Pretty odd fellow."<He's quiet and keeps to himself, but really stands out."DI know he attends every lecture, but I've never seen him fight."-I think he went to train at the volcano?"&Victoria's been gone for a while."What's with her?"1...Unless it's something to do with him. Hm~"*Kiki gave her life to save all of us?"6...Let's make good use of our time and work hard."Have you met Cal?"&He's kinda weird, but kinda cool."#And by that I mean, kinda hot.")Oh, don't tell Victoria I said that!"'It feels really lonely here now..."àThis is the main lecture hall, but we do a lot of classes outsi