rty outweighs the associated risk."fThe risk itself is indisputable in demonstrated appearance, to say nothing of unforeseen factors."oUpon what merit do you base the claim that you deserve access to a highly volatile, still-restricted area?"{VICTORIA: I know you can't just let in every schmuck who wants to go through, but there are still people living there."aRight now, while we're sitting here arguing about it, those people need help more than ever."úI'm not gonna get in your way or mess anything up, but I think if there's even just one person who can use a helping hand right now, it's worth offering it."FLORINIA: ..."Answer accepted."Full credit."_On the authority of this speaker, these two will be permitted passage to the Obsidia Ward."Objections?"GUARD: No, ma'am."+Go right on ahead. Good luck in there.""VICTORIA: ...Oh! That worked!"|FLORINIA: This speaker will brief you on the details of the situation, but the matter is best explained through observation."Let us proceed forward."UTechnology is wonderful, isn't it? We shall all ascend to the mechanical heaven!"You broke my machines..."0Bits and pieces... But a fascinating whole."&Wanna battle? I'll take you DOWN."WHAT? Hmph..."GI'll go beat the other Trainers here to make myself feel better...".\PN picked up the package of Power Items!"Life on the edge, man..."!Fallin' off the edge, man..."Oof...")Got a Badge, huh? Think you're cool?"I can see why."9It's only one Badge, though. Don't get so worked up."If only you knew.",What this city once was, was marvelous."@Sometimes you can find Pok√©mon running around the streets."DIt's almost a better way to catch them than from the wild here."9Hey. You wanna get past me? Let's see some Pok√©mon."FOh? Well look what you got there. But do you know how to use 'em?"..."CI guess I shoulda expected that from the guy to best my buddy."Aite, you're all in."Take this for the road.",Don't say we never did nothin' for you."Hmph, fine, you can pass.";Opal Bridge i