 so this is everyone."%VICTORIA: Is something going on?"AME: Here's the situation."gWe received an anonymous tip that Team Meteor still has a base in the city, right under our noses."ADRIENN: Devon?"VICTORIA: Devon?"AME: Devon."How did you know?"<ADRIENN: For my part, it's the only logical place left."êI've been all over the rest of the city pretty intimately, but Devon Corp. is the one place that's always restricted anyone from working around."hVICTORIA: Even the storefront just looks shifty for what's supposed to be an international company."tADRIENN: Sweet Co. invested heavily in the restoration, and even Silph Co. was generous enough to donate funds."JThe fact that Devon still refused after that also made me suspicious."FAME: Yes, well it's no longer just a suspicion or anonymous lead."eI took the liberty of calling Mr. Stone with a business inquiry regarding Devon's Reborn branch."=And of course, he informed me that no such thing exists."?VICTORIA: Then it's settled! We can shut it down for good!".AME: Before that, there's one more thing."YOur informant also told us that the leader of Team Meteor is hidden there right now."VICTORIA: Solaris..."I won't hold back!"AME: No. It's Lin."GFrom what Saphira has told me, we can't take any chances with her.""That's why I need all of you.""And that's why I'm going too."KADRIENN: Oh? I thought you said you intended to stay on the sidelines?"?AME: It's true that Anna asked me to do that originally..."<AME: It's true that I intended to do that originally..."But at this point,"#If we can end all of this now,"I'll do whatever it takes.">Besides, as the Champion, I can't just do nothing, right?"!Sorry, \PN, didn't you know?"<It's not something I like to toss around or brag about."gBut I did restart this League after all, and who did you think runs the trial battles for Leaders?"'Anyway, it's really not important."/Right now, we need to focus on Devon Corp."LI've already talked over the details with Arclight, so here'