's the plan:"UThe main level is probably fairly secure, even if they don't want it to be seen."ïSo, we're going to take a pincer movement with one group in the front, and another approaching from the basement level which connects to the Railnet."JWe'll rendezvous in the middle, and tackle the upper floors together."Any questions?")ADRIENN: How are the groups decided?"-AME: You and I will take the storefront."TIf we pretend to be there on city restoration business, it won't be suspicious."C\PN, Victoria and Arclight will come up under and behind them."AADRIENN: If we all work together, they don't stand a chance!"EVICTORIA: I'll show Team Meteor the same mercy they showed Kiki."AME: Then we're set."Let's not waste any time!"XADRIENN: While we're waiting for the others, there's something I was curious about.":If I was gone for so long, why didn't you replace me?"TSurely if the League was still going, you would have needed a new Fairy Leader."AME: Um, the thing is..." I actually did replace you."EADRIENN: Oh? I'd love to meet the new-- or rather, old-- Leader!"AME: Yeah, about that..."GNobody's seen or heard from him since the incident in Jasper Ward."3It seems pretty likely that he didn't make it."CThen, you came back before I finished arranging a replacement." Nice timing in that regard."CADRIENN: Ah, I'm sorry to have brought up something like that."4ADRIENN: The others should be here soon, right?"|This is a PSA for all Trainers: Please refrain from descending waterfalls in the region without approved Machine usage!"cMany cascades are very tall and riding them downward recklessly may be a severe safety hazard!"Prioritize your health!"+Stay safe until you have that Machine!"6Contact Reborn City staff if you need assistance!"Thank you!"Hello citizens!"YThe City Restoration Project is well underway, but there's still so much left to do!"If you're interested in helping out, please contact one of the administrative staff so we can assign you a project leader.":T