Weak."eThey say you're at your best in your youth, but I feel like I'm at my best now! Try me, young'n!"What a shame. Anyone?!"7I'm gonna rock, and you're gonna roll! Sound fair?"!Then you roll on outta here."FShow me the true power of the bond between you and your Pok√©mon."When you are ready."@Oh hello! It's a pleasure to meet you! Let's have a battle!"Maybe some other time!"Got a problem, pal?"=AME: Oh, \PN. So Julia and Florinia found you after all."=I'm glad, though I'm kind of in the middle of something."^If there's anything you need to do since getting back, now would be a good time to do it."Or are you waiting on me?"!AME: Already? You move fast."!Okay, just a second, please."MAME: Sorry, as I was about to say, please inform Bennett that we accept."fHe certainly did famously during the trial battle, but something feels weird about the situation."3Maybe I'm just hung up on Laura's resignation."PBut the letter she sent was handwritten, signed, and unquestionably hers..."Well, whatever."HYou can take care of the rest for me, right? Did you get his types?"2SECRETARY: Yes. I'll register and notify him."AME: Thank you."]All right. I've got a couple of other things to take care of, but I could use your help."#The most important thing is...":Well, before I explain, I should bring everyone here."This might take all of us."ZAdrienn, Victoria, and DJ Arclight are taking care of various things around the city."3I'm not exactly sure where they are right now,"EBut you know them, right? You can probably guess where to start."JJust tell them to come back here when you find them. I'll be waiting."]AME: Great, you take care of whatever you need to, and come back to me once you're done!"_AME: Adrienn, Victoria, and DJ Arclight are taking care of various things around the city."*AME: So Arclight is meeting us there?"=Assuming he takes the low way, that should be all right.".VICTORIA: Sorry if I kept anyone waiting!"PAME: Arclight's not coming here, but he already knows, so this is everyone."%VICTORIA: Is something going on?"AME: Here's the situation."gWe received an anonymous tip that Team Meteor still has a base in the city, right under our noses."ADRIENN: Devon?"VICTORIA: Devon?"AME: Devon."How did you know?"<ADRIENN: For my part, it's the only logical place left."êI've been all over the rest of the city pretty intimately, but Devon Corp. is the one place that's always restricted anyone from working around."hVICTORIA: Even the storefront just looks shifty for what's supposed to be an international company."tADRIENN: Sweet Co. invested heavily in the restoration, and even Silph Co. was generous enough to donate funds."JThe fact that Devon still refused after that also made me suspicious."FAME: Yes, well it's no longer just a suspicion or anonymous lead."eI took the liberty of calling Mr. Stone with a business inquiry regarding Devon's Reborn branch."=And of course, he informed me that no such thing exists."?VICTORIA: Then it's settled! We can shut it down for good!".AME: Before that, there's one more thing."YOur informant also told us that the leader of Team Meteor is hidden there right now."VICTORIA: Solaris..."I won't hold back!"AME: No. It's Lin."GFrom what Saphira has told me, we can't take any chances with her.""That's why I need all of you.""And that's why I'm going too."KADRIENN: Oh? I thought you said you intended to stay on the sidelines?"?AME: It's true that Anna asked me to do that originally..."<AME: It's true that I intended to do that originally..."But at this point,"#If we can end all of this now,"I'll do whatever it takes.">Besides, as the Champion, I can't just do nothing, right?"!Sorry, \PN, didn't you know?"<It's not something I like to toss around or brag about."gBut I did restart this League after all, and who did you think runs the trial battles for Leaders?"'Anyway, it's really not important."/Right now, we need to focus on Devon Corp."LI've already talked over the details with Arclight, so here's the plan:"UThe main level is probably fairly secure, even if they don't want it to be seen."ïSo, we're going to take a pincer movement with one group in the front, and another approaching from the basement level which connects to the Railnet."JWe'll rendezvous in the middle, and tackle the upper floors together."Any questions?")ADRIENN: How are the groups decided?"-AME: You and I will take the storefront."TIf we pretend to be there on city restoration business, it won't be suspicious."C\PN, Victoria and Arclight will come up under and behind them."AADRIENN: If we all work together, they don't stand a chance!"EVICTORIA: I'll show Team Meteor the same mercy they showed Kiki."AME: Then we're set."Let's not waste any time!"XADRIENN: While we're waiting for the others, there's something I was curious about.":If I was gone for so long, why didn't you replace me?"TSurely if the League was still going, you would have needed a new Fairy Leader."AME: Um, the thing is..." I actually did replace you."EADRIENN: Oh? I'd love to meet the new-- or rather, old-- Leader!"AME: Yeah, about that..."GNobody's seen or heard from him since the incident in Jasper Ward."3It seems pretty likely that he didn't make it."CThen, you came back before I finished arranging a replacement." Nice timing in that regard."CADRIENN: Ah, I'm sorry to have brought up something like that."4ADRIENN: The others should be here soon, right?"|This is a PSA for all Trainers: Please refrain from descending waterfalls in the region without approved Machine usage!"cMany cascades are very tall and riding them downward recklessly may be a severe safety hazard!"Prioritize your health!"+Stay safe until you have that Machine!"6Contact Reborn City staff if you need assistance!"Thank you!"Hello citizens!"YThe City Restoration Project is well underway, but there's still so much left to do!"If you're interested in helping out, please contact one of the administrative staff so we can assign you a project leader.":Tr