 police force before returning to Obsidia."Farewell."JULIA: Rini!!!"?If you're gonna sass me, at least do it with some feeling!";Siiiigh... She hasn't been the same ever since Tania--"Welllll, never mind!"5Thanks for your help today, \PN! You were great!"UAnd now that my Gym isn't gonna randomly blow up, I'm gonna head back there now!"9Although if it did blow up, that might be fun too..."Whatever!"FOnce you feel ready, you should totally come by and challenge me!"#I'll be waiting! Bring coffee!"LILLIPUP: Rrrrrrrrrr..."Lillipup ran away again!"E...So steamed that I lost that last match... Time to make it up!"...Again..."$This time it'll be different..."!We a bit busy here. Move it."Shoo, fly."'Don't waste my time, street trash."Hey, you, kid. C'mere!"#I ain't tryna throw down none."9I'm just lookin' for a bit a somethin', you feel me?"&<- Sunset Circle\n^v - 2nd Street"*<- Blacksteam Street\n^v - 2nd Street")<- Blacksteam Street\n^ - 1st Street"(<- Cinderton Street\nv - 1st Street")<- Mosswater Street\n^v - 2nd Street"BUDEW: Buuu? Bubu! Budew!"9Budew seems attracted by a scent emanating from \PN."\PN caught the Budew!"@Rain, rain, here to stay...~ Wash our broken world away...~"3This would be such a great view of the city...";I only wish that the rest of it was as clean as Lapis."ÖI can see the whole Azurine Region from here! There's Pyrous Mountain, with the smoke rising up, and there's the ashen beach... Ah...",>- Cinderton Street\nv - Crystal Street"Hello, Trainer!"6Can I interest you in buying a pack of Pok√©Snax?"yPok√©Snax are a delicious treat for your Pok√©mon! Feeding your Pok√©mon Pok√©Snax will make them that much happier!"But that's not at all!"|Just by having these delicious, nutritious sweet treats to eat, rare wild Pok√©mon will be more likely to approach you!"GI don't mean random encounters in the grass-- who would want that?"gBut on special occasions, other Pok√©mon that would otherwise shy away might pay attention to you."So what do you say?"Care to buy up some Snax?"fBut on special occasions other Pok√©mon that would otherwise shy away might pay attention to you."2LILLIPUP: Ruff! Ruff! Ruff! Ruff! Ruff! Ruff!"Represent!""That don't represent nothin'."4You gotta carry yourself. It's all in the swag.".<>- Blacksteam Street\n^ - Crystal Street"LI used to love to stare out at the lake, for hours on-- *cough* *cough*" I should get back inside..."0The air quality is getting worse and worse.",Well... I'll wait just a little longer."3???: Listen, I'm only gonna ask one more time."!What do you know about the--"Hey, back off!"$Unless you're with this loser--"SUITED MAN: Excuse me!"???: Hey, what the hell?"Get back here!"???: ...Tch."Faster than he looks."&???: So what's your problem, huh?"#You with that guy? In cahoots?"=Cuz I don't think you know just who you're messing with."Name's Fern."'I'm the cool cat, and the top dog."Got it memorized?"9I don't appreciate you interfering with my business."0You look utterly clueless, so I'll explain."hAs the one sitting at the top of the social hierarchy, it's my responsibility to make a difference."Clean up others' messes,"Make a difference,"#Give people a reason to smile."You get it?"~So how am I supposed to do that if some lowlife loser like you comes along bumbling into my way and jacks everything up?!"YThat was the culprit responsible for the accident at Grandview Station-- no mistake!"1And thanks to you interrupting, he got away!"Get the picture now?"Cuz I don't think you do."Not well enough."Get ready to take notes,"&Cuz you're about to get schooled."Hah! Way to get lucky."FERN: Tch. Whatever." I don't have time for this."@I've gotta go find that guy and cover for your mistake now."???: No need."FERN: Excuse me?"L???: While you two were busy horsing around, I already caught the perp."[???: While you ladies were busy with your little cat fight, I already caught the perp."5Reborn City Official Inspector, at your service." You all can move 