ork alike have been stacking up for her ever since she left."WI swear, someone so irresponsible shouldn't be put in charge of a place like this,"ELet alone have taken on so much work in the city reconstruction."|Or maybe I should just say "deconstruction", considering Julia was placed in charge of the demolition of old buildings."GI swear, that woman doesn't know the meaning of the word "safety"."6Careful, or everything will blow up in your face!"Kaboom!"You're dynamite!"?It's absurd how she allows civilians into the power plant."[I suppose it's the price we pay for saving city space by turning the plant into a Gym." This place is still absurd.">Looking for a Badge? You'll have to get through me first."!All right. Go win your shit."*What are you waitin' around here for?"YEveryone here is so reckless. You know, there are switches to the gates in the back."AThen again, those switches were covered up by Julia herself.";Efficiency is a fine companion to visual presentation."AME: \PN?"3Hey there! So I see you've made it to the Gym."àThis telecom system connects right to the Grand Hall, so no matter where you are, whenever you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway..."9AME: This is your first Gym Battle in Reborn, right?"Reborn's Gym Leaders are a little tougher than other regions'. For instance, every leader has a full team of six Pok√©mon!"YNot only that, but they also use special arenas, or Fields, for tactical advantages."iIf you want to survive in Reborn, you should get used to learning about and playing in these Fields!"HYou may even find ways to turn some opponents' arenas against them!"êAs for Julia, her Electric Field will make all of her same-type attacks even stronger, and add a jolt to some other attacks like her explosions!"kIt's standard fare, but if you have something that can tank Electric attacks, you're almost home free."åFailing that, your best bet is to come in with a full team, and hopefully some high-HP Pok√©mon to take the hits while you whittle her down."âAlso, in case you end up needing a little more training, there should be some trainers here at the Grand Hall who would fight you freely!"Good luck!"7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall..."TWelcome to Neo-Circuit Bowling, how may I make your day explode with happiness."...Sigh, I need a new job."JULIA: Okay-- okay,"4Keep your eyes closed, a little further, and..."JULIA: Open!"FJULIA: We finally got the go-ahead from the Grand Hall, and BOOM!"jAll the machinery's been moved safely downstairs, and they allowed us to rebuild the main area into--"(You guessed it-- a bowling alley!!!"6FLORINIA: I was quite surprised when she told me."-I would not have taken her for a bowler.")JULIA: That's the thing-- I'm not!!!".I've never bowled once in my entire life!"But now!"I can!"Ooh, and-- and!!!"JULIA: The bowling balls--"7If you get a strike, they explode in the end zone!"If you get a GUTTER BALL,"&They explode when they come back!"#ARCHER: ...Is that truly safe?"%MAXWELL: ...Is that really okay?"JULIA: Who knows!")Besides, it was your idea, in a way!"OYou're the one who said I should try to get more enjoyment out of the gym!"=ARCHER: ...I suppose I am nothing if not an entrepeneur."KYou thought I might be doing something like that on that train, right?"KMAXWELL: Heh. Well, if nothing else, it'll be one hell of a spectacle.",FLORINIA: If I may belay your concerns,"\During construction, I took the liberties of arranging a few accommodations for safety."UThe Voltorb have been trained to perform a small Aftermath on gutter balls only."2A token explosion: exciting, but not harmful."As for the end-zone,"D5.4 inch thick reinforced blast-proof titanium for the walls..."0Similar durability on the machine casing..."=Uniquely-furnished resistant polish on the wood lanes..."iEven the paint is specially-ordered to not so much as chip or brown in the face of combustive force."GIt may require a cleaning here or there, but we are built to last