azing Agate Circus!")Featuring carnies, clowns and chaos!".Now with the famed Agate Ace Triumvirate!"oTake the challenge and face off against three Reborn League Leaders in a spectacular showcase smack- down!"Just west of Agate City!":Welcome to the Reborn Nightclub! --ACE MEMBERS ONLY--"6On this day, humanity received a grim reminder..."<I heard a huge noise come from up ahead! What happened?",I'm just relieved that no one was hurt."#Strange attack, in that sense."!Now I can evolve my Machoke!"0W-why would anyone do something like this?!"*OFFICER: Hey, no entry for civilians."?Until we've deemed the area safe, you'll have to back off."aEven if the Grand Stairway is a mess, it's not like anyone could get out of the city anyway.".The Grand Gates haven't opened for years."XDamage report complete! It seems peripheral structures were only damaged minimally.".So this wasn't an accident. Good to know."eYeah. The blast-type was a fairly controlled radius. It's usually used for municipal demolition."#The Stairway looks terrible...";I mean, even worse than it was before it was blown up."KSuch gorgeous, pristine water flowing in from the Carnelian Mountains."cThis waterfall feeds the Azurine Lake, which means all this water is going to be contaminated."bWelcome, come one, come all for the grand unveiling of Silph Co.'s most fabulous new product!",It's the best thing since indoor bread!"5The most convenient thing since sliced plumbing!"CLadies and gentlemen, may I present to you-- the "Link Stone"!"sAre you tired of having to find potentially untrustworthy Trainers to trade your Pok√©mon with to evolve them?"dAre you as heartbroken as your Pok√©mon is when it has to be traded away from you just to grow?"Your worries are over!"QThe Link Stone can force a Pok√©mon to evolve while never leaving your care!"SThe remarkable scientists of Silph Co. have produced this marvelous new Stone,"YInfused with the very energy emitted in a real trade that causes Pok√©mon to evolve!"PThis Link Stone will be hitting stores soon, but you all are a lucky bunch."iRight here, right now, you can get a prototype edition fully-functional Link Stone for just $10,000!"0\GBe the first to try it! What do you say?!"&There you go! One happy customer!"3I'm afraid you can't afford this! Anyone else?"6Suit yourself. Who wants to try it? Don't be shy!"BLook for the Link Stone at the Obsidia Department Store soon!"?FERN: Man, these bitch-ass cops won't even let us through."2Yeah, there was a terrorist threat. I get it."GBut they should be accepting help from the people to deal with it."VIf they could do it on their own, this wouldn't have happened in the first place."MThey're too tripped up on their own power and policies to even see that."=That right there is why the bad guys keep getting away--">Because no one on our side has the backbone to stop them."8I guess they're not ready for people of my caliber."QThere's another gym in the Lapis Ward, so I'm gonna get ready to bust it in."Later, loser."Introducing!"Presenting!"This is pretty cool..."CAIN: There you are!"9As soon as I distract this guy, make a break for it!">I don't know how long I'll be able to keep his attention."You ready?"CAIN: Right on."(CAIN: Man, he's not even that cute."7Well, whatever. Maybe it'll make this work better."CAIN: Hello, excuse me?"-OFFICER: Not right now, son, we're busy."7CAIN: I-- I'm sorry, but I need to report a crime."-OFFICER: What-- with all this happening?"What kinda crime is it?"CAIN: I, uh..."I was struck."(OFFICER: Who did this to you? When?"'CAIN: ...Should I really say here?"!Someone might be watching..."/OFFICER: ...Well, I can't leave this post."Here, step aside with me."?OFFICER: Why don't you tell me exactly what happened, son?"-CAIN: Well, like I said, I was struck..."$...By your stunning good looks~"#OFFICER: I... beg your pardon?"+CAIN: Okay, gotta make sure we're set."1I'll wait until you finally say 'yes' to me~"6Oh! I think I'll get one of these for my Kad