t just been outright demolished?"(<>- Faeward Street\n^v -10th Street"*<>- Shantyport Street\nv -10th Street"(<>- Greycast Street\n^ -10th Street"ADRIENN: I..."This is a joke, right?"/ADRIENN: No... Too elaborate to be a joke."I must be dreaming."@RADOMUS: Were this but a dream, it would be all the easier."Alas, it is not."ADRIENN: I feel sick."@RADOMUS: Steel your nerves for a moment and answer me this:"KThis building has been this way for a long time, yet you are in shock."How is this?">ADRIENN: When I left this morning, it was perfectly fine."None of this--"This whole city--"It's wrong."RADOMUS: As I thought.":Then allow me to tell you what I know about this Gym."~When the city was repopulated after the blackouts and earthquakes, several buildings were designated to remain untouched."eIn general, these were historically-significant facilities that their legacy might be preserved."$This Gym was one such building."%ADRIENN: Blackouts? Earthquakes?"1RADOMUS: This is all unheard of to you, yes?""ADRIENN: I'm really confused."RADOMUS: Understandably.",Then allow me to clarify another thing:"KA moment ago, you said "this morning" that this Gym was normal to you."JEarlier, you said you arrived at the ruin around "an hour" before us."Do I recall correctly?"5ADRIENN: Yes, but I'm... afraid I hardly follow."jRADOMUS: To put it simply, based on your description of this city and your memory of what's happened,"@I believe there is only one conclusion that can be reached:" You've been frozen in time."ADRIENN: I've-- what...?"SRADOMUS: When you fell down into the ruin, as you said, how did you get there?"YADRIENN: I was checking something out in the mechanical hall behind the Grand Gates."Someone reported they had seen some kind of light shining through the floor, so I dismantled part of it and crawled down there."4But when I lost my footing, I fell underground."AFollowing a natural tunnel, I eventually came to that place."{RADOMUS: When you say you were in the G