Read?"v"Corsola is considered Rock- and Water-typed. While not the best combination, it does have some unique strengths."ÑIt is given two very useful defensive Abilities in Natural Cure and Regenerator, along with a host of defensive moves to support it."dRecover, Dual Screens and an assortment of defensive set-up moves give it strong staying power."êUnfortunately, the Coral Pok√©mon is unlikely to see top-tier competitive use any time soon, limited by its relatively low 410 Base Stat Total."""Dusclops, NFE Tank""î"Although outshined offensively by its evolution Dusknoir, Dusclops, an evolution itself of the Ghost- type Duskull, has some new options in combat!"îThanks to the popularization of the item Eviolite, which boosts the defenses of unevolved Pok√©mon, Dusclops is able to function as a supreme stall."òWith defenses reaching in the 500's, Will-O-Wisp and Pain Split for staying power, it's going to take a good strong Ghost or Dark attack to KO Dusclops."QFor other move options, consider Shadow Sneak, Night Shade, or Confuse Ray!""Locked.""Ivyline Station""sStudents always get on teachers for assigning homework, but those little brats only have to do one assignment."I have to grade ninety!"1Fern's gonna get you back one of these days."Yes"No[,"FERN: \PN."IA little birdie told me you were coming here to challenge my sister."1And I also heard something else interesting."MApparently she brought you along to clean up that whole mess in Obsidia?"	You."I'm forced to ask myself,"	Why?",You and I were both there at Mosswater."0Why did you get invited to that and not me?"AAnd that incompetent girl who went and got herself captured?"3Maybe if I were there, she still would be too."!So here's what I think, \PN."0I think you don't deserve to challenge her."$I think you're not good enough."!So I'm not going to let you."4Trey, go tell the other kids not to let \PN in."*Skye, go hit the switch for the gate."8Maybe you don't understand why I'm doing this, \PN."=It's