 like three times better just from Fern alone leaving."ÇNow that he and his cronies aren't pushing everyone around with their stupid popularity gimmick, the atmosphere is SO much better."So you're the brat, huh?"SUCH a brat."Do whatever."$You're the one the boss wanted!"...Boss."3So we're just not gonna talk about this, okay?"/"All about Huntail, the Deep Sea Pok√©mon""
Read?"U"National Dex Number 367, Huntail is a unique species in terms of its evolution."âIts pre-evolution, Clamperl, may become either Huntail or its sister species, Gorebyss, depending on what item is held when it is traded."äHuntail retains different strengths than Gorebyss however, such as a more physically-based movepool to compliment its boosted Attack stat."áAdditionally, whereas Gorebyss' natural movepool takes on a Psychic pseudo-type, Huntail's could be said to follow that of a Dark-type."zRegardless, Huntail remains a fascinating contrast from a scientific standpoint on the impact of items on evolution.""""Pok√©mon by Base Stat Total""ô"Total: 300: Bagon, Baltoy, Beldum, Bellsprout, Bronzor, Croagunk, Deino, Dratini, Geodude, Gible, Klink, Larvitar, Minccino, Pikachu, Poliwag, Remoraid,""Sandshrew, Snorunt, Snubbull."Total: 302: Gulpin"Total: 303: Golett, Yamask"ÖTotal: 305: Carvanha, Cubchoo, Ducklett, Ferroseed, Machop, Mankey, Numel, Shellder, Shelmet, Smoochum, Timburr, Vanillite, Venonat.""+...the rest of the pages are torn out.""Discharge vs Lava Plume""k"Discharge and Lava Plume, both attacks discovered during the Gen IV era, possess very similar traits."éEach one has 100% Accuracy, 80 Base Power, and affect all adjacent opponents on the field. They also both have a 30% chance to inflict status."êHowever, whereas Discharge is Electric-type, Lava Plume is Fire. Accordingly, they inflict different statuses- Paralysis and Burn, respectively."{Also notable, whereas Discharge is learned by a wide variety of Pok√©mon, only fifteen Pok√©mon can learn Lava Plume."""Calculating Total Power""H"There are three factors in determining the end power of an attack."qFirstly, the Base Power of the move. Let's take the move Confusion for example. Confusion has 50 Base Power."ÜNext, apply the multiplier based on type effectiveness. If Confusion is used on a Mankey, a Fighting-type, it will be Super Effective."êTherefore, the power is doubled to 100. If it were used on a Croagunk, for instance, it would be effective twice, and would double again to 200."ÉFinally, factor in the Same Type Attack Bonus, or STAB for short. This is a bonus for if a Pok√©mon uses an attack of its own type."ÅIn other words, a Confusion attack from a Kadabra will be stronger than the same attack from Venonat, because Kadabra is Psychic."óIt will be 1.5 times more effective. So if Venonat uses Confusion on Croagunk, the total power is 200. If Kadabra uses it, then the total power is 300."!And it's as simple as that!""IYou should check out the books in this school! They're a great read!"DHey, wow, you're that Trainer who swept Fern out before, right?"PAnd fought to save the city, but let's be honest, Fern's more of a problem."1Hey! You're challenging Ms. Florinia, right?"oI got something you can't get anywhere else around here, I think it might help you out. Wanna take a look?"4Headmistress Florinia should be back soon, yes?"|Although her administrative duties at the school have been covered, the city council is waiting on several updates from her."ìShe volunteered to undertake the lion's share of resource management and accounting to make sure everyone working in the city had what they needed."^Between that and leading students in community service, she has been an invaluable asset."tBut without those reports, many of our work groups won't know how far we can proceed within the current budget.",Hmm. Nothing to do but wait, I suppose."WI've been studying up on the Field Seeds that have been growing around the region."]I read that in Alola, there's four types of Seeds for Electric, Grass, Mist and Psychic,">But the Seeds that grow in Reborn are entirely different!"EThere's four types: Elemental, Magical, Telluric, and Synthetic."iApparently, each of them has different effects depending on the type of terrain that activates them!""But they do have limitations."cEach terrain can only activate one type, and they can only be used once before they disappear."HIt seems like I'll have to study harder to learn all their effects."5Why don't you try this out and see for yourself?"YThe Seeds that grow in Reborn are entirely different from the ones in other regions!"2Oh, you're the one who beat Florinia, right?!"#What'd you do to finally win?!"AI keep trying, but I've never been able to actually do it..."NTell me the secret to beating her and I'll tell you a secret in return..."..."&Whaaaat, that's how you beat her?"-I don't even have any of those Pok√©mon!"'Sigh... Whatever, a deal's a deal."Here's the secret!"Don't tell anyone!"No fair!!!"/Stop hogging your victory all to yourself!"<If you're here, that means you're down to fight, right?""Down in the dumps, more like."You'll be fine already."Yes"No[Z","Central Hall Lower Gate-- Unlocking..."Unlocked.""*This is the top school in the region."^That's amazing, considering the current acting principal is only a graduate of two years."JHey, have you heard about that Trainer? They're all the rage, lately."fThey say a young Trainer named \PN has been sweeping through Reborn, solving problems everywhere!"ISupposedly they're handsome like a prince, but elegant like a queen!";And they have five hundred Pok√©mon, all at max level!"4And some even say they have telekinetic powers!"/I'd sure like to meet that person someday."dFlorinia may not have the best social skills, but she knows how to get things done around here."cI'll tell you what, this school has been like three times better just from Fern alone leaving."ÇNow that he and his cronies aren't pushing everyone around with their stupid popularity gimmick, the atmosphere is SO much better."So you're the brat, huh?"SUCH a brat."Do whatever."$You're the one the boss wanted!"...Boss."3So we're just not gonna talk about this, okay?"/"All about Huntail, the Deep Sea Pok√©mon""
