Read?"G"Togekiss learn set"... "Extreme Speed, Aura Sphere, Air Slash"..."N... "Fire Blast, Aerial Ace, Facade" ... "Swagger, Pluck, Substitute" ..."P... "Magical Leaf, Charm, Growl" ... "Safeguard, Baton Pass, After You" ..."X... "Focus Punch, Water Pulse, Shock Wave" ... "Swift, Ancient Power, Endeavor" ..."...The rest is illegible."%"Study notes: Ninjask Stat Caps"""Maximum levels:"HP: 326\nAtk: 306 Def: 207")Sp.Atk: 218\nSp.Def: 218 Speed: 460""/"All about Beartic, the Freezing Pok√©mon""Å"Evolving from Cubchoo at level 37, Beartic is a unique Pok√©mon whose Abilities allow it to thrive in multiple kinds of weather."rIts Snow Cloak Ability, one of the precious few hail- dependent tactics, grants it extra Evasion in the snow."}On the other hand, it's one of only two non-Water- types to get the Swift Swim Ability, augmenting its lackluster Speed."~Because of its unique typing with Swift Swim, Beartic is a great addition to any rain team looking to balance out their types."eNevertheless, Beartic's most notable claim to fame must be its access to the ability Slush Rush."ôThe best of both worlds among its other Abilities, doubling Speed and making strong use of Hail's full potential, Beartic can become a fantastic sweeper."|Those looking to run Ice- and Hail-themed teams should absolutely consider adopting this majestic Pok√©mon for their ranks!""eNevertheless, Beartic's most notable claim to fame must be its access to the Ability Slush Rush."""Study notes: Beat Up Attack""ãBeat Up is a unique move. This Dark-type attack inflicts damage multiple times based on the number of healthy Pok√©mon in the user's party."ÑFor instance, with four Pok√©mon, it will attack four times. However, the power of each hit is always dependent on the user's stats."íThe power of each hit is determined by taking the Attack stat of the user, ignoring any boosts, dividing it by ten, and adding five to the result.";Naturally, a high-Attack Dark-type is best to use it.""1"All about Honchkrow, the Big Boss Pok√©mon""u"Honchkrow, like its pre-evolution Murkrow, is a Dark/Flying-type, obtained by applying a Dusk Stone to Murkrow."IIts Abilities include Insomnia, Super Luck, and most notably, Moxie."èHonchkrow is a great abuser of the move Sucker Punch, and proper timing combined with the Moxie Ability can make Honchkrow a devastating force."âHowever, by evolving into Honchkrow, a Trainer could miss out on Murkrow's super-utile Prankster Ability, so make sure to choose wisely!""àHowever, by evolving into Honchkrow, a Trainer could miss out on Murkrow's super-utile Prankster Ability, so make sure to choose wisely!"2"Study notes: Answers to Ms. Belatry's final"""1- C\n2- A 3- C"4- B\n5- B 6- D""...">Somebody could get in a lot of trouble if this was found."H-hey, back off!"4You trying to peek in on my Mr. Mimecraft game?"No way, buddy!"I got here first!"9I'm putting off studying, and having a helluva time!"UOnly way you could ever convince me to move is helping me find somethin' better!"2Hey, back off while I'm playing my game, man!"!Only way I'll ever move is--"	Huh?"4There's a cave with a bunch of mining rocks...?""Under the North Obsidia Ward?"2Just like Mr. Mimecraft-- but like, actually!"&Gonna mine some diamonds, y'know?"XThere's, uh... something wrong with the computer now, anyways. I dunno what I did--""Well, not my problem anymore!"&Peace, homie! Thanks for the tip!"Yes"No[L"Stupid!"Stupid, stupid!"[I finally just earned the points I needed and then the Onyx Arcade's system goes down!"GStupid, stupid, stupid! I quit! I'm done! I can't do this anymore!"!Hey. Hey you, you know what?"7Take this! I won't need it anymore. I'm moving on."Stupid..."Stupid arcades..."WI don't care if and when they're back up. I'm using this to quit once and for all."LThe computer is glitching out. It doesn't seem to respond to any input.":There's a port for a chip on the side of the monitor."\PN used the Data Chip!"%VIR#16872067893@58ffffff88911010"$