onchkrow, the Big Boss Pok√©mon""u"Honchkrow, like its pre-evolution Murkrow, is a Dark/Flying-type, obtained by applying a Dusk Stone to Murkrow."IIts Abilities include Insomnia, Super Luck, and most notably, Moxie."èHonchkrow is a great abuser of the move Sucker Punch, and proper timing combined with the Moxie Ability can make Honchkrow a devastating force."âHowever, by evolving into Honchkrow, a Trainer could miss out on Murkrow's super-utile Prankster Ability, so make sure to choose wisely!""àHowever, by evolving into Honchkrow, a Trainer could miss out on Murkrow's super-utile Prankster Ability, so make sure to choose wisely!"2"Study notes: Answers to Ms. Belatry's final"""1- C\n2- A 3- C"4- B\n5- B 6- D""...">Somebody could get in a lot of trouble if this was found."H-hey, back off!"4You trying to peek in on my Mr. Mimecraft game?"No way, buddy!"I got here first!"9I'm putting off studying, and having a helluva time!"UOnly way you could ever convince me to move is helping me find somethin' better!"2Hey, back off while I'm playing my game, man!"!Only way I'll ever move is--"	Huh?"4There's a cave with a bunch of mining rocks...?""Under the North Obsidia Ward?"2Just like Mr. Mimecraft-- but like, actually!"&Gonna mine some diamonds, y'know?"XThere's, uh... something wrong with the computer now, anyways. I dunno what I did--""Well, not my problem anymore!"&Peace, homie! Thanks for the tip!"Yes"No;[L"Stupid!"Stupid, stupid!"[I finally just earned the points I needed and then the Onyx Arcade's system goes down!"GStupid, stupid, stupid! I quit! I'm done! I can't do this anymore!"!Hey. Hey you, you know what?"7Take this! I won't need it anymore. I'm moving on."Stupid..."Stupid arcades..."WI don't care if and when they're back up. I'm using this to quit once and for all."LThe computer is glitching out. It doesn't seem to respond to any input.":There's a port for a chip on the side of the monitor."\PN used the Data Chip!"%VIR#16872067893@58ffffff8891101