Read?"G"Togekiss learn set"... "Extreme Speed, Aura Sphere, Air Slash"..."N... "Fire Blast, Aerial Ace, Facade" ... "Swagger, Pluck, Substitute" ..."P... "Magical Leaf, Charm, Growl" ... "Safeguard, Baton Pass, After You" ..."X... "Focus Punch, Water Pulse, Shock Wave" ... "Swift, Ancient Power, Endeavor" ..."...The rest is illegible."%"Study notes: Ninjask Stat Caps"""Maximum levels:"HP: 326\nAtk: 306 Def: 207")Sp.Atk: 218\nSp.Def: 218 Speed: 460""/"All about Beartic, the Freezing Pok√©mon""Å"Evolving from Cubchoo at level 37, Beartic is a unique Pok√©mon whose Abilities allow it to thrive in multiple kinds of weather."rIts Snow Cloak Ability, one of the precious few hail- dependent tactics, grants it extra Evasion in the snow."}On the other hand, it's one of only two non-Water- types to get the Swift Swim Ability, augmenting its lackluster Speed."~Because of its unique typing with Swift Swim, Beartic is a great addition to any rain team looking to balance out their types."eNevertheless, Beartic's most notable claim to fame must be its access to the ability Slush Rush."ôThe best of both worlds among its other Abilities, doubling Speed and making strong use of Hail's full potential, Beartic can become a fantastic sweeper."|Those looking to run Ice- and Hail-themed teams should absolutely consider adopting this majestic Pok√©mon for their ranks!""eNevertheless, Beartic's most notable claim to fame must be its access to the Ability Slush Rush."""Study notes: Beat Up Attack""ãBeat Up is a unique move. This Dark-type attack inflicts damage multiple times based on the number of healthy Pok√©mon in the user's party."ÑFor instance, with four Pok√©mon, it will attack four times. However, the power of each hit is always dependent on the user's stats."íThe power of each hit is determined by taking the Attack stat of the user, ignoring any boosts, dividing it by ten, and adding five to the result.";Naturally, a high-Attack Dark-type is best to use it.""1"All about Honchkrow, the Big Boss Pok√©mon""u"Honchkrow, like its pre-evolution Murkrow, is a Dark/Flying-type, obtained by applying a Dusk Stone to Murkrow."IIts Abilities include Insomnia, Super Luck, and most notably, Moxie."èHonchkrow is a great abuser of the move Sucker Punch, and proper timing combined with the Moxie Ability can make Honchkrow a devastating force."âHowever, by evolving into Honchkrow, a Trainer could miss out on Murkrow's super-utile Prankster Ability, so make sure to choose wisely!""àHowever, by evolving into Honchkrow, a Trainer could miss out on Murkrow's super-utile Prankster Ability, so make sure to choose wisely!"2"Study notes: Answers to Ms. Belatry's final"""1- C\n2- A 3- C"4- B\n5- B 6- D""...">Somebody could get in a lot of trouble if this was found."H-hey, back off!"4You trying to peek in on my Mr. Mimecraft game?"No way, buddy!"I got here first!"9I'm putting off studying, and having a helluva time!"UOnly way you could ever convince me to move is helping me find somethin' better!"2Hey, back off while I'm playing my game, man!"!Only way I'll ever move is--"	Huh?"4There's a cave with a bunch of mining rocks...?""Under the North Obsidia Ward?"2Just like Mr. Mimecraft-- but like, actually!"&Gonna mine some diamonds, y'know?"XThere's, uh... something wrong with the computer now, anyways. I dunno what I did--""Well, not my problem anymore!"&Peace, homie! Thanks for the tip!"Yes"NoIu;␀`B[[≥"$"Study notes: Never-miss moves""
Read?"e"In total, there are thirteen damaging moves that have the effect of never missing their attack."àThese moves are Swift, Aerial Ace, Magnet Bomb, Magical Leaf, Aura Sphere, Feint Attack, Shadow Punch, Hyperspace Fury, Hyperspace Hole,"JClear Smog, Shock Wave, Trump Card, Vital Throw and Disarming Voice.""""The Personal Diary of Julia""!Should you really read this?"7"Soooo something superduperly cool happened today~"\I. Made. Cheerleading Captain! Many booms were had! But I feel bad... Hey, that rhymes~"(Maybe I can work that into a cheer."õAnyway, I feel bad, cuz Amy had to give up her spot, orrrr well, she didn't HAVE to, but she did. Buuuut, she recommended that I take her place, and I did!"VAmy was such a great captain, though~ I can't understand why she wanted to leave."âAnd then afterwards, I wanted to go out to celebrate, but Tania and Amy were hanging out in their room like usual, so it was just Rini..."ÜAnd of course, Rini never wants to go anywhere, because she's too shy and all 'social interaction is not a productive blahblahblah'..."So here I am. Mrrrrrrrr."8I think I'll just go to sleep... Nightsies, diary!""%"The Personal Diary of Florinia"""Dear Diary,"!This will be my final entry."GThe retention of emotions has proven veritably counter-productive."SIrrational thoughts and feelings remain a severe detriment to work efficiency."XMoreover, they appear to invariably breed scorn in those with whom they are shared."RThis writer has lost much on behalf of these turbulent confounding variables."fEmotional excision has thereby been deemed necessary, beginning with the termination of archival."Farewell.""$"The Personal Diary of Titania""C"So, you think it's cool to go reading other people's diaries."THoping you'll find dirt on me here? Or maybe some weeping emotional confession?"{A little piece of advice: If you want to get to know someone, go talk to them. Don't creep around their private files."SBut if this is the kind of person you are, don't bother trying to talk to me.""#"The Personal Diary of Amaria"""I don't know, diary."9I know I have everything a girl could possibly want."NI have lots of friends, an amazing partner, a great education and life..."$...But it doesn't feel like it.")I try to always smile and be cheery."XI'm very good at it, apparently, or else I might not have made cheerleader captain!"OI guess I was secretly hoping that would make me happy on the inside, too." But I guess that was naive."#I'm tired of feeling this way."3I'm tired of feeling like I'm always drowning."MTania tries her best for me, I know that. And I appreciate it so much..."4But in the end, will it even make a difference?"EI'll see you in meaningless tomorrow, with another false smile."""On Fairytales""g"History and literature have an awful habit of letting little girls wander past the forest's edge,"BOnly to be swallowed up by any number of enchantments beyond."She awakens in a tower,"Stone,"
Cold,"Alone."7A dragon guards her, its fangs bared to the world,"êBrimstone breath faithfully reserved for whatever metal-clad ignoramus thinks himself so mighty that even fire may not char his miserable flesh."2But there is only one who can slay the beast:")The one to whom its back is turned.""What up, BIATCH."1I'm the most LEARNINGEST bro in these parts."9I can give you some HOT LEARNS if you have the cash."Check out my SKILLS, yo."VOh yeah, oh yeah. No one's gonna hurt you with this, here. That'll run you $1000."-Yo, you gotta HAVE the money first, bro."QOh, man, you feel that POWER? You're only gonna get that from this guy here."a$500 and I got you. But, hey, if you sleep in class, don't tell teach it came from me, yeah?"ZThis is the big money, yeah? Grab 'em, don't let 'em go. And I only want $500 for it."WYeah, that hate, that rage, I see you feel that. So I'll pop you a discount: $250."Later, BIATCH."Oh, hold up."aI don't know if you know how we do things in these parts, but you only gotta pay once. Ever."lThe way we see it, you got us covered for a move, right? And, y'know, maybe you forget it or something."So no one here is gonna double charge you. And by "here" I mean the whole city. Or anywhere else that does something like this."Sound good?"I'll see you."-Hi, you! I'm one of the top in my class!"2I happen to do a little tutoring on the side."/Maybe I've got something that'll help you!"$Any of these sound good to you?"Snatch will run you $500."uIt looks like you're a little short on money, though. No problem if you need to run and get some-- I'll be here."2All done! Just come back if you forget, okay?"&I'll teach Helping Hand for $500!"Ally Switch will be $250."#I'll teach After You for $250."êHey, before you go-- I usually say to come back if you forget, but I wanted to make sure you knew that applies to everyone you learn moves from."BIt's just kind of a thing that we do here. In Reborn, I mean."LYou seem like you're new to these parts, so I thought I'd let you know."BYou know where to find me if you want to learn anything else!"	Hey."Did you know that, like..."Magic is, like...."
