000 for this service."4The joy of knowledge-- shared! Truly priceless."UTrainer! I do not wish to hold you, but before you depart, I must say something."^I am always available to converse once more with one who I have passed my knowledge onto."bHowever, you will find that this is true even for those who do not share my love of learning!"èShould you engage in such tutoring with anyone in the region, you will find that their services will be available to you after one transaction!"\Please remember this when engaging in a similar arrangement with others in this region."5Please return if there is more that I can share!".Uggggggggh, those Lapis trustfund babies!"You know what I mean?!"hEven if you somehow finally manage to get a leg up on their specially-tutored 5 IV bred Pok√©mon..."M...Then they just throw one of their five-bajillion Full Restores at it!")There's no winning against classism."6We little people gotta take the W's where we can."SFor instance, if someone asked me for a password, you know what I'd tell them?"I'd tell them "stopitems"."rThat way, no enemy I ever face would ever be able to use a stupid Potion on their stupid Pok√©mon ever again!"Yes"No"Iron Defense"
