asant circumstance, but he has strictly forbidden them from being harmed."They'll be safe."BAMARIA: The more pressing matter is the safety of the people."8Those PULSE Tangrowth machines ruined entire wards!"AIf there's another one in the city, we can't just ignore it!"ACE: Reasonable."4The factory it's housed in isn't far from here."3If you'd like, I can show you how to break in."&AMARIA: Let's not waste any time."*All of us together-- are you with me?"1ACE: I'm happy to be the Ace up your sleeve~"JBesides, I have some questions of my own I'd like to get answers for."CAIN: I'm worried, but..."Let's do it."MThe sooner we shut down those PULSEs, the sooner we can save the others."-ACE: Then let's reconvene at Blacksteam!"UIt's the factory nearest here, just a jaunt down the stairs and off to the side."Bring your Ace-game~"Yes"No["DGreetings, I am the Chief of the Reborn City Police Department."wAlthough civilian affairs are of the highest importance to me, I'm afraid I cannot take any requests at this time."pOur police force is already highly overextended, and I'm afraid we cannot spare the manpower at the moment."7Especially with more turning up missing every day."1OFFICER: Reporting for next assignment, sir!"-OFFICER: Oh! You're-- I heard about you!"RI was stationed outside of Obsidia when Florinia asked for you to go through."DAnd weren't you the one who eventually ended up saving Obsidia?"1CHIEF: Eh? You're saying it was this person?"LOFFICER: I'm sure of it! Gym Leader Florinia said that they'd help out."CHIEF: Is that so?"FOFFICER: Hey, have you come to the Jasper Ward to help here, too?"CHIEF: Hmm..."_Being that they are not officially enlisted, I cannot require others to act on any orders."[However, civilian, I will afford you special permission to move freely about the area."#In return, I do ask one favor."IAs I mentioned, more and more of our force turn up missing each day."vCurrently, we have five officers unaccounted for, known previously to be