asant circumstance, but he has strictly forbidden them from being harmed."They'll be safe."BAMARIA: The more pressing matter is the safety of the people."8Those PULSE Tangrowth machines ruined entire wards!"AIf there's another one in the city, we can't just ignore it!"ACE: Reasonable."4The factory it's housed in isn't far from here."3If you'd like, I can show you how to break in."&AMARIA: Let's not waste any time."*All of us together-- are you with me?"1ACE: I'm happy to be the Ace up your sleeve~"JBesides, I have some questions of my own I'd like to get answers for."CAIN: I'm worried, but..."Let's do it."MThe sooner we shut down those PULSEs, the sooner we can save the others."-ACE: Then let's reconvene at Blacksteam!"UIt's the factory nearest here, just a jaunt down the stairs and off to the side."Bring your Ace-game~"Yes"No;["DGreetings, I am the Chief of the Reborn City Police Department."wAlthough civilian affairs are of the highest importance to me, I'm afraid I cannot take any requests at this time."pOur police force is already highly overextended, and I'm afraid we cannot spare the manpower at the moment."7Especially with more turning up missing every day."1OFFICER: Reporting for next assignment, sir!"-OFFICER: Oh! You're-- I heard about you!"RI was stationed outside of Obsidia when Florinia asked for you to go through."DAnd weren't you the one who eventually ended up saving Obsidia?"1CHIEF: Eh? You're saying it was this person?"LOFFICER: I'm sure of it! Gym Leader Florinia said that they'd help out."CHIEF: Is that so?"FOFFICER: Hey, have you come to the Jasper Ward to help here, too?"CHIEF: Hmm..."_Being that they are not officially enlisted, I cannot require others to act on any orders."[However, civilian, I will afford you special permission to move freely about the area."#In return, I do ask one favor."IAs I mentioned, more and more of our force turn up missing each day."vCurrently, we have five officers unaccounted for, known previously to be searching in the Jasper and Beryl Wards."SIf you happen to find them, please send them back, or let us know immediately."Thank you."AOfficer, stand by. I'll have new orders for you momentarily."OFFICER: Yes, sir."/CHIEF: Good luck. I do hope you find them."?CHIEF: Two have returned now. But three are still missing."8CHIEF: You found one! But we're still missing four."\CHIEF: Three are back! Are things finally starting to look up? Well, there's still two.".CHIEF: Ah! There's only one more to find!"TCHIEF: By Jove, kid, you've done it! You found our entire missing police force!"DWell, there is the matter of the officer who died in service..."*You found his Growlithe, did you not?"çLike in many other regions, all of our officers are issued Growlithe as partner Pok√©mon. But now that its Trainer is gone, that Growlithe..."wI would feel it an insult to the memory of my former officer to simply give that Growlithe to another new recruit."àIt may be difficult to understand, but if you would, please feel free to take Growlithe with you. You were the one to find it after all."/And after everything you've done for us...")Consider it a token of appreciation."HYou're now an honorary member of the Reborn City Police Department!"èCHIEF: It may be difficult to understand, but if you would, please feel free to take Growlithe with you. You were the one to find it after all."TAnd after everything you've done for us... Consider it a token of appreciation."TCHIEF: Back in full force, the Reborn City Police Department is ready to serve!" CHIEF: Greetings, civilian!"NWith everyone's help and new volunteers, our force is back at full power!"FIf anything is troubling you, please don't hesitate to inform us."MWe are committed to keeping this city a peaceful place once and for all!"HAhh, so you're interested in that "Corin-Rouge" character, are you?"(He's a confounding one, to be sure."åHe is a flashy individual, but skilled at hiding and get- aways, so we've tracked much of his movement, though never been able to catch him."jNow that we've got many other obstacles out of the way, we've already begun to turn a focus onto him."OIf you'd like to take vanguard in the operation, it would be a great help!"Here's the situation:"JWe've received an increasing number of reports about his whereabouts."`That is, the numbers are so fast-increasing, it puts him in three different places at once!"uThe reports all came in around the same time, but for wildly different places. I'd like you to investigate them."2First, he was sighted around Malchous Forest."FA moment later, we heard he was on a small islet in Azurine Lake."]Finally, an officer reportedly saw him around the same time at Sunset Circle in Peridot."iMost of our officers are still occupied on the multitude of other tasks, so I shall leave it to you!".CHIEF: Good to see you again, old friend!"YThanks to your efforts, the Reborn City Police Department is back at full operation!"dIf you'd like to take vanguard in the operation, I'm sure we could catch him in no time at all!"rMost of our officers are still occupied on the multitude of other tasks, so I shall entrust this task to you."!CHIEF: Here's the situation:"KWe've received an increasing number of reports about his where-abouts.";Please investigate the areas and try to apprehend him!""CHIEF: Well? How has it gone?"3Hrm, so the three sightings were all decoys..."That crafty Corin..."$So the clues you gathered were:"0"Find him in the place where mists settle!""0"Find him in a place where Trainers fight!""2And "Find him buried in a pocket of peonies!""6How cryptic... Can you crack this caper, Trainer?"&I leave it in your capable hands."5What?! The Corin at the riddle was a decoy too?!"That sneaky Seviper..."7So one of the suspected clones was the real Corin!"]The one at Malchous Forest, the one at Sunset Circle, and the one around Azurine Lake..."eIf he was trying to buy time, he would probably choose the place that had the best escape route."You have to hurry, \PN!"-CHIEF: Any news on the Corin-Rouge case?"..."'So he was able to flee the city..."'I see. Then it's out of our hands.".Well, don't feel too bad about it, sport."!You did well in finding him."WAnd one way or another, he's gone, so he won't be hurting anyone here for a while."/Still... I suspect he won't stray too far."qHe knows this area like the back of his hand, meaning he'll probably come back after laying low for a while.")Considering the direction he took..."/There might still be a chance to find him."6Of course, the one most suited to the job is you."EJust make sure to drag him back here so we can lock the lout up!"Ah, I know!"eIf you're going to chase him north into the Tourmaline Desert, maybe these can help protect you." CHIEF: Good luck out there!"6CHIEF: I suspect Corin-Rouge won't stray too far."CHIEF: Ho, there!"@That knave Corin-Rouge seems to have had a change of heart!"=He just showed up one day and held out his hands for us!"9Didn't speak a word or even make direct eye contact.":I don't suppose you know anything about all that, eh?"GROWLITHE: Grrowrrr..."GROWLITHE: Growrithe!"}Let's see... If I remember right, we had two officers stationed in Jasper, and three in Beryl, all of whom went missing."!So that's everything. Right."'Let's get this city back on track."*Thanks for helping me out back there!"6OFFICER: Hey, you see the guy across the counter?"pHe's been feeling really down ever since Team Meteor stole his Growlithe. I wanna do something to help him."lI know the Chief won't give him the spare Growlithe that we had, but I think there's a way around that."NWould you be willing to breed that Growlithe and give me one of the Eggs?"6OFFICER: No, no. It's a lot to ask, I understand."+OFFICER: You'll really give it to him?"LThank you so much! I'm sure this will really make a difference for him!"]Say, I picked up an abandoned Egg a while ago and I've been holding onto it for a while."QCouldn't tell you what'll come of it, but why don't you take that in return?"4\PN traded the GROWLITHE EGG for a MYSTERY EGG!"KOFFICER: ...Huh, doesn't this egg look a little different than normal?"AI mean, if you say it's a Growlithe I'll believe you though."9Thank you, truly, for everything you've done for us!"AOFFICER: Thank you for everything you've done for us, truly."VOnce that Growlithe hatches, I hope he sees he never has to be without a partner."I'm so glad you found me.",Now if only there weren't more missing."6Now maybe things can start moving back to normal.")I'm so glad to be out of that place."Ah, hello again!"UWhen the city restoration began, lots of people stepped up to train as officers."iSeems like it just took a little push to get people to take this city's safety into their own hands!"#Hey, you wanna know something?"YRemember when you were fighting that Meteor who had cornered me? He had a Growlithe."9That was actually my Growlithe that he took from me."|What's more, we had that spare Growlithe from the officer we lost, but... The chief decided to give it to you instead of me."How annoying..."UI can hardly believe it myself, but my buddy there just gave me a Growlithe Egg!"oI mean, it's not the same one I had before... But I'm really looking forward to raising my partner myself."@Maybe someday we'll be able to bring that thief to justice."Hello again!"VBut between my Growlithe and I, I'm sure we could handle it all ourselves anyway!"Phew..."GROWLITHE: Row..."TGrowlithe is looking at you obediently. Do you want to take Growlithe with you?"GROWLITHE: Rithe..."NI was hoping things might slow down after the recent busts and recoops..."RBut the bomb, a suicide, a desperate call from the orphanage of all places..."Looks like more overtime."AMARIA: \PN?"#Cain was just looking for you!""CAIN: No luck; I can't find--"...Hi, \PN!".CAIN: You are such a sight for sore eyes."CAIN: I found him!"CAIN: I found her!"CAIN: I found them!"CAIN: Any progress?"AMARIA: Not yet..."/So I'm glad a