owever, I don't exactly have a better idea."I'll keep researching."9If I find out anything of use, you'll hear about it."tEVE: Heather has been circling the tree looking for another way in nearly nonstop since she brought you down..."QIt's a good thing we brought food with us, or I'd be worried for her health."/EVE: It seems Shelly's theory was correct?"bI'm relieved, though I can't say I understand the mechanics on any kind of technical level..."|Then again, I suppose I should know better by now than to expect everything to have a perfect, technical explanation anyway."(It seems people always surprise me."It's nice."SHELLY: Hi, \PN!"I'm glad you came!"<Just in time, too! It took forever to find a good spot!"_We're just getting set up now, but-- just give me a bit and I'll get a plate for you, too!"OSHELLY: Wait, yeah, we totally can't start eating until we get the drinks!"4Like-- like that's just how drinks work, right?")Laura said it was a surprise anyhow!"HEATHER: Hi, \PN!"'Nice to see another familiar face."PLaura invited us all here, and I was like, "Okay, I'll come to your picnic,"	BUT,"You have to battle me!"";We were gonna see who the stronger Elite 4 member was!"`(And it was gonna be ME, cuz I have the type advantage and that's definitely not cheating!)"(But then she couldn't even make it!"%So now this is kind of a bummer."KI mean, food and picnics are nice and all, but where's the fun stuff?!"cI'd challenge you to a rematch here and now, but I don't wanna mess up the picnic blanket now."1I just wish something exciting would happen!"LHEATHER: But after this, you're gonna run through Charous again, right?"$I'm always down to take you on!",HEATHER: Okay, I'm going back for Noel!" Fixtheproblemokaythanksbye!"-LUMI: Wait, what was that? Where's Noel?"He stayed at the top?!"What is he thinking?!"9EVE: Trying to rescue him on foot is likely a waste."aA barrier has appeared at the entrance of the tree as well, so we can't even get in anymore."DWhatever th