o your enemies?"3AMARIA: I prefer to think of it as compassion."Get going already!"BOREALIS: Fine!"VSHELLY: I wonder if there's someone who could help you get a Zygarde like that..."Hmm..."*Maybe I need to do some more reading.",NOEL: I don't know what I'm doing here."=Lumi asked me to come, but I don't understand the point."<Even if you eat outdoors, the food isn't better, right?"It just attracts bugs."YNOEL: If you don't want to go get the pickup order, I can be a delivery boy instead."LUMI: \PN, you came!"(I was hoping you'd get our message!"DLaura was the one who suggested we all have a tea party picnic!"NAnd she was gonna come too, but then something came up with her sisters--"^So we had some spare food, and we thought, "\PN's helped us all with a lot, so why not?!""[This can also be our small way of saying thanks for helping with all the stuff before!"K...Hm, I can't help but feel like we're forgetting something though..."LUMI: WAIT!""I figured out what we forgot!"çLaura put in a special order to The Spyce just for our picnic and I totally forgot to pick it up when we were heading out from the Nightclub!"M\PN, I'm so sorry for the fetch quest, but can you go pick it up for us?"LJust say Laura's name and the clerk at The Spyce should get it for you!"ìLUMI: Laura put in a special order to The Spyce just for our picnic and I totally forgot to pick it up when we were heading out from the Nightclub!")LUMI: \PN, you're back just in time!"JJust as soon as you left, this weird aura started affecting the area!"ãShelly thought she noticed some Pok√©mon burrowing away, so she went to try and find a way underground and see what they were running from,"xAnd the source of the aura seemed to be centered on the tree, so Heather flew up to see if anything was at the top,"=And then all of the sudden that New World Door appeared."But why here?!"Why now?!"/We were supposed to be having a nice time!"TOne of my friends taught me a word that is VERY good for situations like these!"But I will not say it!!!"	YET."]Anyway, the two are obviously connected, so Noel and Eve went inside to go check it out."bHEATHER: Update-- there's some kind of weird barrier all around parts of the top of the tree!"5So obviously, I'm gonna try to break through it!"Back in a bit!"'LUMI: That sounds like a bad idea!"Good luck!"àLUMI: Well anyway, if you ask me, this whole thing is very rude and unfair, and I would like to have a word with whoever is responsible!"XLUMI: I told the others I'd stay out here to make sure things didn't get any worse,"ZBut it might be worth checking on Shelly underground, or following the others inside!")I'm glad we ended up inviting you..."9After all, there's no better person to resolve this!"<LUMI: As soon as you get a 100% Zygarde, bring it here!"6We'll use it to bust down the door and save Noel!"4He deserves better than to be trapped up there!"<...Even if he did kind of do it to himself this time..."+LUMI: Did you bring the 100% Zygarde?!")Bring it to Shelly in the Underroot!"ZShe said she had an idea of how to use it to break through the barrier and save Noel!"LUMI: You really did it!"INow there's nothing standing in our way from rescuing Noel properly!""I'm here if you need me, \PN!"EVE: Oh, you made it."%That's good; Lumi will be happy."$She's been doing better lately,"In every way imaginable."/Even some ways I hadn't imagined possible."3I've been thinking, perhaps I've been selfish.";I should have worked with her from the very beginning."VShe may be younger, but she is still my sister, and every bit as capable as I am."#In some ways, maybe even more."MPerhaps I held her back this whole time by taking the burden for myself.";But there's no use in worrying about all that for now."ZI think the best thing to do for now is simply to find a cozy spot and enjoy the air."oEVE: Laura seemed pretty excited about the order, but personally I don't see what the fuss is all about..."/EVE: Personally, I'm not sold on the plan."1However, I don't exactly have a better idea."I'll keep researching."9If I find out anything of use, you'll hear about it."tEVE: Heather has been circling the tree looking for another way in nearly nonstop since she brought you down..."QIt's a good thing we brought food with us, or I'd be worried for her health."/EVE: It seems Shelly's theory was correct?"bI'm relieved, though I can't say I understand the mechanics on any kind of technical level..."|Then again, I suppose I should know better by now than to expect everything to have a perfect, technical explanation anyway."(It seems people always surprise me."It's nice."SHELLY: Hi, \PN!"I'm glad you came!"<Just in time, too! It took forever to find a good spot!"_We're just getting set up now, but-- just give me a bit and I'll get a plate for you, too!"OSHELLY: Wait, yeah, we totally can't start eating until we get the drinks!"4Like-- like that's just how drinks work, right?")Laura said it was a surprise anyhow!"HEATHER: Hi, \PN!"'Nice to see another familiar face."PLaura invited us all here, and I was like, "Okay, I'll come to your picnic,"	BUT,"You have to battle me!"";We were gonna see who the stronger Elite 4 member was!"`(And it was gonna be ME, cuz I have the type advantage and that's definitely not cheating!)"(But then she couldn't even make it!"%So now this is kind of a bummer."KI mean, food and picnics are nice and all, but where's the fun stuff?!"cI'd challenge you to a rematch here and now, but I don't wanna mess up the picnic blanket now."1I just wish something exciting would happen!"LHEATHER: But after this, you're gonna run through Charous again, right?"$I'm always down to take you on!",HEATHER: Okay, I'm going back for Noel!" Fixtheproblemokaythanksbye!"-LUMI: Wait, what was that? Where's Noel?"He stayed at the top?!"What is he thinking?!"9EVE: Trying to rescue him on foot is likely a waste."aA barrier has appeared at the entrance of the tree as well, so we can't even get in anymore."DWhatever that is, it's spreading and fortifying itself quickly."LUMI: So what do we do?"We can't just wait here!"SHELLY: Um--"!Um, I have an idea actually?"LUMI: Tell us, tell us!"-SHELLY: Well, there's an Yveltal, right?"MAnd when I was at the roots of the tree, there were all these Z-Cells...";...And doesn't the barrier kind of look like them too?"(EVE: Where are you going with this?"NSHELLY: I don't really know-- but I remembered reading about an old myth,"HAbout a giant tree, an Yveltal, and a snake gnawing at its roots..."Um, what I'm saying is--"What if we used a Zygarde?"7In the myth, I think the snake attacked the bird--"rSo maybe a snake like Zygarde could deliver an attack that would break through the barriers once and for all!" EVE: An interesting theory."FI don't know if there's any use in putting stock in myths, but..."[Zygarde's Core Enforcer attack is known to eliminate special properties of its target."vIf we could get our hands on a 100% Zygarde, I think it's reasonable to assume it would be able to break through."1LUMI: But how in the world would we do that?"AI saw \PN collecting cells, but that would take a whole 100!")EVE: It's possible to collect cells."rI believe that Smeargle who helps around the Nightclub mentioned seeing a Gather Cube somewhere in Chrysolia.";Then it's just a matter of collecting them one by one."$LUMI: But a whole 100 of them!?"'We'll never get that many in time!"cSHELLY: Maybe, since all these Pok√©mon are spawning from the New World, one will just appear?"'EVE: That would be too convenient."#LUMI: But it's not impossible!"GA lot of too-convenient things have happened lately, haven't they?")EVE: ...I certainly can't deny that."vSHELLY: We'll keep doing what we can here, but \PN, you should keep gathering Z-Cells and chasing down Anomalies!"AAs soon as you get a 100% Zygarde, bring it here right away!"1We'll make sure we save Noel no matter what!" LUMI: That's the plan then!"FI know it seems daunting, but if anyone can do it, it's you, \PN!"%HEATHER: Want a ride to the top?")HEATHER: So you finally did it, huh?">I suppose that's to be expected from someone who beat me."iThe barrier had entirely enclosed the top before and it wasn't flinching no matter what I did to it!"0But just a bit ago, it cracked like an egg!""Much less messy than one too!"XAnyway, I didn't see Noel anymore when I was up there, so I'm a little concerned..."Want a ride to the top?"HEATHER: You got it!"5Hop on and hang tight; you know what time it is!"1HEATHER: Suit yourself. It's your sore legs."friend!!!!!!!"LIN: This is a Gym Leader?"+This is the best that can be expected?"&AMARIA: I-- I don't understand..."LIN: You don't understand."+AMARIA: How was it over so quickly...?"$LIN: What is there to question?"You are weak."That is all."AMARIA: No, I--"LIN: You are powerless.""LIN: Surrender the bracelets."AMARIA: Wait-- what?"*ACE: Ah, I was wondering about those."!AMARIA: These were-- a gift."$I won't just give them to you--"*LIN: You will give them up willingly."There is no other option."AMARIA: S-stop it--"ACE: That's enough."LIN: ..."EJust moments ago, you chastised another for protecting an enemy."?Are a few stray seconds all it takes to break your spirit?")ACE: I expect loyalty to the family,"Not needless cruelty."%You've taken it too far already."0For now we capture her WITHOUT harming her."'As your superior, that's an order."LIN: ...Understood."+As the superior officer, that order..."...Will be your last."Out exploring, are we?"5I see you can take care of yourself well enough."=Mind the Nuzleaf's Pitfalls. They can be quite annoying."KI'm all for welfare; I'd rather give them money than have them rob me."DI don't really care if people are fulfilling themselves or not."gI'd turn 'em all into grist and build a castle out of it if I could, but I don't have the machine."Yes"NoIu;␀1[[""Beryl Ward Gym"[""Beryl Ward Gym";[""Beryl Ward Gym"Iu;␀¨[[\""Elizabeth Connal"""Monty Belrose""