hing I've worked for."What more do you want?"-...No, perhaps it is wrong to blame you."%Once again, words are pointless."UMiserable as it is for an old man backed into a corner like me to make requests,"*There is something I must ask of you."I'll return to the arena."*There, you should defeat me properly."%A card-scanner sits on the wall."\PN tried the Silver Card!"Heather is fast asleep."+\PN obtained Field Effect Read-Out 11!"0Info on Corrosive Mist Field now available!"@HEATHER: ...Well, it looks exactly the same as when I left."HEATHER: Dustier, though."8How long has it been since I stopped sleeping here?"3HEATHER: Man, I haven't read these in forever."%Oh! "The Adventures of Gligirl!""Have you ever read these?"0I bet there's a bunch of new issues by now!"<HEATHER: ...Most of this stuff wasn't even really mine.""HEATHER: And this was my bed."OIt's nice and soft, but I was always more comfortable on Salamence's back."AHEATHER: Why do adults always have more things than friends?"%What's the point of any of this?"(HEATHER: This is where I ate meals."MHe'd get mad if I ate in my room, but he'd eat in his room all the time."#But, I usually hoped he would."!I preferred to be alone too."'HEATHER: I didn't go in here much."%HEATHER: It feels wrong now too."(HEATHER: And this was Dad's office."%HEATHER: There's a trick here..."$HEATHER: This was Dad's office."0HEATHER: He spent most of his time in here."HEATHER: "For Heather,"6By the time you read this, you will be strong...""HEATHER: As if."J"Being strong" was just the excuse he used to keep himself locked up."KRather than being strong, isn't it better to learn to care for others?"0He was as weak and scared as any other kid."$If only he knew how to show it."HEATHER: So it's settled!"0That's the kind of heroine I'm going to be!"CAny old clown in a suit can punch a villain and call it a day,"6But who are the ones practicing true compassion?!"4That's a job only a magical wind maiden can do![5"&COREY: So you found 