 shouldn't you be heading out for the operation?"5You're not gonna move? Then we'll make you move!"?ARCHER: Good job, \PN. Thanks to your diversion, we're in."6DeFacto's with us too, so let's get this settled!">Yo, bro. You know where you are? You with the Magma Gang.":You know where you should be? Anywhere else. Get out."jDidn't I tell you to get? Look, only Magma Gang members are allowed in here. So you ain't gonna pass."6That is... Unless you wanna join us. Whaddya say?"hHey... We got a bite. All right, so you know what's up. But we gotta see if you have what it takes."On your mark! Get set! Go!"Then leave!"NIHIL: Just shoot me now."ONIHIL: I'm left alone all night with Kriz while you guys do the fun stuff."Fuck my life.".NIHIL: Oh, yes? Well, not bad, I suppose."cYou know where you should be? In a ditch, breathless. That's where all of Aqua Gang should be!"2You going? No? Cool, then I get to thrash ya."NIHIL: The hell was that?"MAXWELL: Hello, wanderer!" Welcome, to the Magma Gang."%Impressive entry battle you had.""Allow me to introduce myself!",I am Maxwell, leader of the Magma Gang!"'You've already met Kriz and Nihil."#The others are Darm and Break."-Feel free to ignore anything Break says."BREAK: Oh? How boring."CMAXWELL: You, friend, are going to be a fantastic asset to us."-See, I'm kind of like a gentleman thief.".Steal from the greedy, give to the poor--"That's us, by the way--""Bring balance to the world..."All that wonderful stuff."@Unfortunately, there's another group making that difficult:"The Aqua Gang.".They're nothing more than greedy thieves."	But!"HWith you around, we'll outnumber them, and finally claim our stake!"$We make our first move tonight.")Meet us at the empty shack in Lapis."#It's around 4th and Hydrangea."For glory, baby."-MAXWELL: We make our first move tonight."MAXWELL: Brilliant, baby.":That's really gonna set the Aqua Gang in their place.")You can keep the Pok√©mon you found."AAfter all, it's not like we're the ones wh