at you've lost something."7I believe we can be of some benefit to each other.Iu;␀D[[W"AME: \PN?"3Hey there! So I see you've made it to the Gym."àThis telecom system connects right to the Grand Hall, so no matter where you are, whenever you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway..."1AME: So you're going to fight Shelly, right?"\By the way, did you know that some Leaders in Reborn choose to fight in Double Battles?"äShelly is one of those. Her tag team strategy focuses on setting up rain to cover her Fire-type weakness, and then going for a safe sweep."mIf you don't let her set the rain up, Fire-type attacks in her Forest Arena will make short work of her."XBut, if the rain does come, go with the flow and use Water moves to ride that wave!"RMany of her bugs won't resist it, so that extra power can be her own undoing."Good luck!"7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall..."
