een it."=Perhaps if you ask around you'll find some kind of lead."4Say, did you ever happen to find that Squirtle?"2I'd love to see the little fellow if you did."&Just to check up on it, you know?"^Stranger, did you know there was supposed to be some kind of Squirtle around these parts?"jI was looking for it to make sure it would be okay and healthy, but I haven't found any sign of it..."&Ah, didn't you have it after all?"Oh!"&Is this really the same Squirtle?"I suppose I wouldn't know."_In any case, I had been concerned if the waste was affecting its health negatively, but...";As far as I can tell, this friend is as right as rain!"HMaybe something about this muck is uniquely hospitable to Pok√©mon?"6As if inviting them to stay within its embrace..."!For their protection, maybe?"?Ah, nevermind me-- I'm just musing out loud at this point!"6Why don't you take this for your trouble, friend?"!Perhaps it'll come in handy."4Take care of your little friend now, won't you?":Byxbysion was not always the wasteland you see now..."OBut one day, in the blink of an eye, the piles of filth began to stack up."EWe never found their source, and they never stopped appearing..."KOnce, the city mounted a huge effort to clear it all away- and we did."UAnd in its place, we began constructing these old buildings, to expand the city."So we worked."!And then, as if overnight..."_We woke to the same filth, returned-- no, doubled in mass-- from before we had cleared it."ãIt was then that we abandoned the waste. We built the large stone city walls, hoping to cage the corruption in... Dooming this barren land."8What more could there be to this curse, I wonder..."VThere's a hidden network of tunnels underneath the waste... One, a vast grotto..."BBut even inside the grotto, there's one more secret tunnel..."0Like some kind of twisted tunnel-ception...[3"1Phew! Nice little storm we've got out there."-I think I'll just stay here for a while."=You're welcome to stay and chat if you'd like, travel