 sure the boss already has what he needs!"ITARA: The day when Team Meteor rebuilds is coming closer and closer~"*Even if we lose now, it won't matter!"=Soon, the world can be transformed into a true paradise!"SIMON: We're not evil." We're trying to fix things."jAlthough people may be hurt, or even die, when we recreate the world, their suffering will be erased."JPerhaps, even those that have been wronged can be restored to life..."HEATHER: ..."'SIGMUND: And so you're here again."$SIGMUND: So, you've come again."tSIGMUND: I confess it was fortunate that Sirius of this "Team Meteor" came to me with the proposal that he did."yHe had the means to capture my fugitives, and for payment he needed only to extract from this girl a single object--"A Ruby Ring."XCAIN: If it's just the ring you want, what are you even doing, keeping her up here?"$SIGMUND: I ask myself the same."@Treatment has not been called for, if that is your concern."9At Sirius' behest, I was to detain and question her."iBut that is demonstratedly fruitless, given that she has become withdrawn to the point of silence..."0CAIN: And whose fault do you think that is?"IAfter what you did to her, she may not even be able to speak at all!"SSIGMUND: Loss of speech is not among the effects of electroconvulsive therapy."Trust me to know my trade.":She has most certainly not lost her ability to speak."Only her will."XAnd yet, you appear to have constructed a certain image of me in your mind already."8Do you intend to fight me regardless of what I say?"SIGMUND: Just as well."3Then I won't stop you from proceeding onwards."rSIGMUND: I may have invested myself in this "Team Meteor", but I have no regard for their malevolent actions."GYet, I am bound to their service for a different reason entirely--"0Strictly a matter of my personal curiosity."=There's a name I hear thrown about among their officers."=It's a name I used to know, but it cannot possibly be..."
