nes must be cut to be shaped."People are the same.":Sometimes the stone breaks if you make the wrong cut."DAnd your father, the miserable, treacherous lout that he was..."%Well, he was very broken indeed."XCAIN: Heyy buddy, I think you should stop talking and give the girl back her stuff."0SIRIUS: Is that what you think I should do?"5This conflict is as pointless as it is annoying."SIRIUS: "Her" stuff."*It was ours before she was ever born."2This Amethyst Pendant and the Ruby Ring both.">You don't have so much as an inkling of their true worth."@I will NOT relinquish such items for mere sentimentalities.",CAIN: Then we'll just have to make you!"Let's go, \PN!"DInsolent. You have no clue what you're fighting for or against."SIRIUS: Enough!"8This conflict is as pointless as it is infuriating!"TDo not presume to be in control of the situation after such a trifling victory."After all..."ANNA: Ow--"SIRIUS: Need I say more?"-SIGMUND: Sirius, I cannot abide by this."!SIRIUS: Nor can you stop it."ANNA: Cain...?"CAIN: Hey-- Hey, no--"(Nobody wants this to happen, right?"!We can work this out, right?"SIRIUS: I wonder."CAIN: Wait-- I know."&Look, you lost a shipment, right?"5I picked this up-- it was supposed to reach you."%This, uhhh, green crystal thing?",SIRIUS: ...You have the Emerald Brooch."@And here I thought that old zealot's daughter still had it."2It seems this truly is history in the making."#The Brooch for her life, then.""CAIN: Sure, whatever, yeah..."ASIRIUS: Give it here, boy, and slowly-- no sudden movements.")Cain handed over the Emerald Brooch!"SIRIUS: Go."ANNA: U-um..."=Hey, uh, Nostra says we need to leave here right away..."+CAIN: You don't have to tell me twice."Let's skedaddle!"1SIRIUS: To have three of the four already..."How marvelous.".SIGMUND: Sirius, I have some... concerns."SIRIUS: Not now, Doctor."(You've been useless enough already."5Are you determined to make yourself a detriment?"SIGMUND: I..."SIRIUS: Leave me."SIRIUS: ...No,