 are, if anybody gets in, they'll be able to find us."VCHARLOTTE: And because of legal bullshit the world loves so much for some reason,"4\PN and Laura are our primary lines of defense."And that's fine."ELaura's part of the Elite Four, too, so no one's gonna beat her.",And \PN is practically a wrecking ball."`Any dumb Meteor or Doctor who comes here is going to get their face smashed in. Right, \PN?""CHARLOTTE: That's the spirit."%CHARLOTTE: No need to be modest."-Just don't hold back and you'll be fine."cAnyway, we're not gonna all be able to hide in the same place, so let's split into two groups."4ANNA: Okay! How about Noel and I hide upstairs?"ECHARLOTTE: Then Shelly and I will find somewhere in the kitchen."HLAURA: Then, I'll guard the upstairs, and \PN will take downstairs?"DThough, do please try to be gentle with the living room........"#CHARLOTTE: Sounds like a plan."Everyone, break!"JSHELLY: I'm so glad we're all safe... But... but um, where's Saphira?"CHARLOTTE: I'm just fine."Thanks, Sis."/SHELLY: Um, I'm not hurt, but my name is--"NSAPHIRA: The man with the dark hair said that Sigmund captured two of us."SAPHIRA: What happened?"/LAURA: I failed. The Doctor got the twins."&SAPHIRA: That's fine, it happens."What happened to you?"@LAURA: The Doctor didn't even try to fight, he just........"3He had his Pok√©mon attack me directly........"*Like his old shock treatments........"SAPHIRA: Right."Step aside."$SAPHIRA: I'm going to find him.")And I'm going to get the twins back."5And I'm going to rip the Doctor's ugly face off."CLaura was injured. I'm not about to put you in harm's way too."$However, \PN is coming with me."BYou helped Charlotte escape from Sigmund once already, right?"5First, we have to find where they've been taken."9Secondly, we eliminate anyone who stands in our way."Up for it?">LAURA: Actually, they might not be too terribly far away."wA little while ago, a group of similarly-dressed men began constructing all that machinery inside Tan