it's a rough fall too."(Don't get your hopes up, all right?"LANNA: If you don't have any hope, then how can you keep moving forward?"{CHARLOTTE: Oh, please. I'm sure she'll pull some mid-air "Dragonite, help me out!" thing and then just fly away peacefully."3People in our family DON'T go out that easily."?SHELLY: Speaking of your family... where are your parents?"DCHARLOTTE: There's a reason we were in the Orphanage, you know."!CHARLOTTE: Rather than that,"*Who was the woman with the Hydreigon?""ANNA: There was a lady there?"I didn't see anyone..."CNOEL: Yes, Anna. That Hydreigon didn't just appear on its own."Someone was riding it.""\PN, would you have any idea?"CHARLOTTE: ...Lin?"That's a gross name."BANNA: Hey! You didn't happen to get my Pendant back, did you?"The Amethyst Pendant?"1What do you mean, they're using it as a key?"SHELLY: A key? Wait..."-I just remembered an old story I read..."XIn the story, it described an ancient city built around the crash site of a meteor."mThe temple that housed the meteor was sealed by four crystal keys: Ruby, Sapphire, Emerald and Amethyst."2But the city fell into ruin, and it was lost."GWhat if your Amethyst Pendant is actually the key from that story?"9NOEL: Then, that would mean that the ancient city..."CHARLOTTE: Became Reborn."BSHELLY: So the ancient temple is just underneath Reborn City?"6That must be why they blew up the Grand Stairway!"xI heard when the city officials explored underneath the Stairway, they found a huge cavern with a ruin at its base."@CHARLOTTE: They found the lock, and now they need the keys."<ANNA: Heather's Ruby Ring must be one of the keys, too!"?We have to stop Team Meteor from getting those other keys!"@Whatever they're trying to do down there, it can't be good!"5LAURA: Which leaves Emerald and Sapphire, right?"ECHARLOTTE: Wait, so these keys are embedded into jewelry, right?"oLaura, do you remember those Sapphire Bracelets Dad gave you as a present for your birthday that one year?"0LAURA: Oh, I had entirely forgotten........"#CHARLOTTE: Where are they now?"LAURA: I--".I lost them when Mom and Dad died........"CHARLOTTE: ...Oh."<LAURA: It's possible it didn't survive the fire........"ANNA: Fire?"1Is that where you got those burn scars from?"@CHARLOTTE: Anna, for the last time, I don't have any scars."See? Perfectly clear."$SHELLY: I don't see anything..."+ANNA: Right! Sorry, I keep forgetting!"%I won't talk about them anymore!"@But since it is important, what fire are you talking about?"LAURA: Um, well........"HIt was something that happened with Charlotte when we were younger.";CHARLOTTE: Yeah, okay. I don't wanna be here for this."LAURA: Charlotte........!"SHELLY: Awkward..."ANNA: Yeah..."ANNA: Sooo..."How's everybody doing...?"Oh, I know!"PWhile they're out, why don't \PN and Noel finish their battle from earlier!"$NOEL: I suppose it's necessary.""ANNA: Okay! Let's go outside."*Last one there is a rotten Exeggcute!"OLAURA: If you'd like, you can use the room right behind me to take a rest."&SAPHIRA: Charlotte, are you hurt?"&CHARLOTTE: I'm fine. Thanks, Sis."SAPHIRA: Other girl?"+SHELLY: I'm okay but, um, my name is--"SAPHIRA: Good."%\PN, status report for upstairs?"...Sigmund took Laura?"$He has no authority to do that."The old man is slipping."NAnd that means it's time for me to hunt him down and tear his throat out."(CHARLOTTE: Sounds like fun. I'm in."&SAPHIRA: No, you're staying here."DLaura was already taken; I'm not about to let you get hurt too."-SAPHIRA: However, \PN is coming with me."Let's get moving."7CHARLOTTE: Do you even know where they were taken?"!SAPHIRA: I'll figure it out."&SHELLY: Um... Um, I have an idea."XRemember all that pipework and mechanical stuff we saw coming through the mountain?"$What if that was Team Meteor's?"0SAPHIRA: I think that's worth looking into."I'll meet you there, \PN."Thanks, other girl."SHELLY: My name is--"...Never mind, I guess..."8CHARLOTTE: Well, you'd better not keep her waiting."5But slap a few of them around for me, all right?"@NOEL: There aren't exactly a lot of good hiding spots here."AChances are, if anybody gets in, they'll be able to find us."VCHARLOTTE: And because of legal bullshit the world loves so much for some reason,"4\PN and Laura are our primary lines of defense."And that's fine."ELaura's part of the Elite Four, too, so no one's gonna beat her.",And \PN is practically a wrecking ball."`Any dumb Meteor or Doctor who comes here is going to get their face smashed in. Right, \PN?""CHARLOTTE: That's the spirit."%CHARLOTTE: No need to be modest."-Just don't hold back and you'll be fine."cAnyway, we're not gonna all be able to hide in the same place, so let's split into two groups."4ANNA: Okay! How about Noel and I hide upstairs?"ECHARLOTTE: Then Shelly and I will find somewhere in the kitchen."HLAURA: Then, I'll guard the upstairs, and \PN will take downstairs?"DThough, do please try to be gentle with the living room........"#CHARLOTTE: Sounds like a plan."Everyone, break!"JSHELLY: I'm so glad we're all safe... But... but um, where's Saphira?"CHARLOTTE: I'm just fine."Thanks, Sis."/SHELLY: Um, I'm not hurt, but my name is--"NSAPHIRA: The man with the dark hair said that Sigmund captured two of us."SAPHIRA: What happened?"/LAURA: I failed. The Doctor got the twins."&SAPHIRA: That's fine, it happens."What happened to you?"@LAURA: The Doctor didn't even try to fight, he just........"3He had his Pok√©mon attack me directly........"*Like his old shock treatments........"SAPHIRA: Right."Step aside."$SAPHIRA: I'm going to find him.")And I'm going to get the twins back."5And I'm going to rip the Doctor's ugly face off."CLaura was injured. I'm not about to put you in harm's way too."$However, \PN is coming with me."BYou helped Charlotte escape from Sigmund once already, right?"5First, we have to find where they've been taken."9Secondly, we eliminate anyone who stands in our way."Up for it?">LAURA: Actually, they might not be 