d let me do as I please?">Or will you abandon your friend to keep me fast in place?"SIGMUND: Laura."LAURA: Doctor........""SIGMUND: It's been some time."KI trust you're doing well despite your refusal to remain in treatment.")LAURA: Doctor, I'm of legal age now."#You have no authority over me."'This is my house, so please leave.")SIGMUND: If only I was here for you."#You know that as well as I do."FYet, it is very like you to shy away from any source of conflict."`We can avoid having to escalate the situation, if only you'll tell me where the others are."*I know all of your weaknesses, Laura.""And you have so many of them."cLAURA: Do you really think me so frail that I would hand over my own friends at a mere threat?"eIf that is your understanding of me, Doctor, I'm afraid you have a lot more studying left to do!""SIGMUND: So that's how it is."Electivire."YLAURA: Doctor, you know just as well as anyone that I am a member of the Elite Four."-Please do not believe you can defeat me."SIGMUND: Lizzy, Lizzy..."I know... Yes, I know."LAURA: Pardon?"8SIGMUND: I will do what must be done for your sake."$It pains me to do this, really."Electivire, Thunder Wave.""145 volts-- on Laura herself."LAURA: Aaaaaa--"@SIGMUND: You always did freeze up past a certain threshold."'I'll thank you for stepping aside.""SIGMUND: Do not worry, child."JAs ever, I will remind you that the discomfort you feel is imaginary."_Outside stimuli are only as powerful as the effect we allow them to have in our own minds."DWhen you decide to be strong enough to overcome this, you will."SIGMUND: Hmph."NI expected Team Meteor's reinforcements to keep you busy for much longer."Oh, Lizzy... What to do?"(SIGMUND: I'll be leaving after all."And so will Laura."MSIRIUS: All right, waste your time with me while the Doctor has his way."SIRIUS: Y-you!"SAPHIRA: Me."Peekaboo."CSAPHIRA: Did you really think you could put me down so easily?"QOn the contrary, I hear your little team quite enjoyed my little light show."'SIRIUS: You rely on cheap strikes."IYou hit and run because you know on equal footing, you would falter."/SAPHIRA: Is that a dare, or a double dare?"SIRIUS: ...Hm?"Oh, good."]I've just been informed that the Doctor was successful in capturing two of his children."That's my cue to leave."/I'll look forward to NOT seeing you again."SAPHIRA: Sigmund..."Charlotte!"Laura!"Where are you?!"CHARLOTTE: Saphira!".We're in the kitchen! Is the coast clear?"OAnd after last time, that man will hardly abide by any further inaction..."'Orderlies, search the upper floor."#I'll eliminate this annoyance."6Your petty resistance only delays the inevitable."!SIGMUND: Where are your men?"'I have a score to settle with him."=SIGMUND: This vexatious brat is protecting the children."SIRIUS: Is that so?"XWell, Doctor, I cannot help but notice, there are now two of us, and only one brat."JIf we split up, their actions will only tell us where they're hiding.",And they can't stop both of us at once."&SIRIUS: I'll go this way, Doctor.",And you go through the door over there."(SIRIUS: So, \PN? Who will you stop?"The Doctor, or myself?"0SIRIUS: All right, waste your time with me."Go ahead, Doctor."SAPHIRA: ...Sigmund.")LAURA: Saphira? I'm upstairs........"'SIRIUS: Hmph. So that's how it is."/All right, I'll just take a look upstairs."SIGMUND: Saphira.">If you've come, then your sisters must be here after all."'SIGMUND: Where are you, Charlotte?"!SIGMUND: I know you're here.",Come out, come out, wherever you are..."2SAPHIRA: Sorry, Sigmund, there's no one here."Only me."(SIGMUND: ...That's 'Doctor' to you."5SAPHIRA: You're not a doctor, you're a criminal."HSAPHIRA: By the way, I heard my sister left you a nice little scar.",SAPHIRA: "How does that make you feel?""+SAPHIRA: It's been a while, hasn't it?"eSAPHIRA: But I remember VERY well how nicely you treated my sisters and I back at the Orphanage."5SAPHIRA: I think it's time I returned the favor."Hold still."$SAPHIRA: D