rry, I'm already taking care of everything else!"$ANNA: Serves Team Meteor right!"FLAURA: Thank you for allowing me a moment to cleanse the vessels.")LAURA: I hope it was to your liking."eThis particular blend was with rose and matcha, with a garnish of cornflower and stargazer lily."kI have been working on several other blends, but I believe they're not quite ready to sample just yet."bI'd like to continue tweaking the proportions to bring out as much of the flavor as possible.">...I do find the whole affair suits me quite well though."SIt was Bennett's suggestion that I perhaps pursue this as an additional hobby."nAfter all, the act of powdering and mixing each of the different components is a rather delicate process.",To be honest, I find it quite relaxing."NWhat's more, it provides a use for the flowers I've already been growing."bI'm quite confident that, at least on the basis of ingredients alone, one couldn't do better."iI have a great and increasing appreciation for the philosophy behind ceremonial tea serving as well."6The emphasis on purification was my initial draw,"7But to understand the tea as an experience........",From seed to blossom, and petal to cup,"4No trace is left of the tea we've just enjoyed."KYet, the time we shared with each other is unquestionable and eternal."$That will stay with us forever."çI truly believe that if only we could all learn to show the same respect and appreciation to each other as we can take for the quiet moments,"c........ Well, 'world peace' is perhaps a bit juvenile, but can you imagine where we could go?"GLAURA: I'll be inviting my sisters for this in a few days as well."^Charlotte swears by coffee, but I believe with the right blend, I can convert her........"INOEL: She started feeling sick the second that man took her pendant."$NOEL: Did you get the medicine?"/If you didn't, then why did you come back?"LAURA: What happened?"Oh no!"LAURA: The wall!"0I asked you to not mess up the room........"7LAURA: Huh, they t