ng to challenge me."8El, Bennett will show you to the spectators' seats."X\PN, I'll prepare for your challenge now, so please meet me in the arena behind me."Best of luck to you." SERRA: I should be happy..."BBut maybe I wasn't cut out for this whole mothering business."Never mind that."2You've got more pressing concerns, don't you?"gSUZY: We shilled the dyes hard enough at the start that they do the rest of the work on their own."P"Hey, love your hair" becomes "Thanks, I got it done at the Central Salon!""DAnd that becomes a 15% discount on a self- advertising product."You do good work."FSERRA: It sounds like you've really perfected the business model." SUZY: Quality sees quality."5Thanks for thinking of us to sell your products."/We're also hopeful for the Icy Shine line."3Expect a report within the next couple months."Until then."$SERRA: Always a pleasure, Suzy."7SERRA: Sorry for the timing; I've been a bit busy."Where were we?"6BENNETT: You were asking me to sell your shampoo."SERRA: Ah, yes!"You and \PN both--"]I'm sure you have some high profile challengers pass through every now and then, surely?"sBENNETT: ...Mother, I'm not going to use my position as a member of the Elite 4 to sell hair products for you."OSERRA: We can negotiate a proper advertising fee, if that's what you need."&Or is it because I'm your mother?"Would you be embarrassed?"(You can say 'yes', I'll understand."IBut you really should see for yourself; this shampoo can do wonders!"&Your hair will never be fluffier!"QBENNETT: ...Setting that aside, it would be an inappropriate use of my role."VI am glad that your creative ventures are thriving, and I do wish to support you,"But not like this."CInstead, allow me to contact some other distribution agencies."APerhaps I can get something going in another region for you."I'll let you know."SERRA: Sounds lovely!"!I knew I could count on you."%You know, I am so proud of you--"BENNETT: Mother."5SERRA: ...And that's all I'll say on the matter!"FActually, it might be best for you both to run along soon anyway."(The photographer will be here soon.""BENNETT: The... photographer?"*You're... getting back into modeling?"SERRA: In a sense."PI'm afraid I'm much too old for any top level agency to consider taking me."But, who needs them?"xThey model and represent only a small, unrealistic, and all-too-often digitally-doctored portion of the population."I can do better."uNow that I have my own products going anyway, I can save costs on advertising by handling the modeling in-house."1BENNETT: You're... starting your own agency."óSERRA: If I may be bold, it's ridiculous that I no longer meet the criteria for top level images just because my chest isn't as perky as it used to be."JSERRA: But then, that's only natural and expected after feeding you--"BENNETT: MOTHER."SERRA: ...Sorry."cI'm just saying, humans deserve to be represented in a much wider variety of shapes and sizes."}I hope to provide a fabulous and authentic example of the human condition, so that we can all expand our standards of beauty."óThe fewer people that feel like they're past their prime or unfit for aesthetics simply because of their differences from the usual labels, the better."_After all, people aren't simple glass to polish to the points of reflection or perfection."2We aren't so static as to break when cracked,"^But like kintsugi, fissures give us opportunity to bend, grow, and become more beautiful.";Why should we not wear all of our experiences proudly?"BENNETT: Well, greetings."&My name is Bennett, as you heard."I'm a lepidopterist."9That is, a person who studies butterflies and moths."pSomething about how little insects can go from what they are to something so much more is just so exciting!"DFor instance-- did you know that Cascoon have perfect memories?"KDespite never moving or doing anything, they'll never forget a battle!"~Then, once they evolve, they're remarkably able to exact any form of retaliation for what happened earlier in their life!"=When you think about it, they truly are small geniuses--"SERRA: Bennett."I think that's enough."BENNETT: ...Yes, Mother."VBENNETT: Anyway, I one day hope to be an authority on such magnificent creatures."Maybe even a Gym Leader!"AME: \PN?"3Hey there! So I see you've made it to the Gym."àThis telecom system connects right to the Grand Hall, so no matter where you are, whenever you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway..."&AME: So you're at Serra's estate?"]Right. Serra Voclain was once a famous model, so she's all about beauty and reflections."&Her Gym mirrors this-- literally."ãSerra loves to play games with her mirrors, increasing Evasion, lowering Accuracy, and even performing critical attacks from hidden places."`In the Mirror Arena, changes to Evasion and Accuracy affect the frequency of critical hits."rBe careful not to take a surprise attack, but if you can boost your own stats, you'll be at an advantage too!"?Besides that, consider using beam and light-based attacks!"FThese moves can be reflected by the mirrors, and will always hit!"WOther light-based moves will be stronger too, including her signature Aurora Veil."YThe Defense boost is a lot to fight through, but I have faith you can break through!"Good luck!"7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall..."FSERRA: Well, the good news is, the Pok√©Mart isn't here any more."7...No telling where it's actually ended up though."Not far, probably."6And the bad news is that Bennett also isn't here.".He probably will be very far away though.":Studying with that stranger to join the Elite Four..."!If that pans out, wonderful."But what are the odds?"3No, I should be happy for my son, shouldn't I?"SERRA: I should be happy."CBut if you do run into him somewhere, please look out for him."WI'm sure he can take care of himself, but he doesn't always make the best choices."Then again, does anyone?"First Luna and Gardevoir."Now Bennett too."It's almost surreal."1All things do fade away in time, it seems..."+\PN obtained Field Effect Read-Out 30!"(Info on Mirror Arena now available!"Yes"NoIu;␀B
