Cover;[í"GThe fossil of a small Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Shieldon."Please enjoy!"(Remember, don't touch the exhibits."4Generations of locations, all for your perusal!"BATTENDANT: Hello! Welcome to the historic Spinel Town Museum!"3\GAdmittance is a $500 fee. Is that all right?"VThank you very much! Please enjoy everything the Spinel Town Museum has to offer!"ZI'm afraid you don't have that much on-hand. Please come back again some time though!"Please visit us some time!"*A portrait of the city's rising star.",A portrait of the region's fallen star."9"Artifacts found in a ruin deep beneath Reborn City."FIt's said that they could be a form of old-fashioned Pok√© Ball!""^It's said their craftsmanship bears strong resemblance to the old legend of Pok√©opolis.""<"A gold nugget taken from the ruin beneath Reborn City."|Because of the high karat material and its size, this object could be worth up to ten times more than a normal nugget!""NMost everything here has been recovered from the old ruin beneath Reborn."%Would you like to hear about it?"{Although the city was destroyed within the past decade, this wasn't the first era of destruction the region has known."#Long ago-- much, much longer--";An ancient civilization called this ground their home."LLittle is known about them, but some of their structures still remain--"4Ancient inscriptions, tomes and such artifacts.".These are the things we've gathered here."pCollectively, they speak of a certain object, heralded by the culture as the centrepiece of their religion."TFor all we know, whatever it is could still be buried beneath the rebuilt city!"We'd never know!"Fascinating, isn't it?"oThe inscription on display describes the ancient city beneath what was later constructed into Reborn City."<"Winding tunnels forged of stone glowing with power..."">"...A massive cathedral constructed around the crater...""XThe inscription on display describes the artifact at the center of an ancient city."9"An enormous enigmatic stone burning with energy...""'"...Descended from the heavens...""OThe inscription on display describes the deity of an ancient civilization."'"Born of the heaven-sent stone...""2"...Ivory coat and with an arching collar...""SThe inscription on display describes the temple raised to protect an old site."'"Four keys of the stone's door...""-"...Carved from blessed crystal cast...""EThe inscription on display describes the night of an old meteor.","Thought to be the end of the world...""*"...But it was only the beginning...""dThe inscription on display describes the creation of the world as believed by the ancient race.")"The ivory beast begat its light...""b"...And through a song in the darkness, was the first breath breathed into like creatures...""UThe display exhibits various records of Pok√©mon being known to come from space."bThe DNA of a Clefairy and the digitized DNA of a Deoxys are laid side-by-side for comparison."#GRUNT: This is the one, right?"GRUNT: It's got to be.",It's the only one that talks about Ar--"GRUNT: You!"$GRUNT: What are you doing here?"!Come to ruin our day again?!"QI haven't forgotten about you cramming me into that cage back at Blacksteam!"-GRUNT: I think some payback is in order!"!GRUNT: Or can we ruin yours?"!GRUNT: In a place like this?"?The boss wouldn't be happy if we made that much commotion."GRUNT: Tch, fine."#\PN, that's your name, right?!"2Come meet us in Tanzan Mountain, if you dare!"5Curs like them... No telling what they're up to."/I wouldn't trust anyone dressed like that."(You're always welcome here, friend."2My word, did you really meet their challenge?"8You're quite brave to fight those strange ones off."&And this museum is better for it.".I'll tell you what, benevolent bystander."NAllow me to reward your courage with one of the Museum's private fossils."9Would you like the Plume Fossil or the Cover Fossil?"It's all yours.">Smeargle takes out a noteboard and draws something on it."%"hi, my job is restore painting""0One day, Frosty, you'll look like that too!"Isn't that amazing?!"9Amaura looks at the display with existential horror."6A broken mirror, reflecting the impermanent past."<Lavender Tower, a place that carries souls of Pok√©mon."HThe fossil of a large Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Tyrantrum."?The inscription on display describes ancient holy symbols."%"Golden arcs cross in light... "":"...The body of the creator becomes our communion...""""The tilted cross pattern...""7"...Four points for four values core to spirit...""cA replica of ancient Ruby crystal, thought to be important to ancient religious practicioners."gA replica of ancient Sapphire crystal, thought to be important to ancient religious practicioners."fA replica of ancient Emerald crystal, thought to be important to ancient religious practicioners."gA replica of ancient Amethyst crystal, thought to be important to ancient religious practicioners."FThe fossil of a large Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Aurorus."FThe fossil of a large Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Armaldo."FThe fossil of a large Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Cradily."FThe fossil of a small Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Omanyte."EThe fossil of a small Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Kabuto."HThe fossil of a large Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Bastiodon."HThe fossil of a large Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Relicanth.":Centuries of history and life-- reduced to mere bone.";What sort of lives did these old structures once lead?".What sort of memories must they have had?"UAnd what experiences have been cursed by the sands of time to fall away to dust?",All that experience now is meaningless."%I wonder if it ever had meaning?")It is a poor substitute to find out,"UBut perhaps next time someone asks you for a password, you can tell them "0exp"."rThen you can see what it is like to have all the experience you would have earned fall away from you at once."IThe fossil of a large Pok√©mon, thought to be related to Carracosta."7Burned Tower, a monument to history and tradition."<Fortree City, where people live in harmony with nature."=Spear Pillar, the bridge between our world and the last."JA scene in springtime Unova. Cherry blossoms flutter through the air."JA scene in midsummer Unova. The air shimmers with heat on the canvas."MA scene in autumnal Unova. Leaves glisten in every shade of the rainbow."SA scene in an Unova winter. Snow crests every surface, illuminating the world."6A faraway dial used to track the passage of time."=The altar of the sun and moon, central to Alolan legend."IA faraway hotel bustling with tourists above a vibrant coastal city."1Looking at this place rejuvenates your soul."XA city glows crimson, its vibrant hues a testament to the liveliness of its people."MDespite its colorful nature, you're somehow still left feeling desolate."@Byxbysion Wasteland, rendered in all of its unending chaos."IBeryl Cemetery, where the souls of the departed are forever honored."LChrysolia Springs, a fusion of fire and water in unforgettable harmony."jAn artistic rendition of Arceus, thought to have been recovered from ancient religious practicioners."A hidden tower in the desert, appearing only to those who step thrice through the oases, or four quarters more after that."fA waterfall leading out from a vast mountain range. It pours over the city walls in a great rain."TWelcome to the Spinel Museum Giftshop, where the fun is so cool, it Nevermelts!"\We sell select type battle items and Pok√©mon fossils for new and experienced Trainers.".Remember to revive your fossils upstairs!"#Please enjoy our new giftshop!"USince the whole city being renovated we thought we'd do a renovation of our own."oI used to bring my Amaura here, before I realized a place full of skeletons like this probably scared her."0Now she stays home when I visit this place."3I caught another Pok√©mon friend for her, too!"A Duskull I call Grim."+I'm sure that'll make her feel better!")It's written in an 