ned out to be."7I hope my family's having a better time than I am."5My nephew tends to get himself in trouble a lot."Oh well, he'll be fine."Hi there!" I really love Eeveelutions!"NThey're so cute and colorful... Oooh I wish I could just pet all of them!"DI don't know who you are, but can you live out my dream for me?"TIf you go and pet all the Eeveelutions for me, I'll give you something special!"_...Though, really, you'll already have something special with all the love you'll recieve."8And it doesn't count if it's your own Eeveelutions!"~It's important to pet them too, but you also have to make sure to find and spread the bliss with other Trainer's Eeveelutions!"&Sharing is caring... about Eevee!"Are you out there petting?"7I can only imagine the joy you're experiencing...."@By the way, it doesn't count if it's your own Eeveelutions!"Oh my gosh you've done it."You've pet all of them."You don't have to tell me."I can see it in your eyes."!I can feel it in your heart.""I can't not give this to you."You truly deserve it."Wear it with pride.")You are so blessed. I am not worthy."4In fact, if you want to be even more blessed..."MThe next time someone asks you for a password, try saying "eeveeplease"!"?You might find something good when choosing a new partner!"Vanilla - $400"Chocolate - $700"Strawberry - $1000"Cancel"Vanilla - $1000"Karrablast"Shelmet"No thanks"Yes"NoIu;␀˙[["...Is it over?"#Is the wild ride finally over?"UI think the building jumping around broke some of the merchandise in the back..."-If you feel sorry for us, buy something!"It's a flying Pok√©Mart!"2I came to pick up some Potions and then poof!"&We were magically somewhere else!"Let's go somewhere else!""I wanna see Orre-- no, Kalos!"4Specially-pressed curative essential oils here!"2You can only get these around here, you know!"(Keep the locals in mind, would you?"&Especially in these wild times...["...Is it over?"#Is the wild ride finally over?"UI think the building ju