here are more pressing concerns right now."Step aside."5SIRIUS: ZEL, I've just received a communication."=Lin will be coming here shortly to observe our progress."SIGMUND: Lin..."+SAPHIRA: Why does that sound familiar?"nSIRIUS: Probably because nobody in this godforsaken team can find it in their heart to shut up about her."Lin this-- Lin that."5How many promotions in a row has she gotten now?"1I swear, even Solaris answers to her by now."$zeL: She's coming n-now though?"%Abra still won't listen to us..."7LAURA: That Abra........ What are you doing to it?"ESAPHIRA: Why would Team Meteor care about an Abra of all things?"zeL: Well, um..."FWe need to get into a certain place, but it's sealed tight, so..."HLin thought, maybe if we amplify Abra's power, and ask it nicely..."0That maybe it could teleport us into there."]Zel: Unfortunately, this stupid thing won't listen to a single one of our damn commands!"/It's just been causing trouble constantly!"rLAURA: Does that mean that everything strange that's happening around Spinel Town is because of this........?"0SAPHIRA: Amplifying teleportation powers..."1So that explains the mess Spinel Town is in."zEl: Correct."\Although unlike previous operations, our objective was not to disturb the nearby areas."ÄAny oddities or damage the town and surrounding area may have incurred have simply been a side-effect of Abra's unfocused power." SIRIUS: That's enough, ZEL."XFocus on getting that thing tamed, otherwise Lin is going to have all of our heads."5SAPHIRA: Hey, we're still busting up this party."(Don't think you can just ignore us."7SIRIUS: In that case, you can be our test subject."Go ahead, ZEL."<SAPHIRA: Allow me to finish what I started on the lake!"4LAURA: S-Saphira........? Where did she........"SIRIUS: Goodbye, Saphira."&I'll enjoy not meeting you again."And the others, ZEL?"And the other, ZEL?"SIRIUS: Very good."Where did you send them?"5zeL: Um, I-- I don't think they actually know..."zEl: It could be anywhere."SIRIUS: Work on it."5We need to have that Abra focused to perfection."Our time is running thin."(SIGMUND: She looks so similar to..."...Hrm."$Zel: Behave, you stupid vermin!"zeL: Er, that is... Um...")Would you please listen to us, Abra?"BSIGMUND: I believe that was Abra's way of politely declining."Zel: You little..."...What, \PN made it back?""This thing really is useless."_SIGMUND: Perhaps it would be best to just terminate the project before this "Lin" arrives."5It sounds like she has a rather critical nature."HzEl: This level of uncontrolled power would indeed be unacceptable."NzeL: But can we really hurt the poor Abra after all we've put it through?"ÜZel: We can't do anything at all if we can't even get close enough to deactivate the machine without the stupid thing jumping us away!"'Zel: I don't need your sass, Abra!"|zEl: \PN, you wish to spare the people of Spinel Town the chaos caused by this untamed teleportational energy, correct?"Zel: Good idea."%Let's just let \PN deal with it!"*Go ahead, take the little bugger out!";It'll work out for all of us with how ANNOYING it is--"SIGMUND: ...ZEL?"Zel: OKAY, that's enough!"\PN, deal with this."hWe aren't gonna stop you, just take down this thing and you can put the chaos in Chrysolia to rest!"1I'm so sorry it had to come to this, Abra..."(SIGMUND: That seems to be a relief."VSo, Eve, will the nearby regions return to normal now or is the damage permanent?"bzEl: Any objects that have been moved by Abra's energy previously will remain where they are."~And further, there are likely some objects that will still move, already having been imbued with unstable psychic energy."?However, no more instances of such things will be created."(Slowly, Chrysolia will calm itself.""SIRIUS: Lin has just arrived."...\PN is back already?"zeL: Um... yes."*And they helped us subdue Abra, so..."SIRIUS: "Subdue"--" You terminated her project?"8zEl: It was unresponsive to all methods of control."SIRIUS: ..."Right."0