urther."4Earthquakes, casualties, and you... What a day."For Team Meteor!"Just back off, buddy."$One day, you'll feel our power."5SAPHIRA: The security here is actually pathetic."@Give me just a moment, I'll have that gate open in no time."+SAPHIRA: \PN. You shouldn't have come."What, Laura too?"2It would have been better just to abandon me."I can take care of myself."'Now she's put herself in danger..."Give me just a moment."!I can open the central gate.""METEORS: Hold it right there!"$SAPHIRA: Buy me some time, \PN!"'Why can't you just be extricated?!"
