, next time, rather than showing off the mission's keystone, let's fight with our own Pok√©mon.";zeL: I'm sorry, Tangrowth... I should have intervened."Zel: Stop yelling at me!"<You said this machine was supposed to make it stronger!".zEl: Your misjudgment was the key factor."URegardless, with Tangrowth incapacitated, the malignant growth will now regress."1zeL: So it's all going to go back to normal?"zEl: Correct."3Thus, it is counter-productive to remain here."?Let us recover the unit and abscond amidst the regression."Zel: Hey, \PN, right?"3Don't think this is over, or anywhere near it."ÇYou might've caught us at the germinal stage this time, but you don't stand a flower's chance in flame at taking us down for real."Don't forget it!Iu;␀í[["...*Munch munch munch*"!...*Munch Munch COUGH COUGH*"...*Burrrrrp*["...*Munch munch munch*"!...*Munch Munch COUGH COUGH*"...*Burrrrrp*;["...*Munch munch munch*"!...*Munch Munch COUGH COUGH*"...*Burrrrrp*Iu;␀Q[[V"'GREY: This place is nice, I guess.")Oh, no. You have to get out of here."/Just turn around and march right back out."&The town is in complete disarray."dThings just appear, or disappear, or both, or reappear somewhere else completely randomly and--""Then there's the earthquakes!")No one has any clue what's going on!"%You should just come back later."!Don't say I didn't warn you.""Welcome to Spinel Town!""	...?"QIt says something here scribbled in paint. "Home of bug boy and mirror lady""2"Voclain Estate-\nSpinel Town's resident Gym""I like trains."4I don't even know what's going on here anymore.";I bet you it turned up somewhere else, totally random."&Things've been doin' that lately."AMaybe things can finally go back to being quiet around here."?Except for, you know, the train in the middle of the town."8WOMAN: Did the entire Pok√©Mart just disappear now?"Ohhh, lordy."FWell, I reckon it had to show up somewhere not too far from here."^This is usually such a pleasant little town, and a nice 