h me, I will show you the Lord's mercy."As for the others..."*RADOMUS: I think that's about enough." I believe it's my move now."EL: What? How?"6CAIN: All right. I'll trust you on that one, \PN."RADOMUS: Very good."RI am relieved that I am not the only one to whom this charade is transparent."2ADRIENN: Charade? What are you talking about?"eRADOMUS: Adrienn, your main reason for siding with El is the testimony of my Gardevoir, correct?"%However, that's a foolish basis."%After all, you've never met her."'ADRIENN: But she's... right there."RADOMUS: Is she, really?"El?"ADRIENN: ...What?"+CAIN: It was a Ditto this whole time?!""We will silence the heretics!"-ADRIENN: So that's the real Gardevoir..." GARDEVOIR: At your service~"Miss me?"RADOMUS: Dearly."But we're not done yet."Gardevoir, Hypnosis."GARDEVOIR: Yeees, Master!"!GARDEVOIR: Good night! Mwah!""GARDEVOIR: It's a One-Hit KO!"RADOMUS: Indeed."'That about makes this case closed.";RADOMUS: We'll take this one back down to the station."He has some time to do." CAIN: Wait, I don't get it."hIf you could have just had Gardevoir Teleport at any time, why bother coming all the way down here?"#RADOMUS: I hadn't said before?"%Simply because Luna asked me to."4GARDEVOIR: Yup! I could've escaped at any time~")But ohh, my darling Master, save me!"3Don't I make a compelling damsel in distress~?"6ADRIENN: This Gardevoir is certainly more lively."FGARDEVOIR: Oh yeah, you were all "I will protect you!" and stuff~"You're a cutie!"'But I would never leave my master."He's perfect as is!")ADRIENN: ...Heh. Well, I'm relieved.",RADOMUS: As I asked in the first place,"NWhy should I be concerned when the opposing king places himself in check?"`El tried to strike at me by using Gardevoir, but it was his mistake in underestimating her."ZGARDEVOIR: Please, hold your applause for me until we're back in the comfort of home!"WRADOMUS: On that note, I think it's about time we picked ourselves up out of here."!Shall we all leave together?"5RADOMUS: It should be just a quick teleport out."RADOMUS: As you will.",It should be just a quick teleport out."FGARDEVOIR: Something about this place makes teleports so muddy..."]I don't think I can get us all the way, but I can at least take us out of this old cave!"*RADOMUS: Better than hiking, perhaps."Let us be off."*GARDEVOIR: Oh, now... Shall we begin?"3The inner sanctum door remains sealed tight..."(The doors have sealed shut again..."$...The Ebony Stonepiece reacts!"The doors click open!"5LIN: This door was opened with the seal outside."9With it, the New World has been tethered to the old."&What needed to be done, has been."6Bridges, like boundaries, are made to be crossed."Some go much too far."7Even a wildfire knows when it is time to burn out."!I knew it was mine long ago.";LIN: Once upon a time, a little girl was trapped here."3Her only company was an old, forgotten meteor."AGreat company it was, for still it housed the seed of a God."!Like her own, she raised it.""Like its own, it blessed her."6Soon, there were few limits to what she could do.":Absolute power is a toy as dangerous as it is boring."*Games are no fun without an opponent."$Lucky then, that there was one."5You will end this game, or prove it meaningless."2The next step into this world belongs to you.">You will take it because you need know what happens next."-LIN: We do not expect you to understand."&We simply invite you to the show."0You will be the next to cross the boundary."<You will do it because you need know what happens next."El"Radomus"Yes"NoIu;␀n[[)"LCAIN: There's something else going on here, but I can't quite place it."QCAIN: Hey, do you really think Gardevoir could have hated Radomus all along?"6RADOMUS: Are you quite through with this charade?"_RADOMUS: It seems they were able to open that door with the power of the Amethyst Pendant."GIf I heard correctly, do you not also, \PN, possess the Ruby Ring?":In that case, perhaps we can access a different door."