somewhere quiet."0I don't have to talk. I don't have to work."Just let me be in peace."@RAZZY: Hey! What's up! You gettin' hype on the "level-ups"?"Huh, why not?"-Ohhh, you came here looking for someone."2You'll totally find her! You can do anything!"Actually, waitasecond..."UI didn't see a girl, but there was this weird guy wanderin' around a moment ago."7I think he was going up towards the watering hole."&Y'wanna see if you can catch him?"7RAZZY: Aqua Gang can accomplish anything together!"9RAZZY: Together, we can fix this city-- or break it!":RAZZY: So Archer wants us to split up and get jobs..."Okay! I can dig it!"hI've never worked before, and I couldn't begin to guess how to write a resume, but I'll do my best!"*But what kind of place should I work?"CMmm, I wanna work somewhere that's really upbeat and exciting!"*And it should have lots of good food!"Also, I hope it's nearby!"_I still live with my parents, and it's not like they'd let me go out of the city for work.";Plus, if it's a short walk, that's even easier for me!"5Wait, does something that convenient even exist?"???: Hm."'You a new face around here? Scram!"(Uh, aite. Go in peace, or whatever."?Mate, 'm not here looking for trouble. Leave me be, aight?"A secret switch!"Press it?"Who wouldn't?"Better not..."-Still nothing? Doesn't anywhere have it?">Oh, sorry. You can go ahead; I'm not in line or anything."3Even a place like this won't sell what I need."¢My husband is seriously ill. I've been looking all over for anything that might cure him, and I heard a rumour about a certain herb, but I can't find it anywhere."aNot that I'm surprised. It's rare to find someone willing to cut off... Oh, well, nevermind."LThat plant you have... That wouldn't happen to be Oddishweed, would it?"Really?"YI almost hate to ask, but would you be willing to give me that? It's for my husband."$\PN handed over the Oddishweed."*This really is it! Thank you so much!"CI was beginning to lose hope I would ever be able to find any."bOh, I wish I could repay you somehow... Oh, actually, I suppose you must be a Trainer, right?"VI've been breeding some Pok√©mon lately, and I have an extra egg. Do you want it?"\PN got the egg!"2Take care of that, okay? And thank you again!"HWell, I suppose that's your right... But where else will I find it?">Oh, sorry. You can go ahead, I'm not in line or anything."¶My husband is seriously ill... I've been looking all over for anything that might cure him, and I heard a rumour about a certain herb, but I can't find it anywhere..."`Not that I'm surprised. It's rare to find someone willing to cut off-- Oh, well, nevermind."3Anyway... I suppose I'll check again tomorrow."#Excuse me, very sorry, pardon!"(...\PN's "Rare Candy" went missing!"	Hey."I remember you."?You were the one who saved me when I was trapped in Beryl."0Well, what am I doing in a place like this?"BDon't worry, I'm still with the police. I'm here on business."LYou're that Trainer who's been taking down Team Meteor and such, right?"CNice work. I think I can trust you, so I'll tell you a secret."(I'm actually with the police force."BThe truth is, we've known about this place for quite a while."hThere was some debate on if we should step in during the city restoration, and that may yet happen."WBut for the time being, the chief's orders are just to monitor and leave it alone.",I can sort of guess what he's thinking."gIf the people here think the police don't know about this place, they'll keep their business here."jThis way we can keep watching them, collect evidence, and be able to nail them when it really counts."/If we were to pull a bust here, then what?"{After a while they'd find some other cranny we don't know about to do their dirty work in, and we'll lose control that way.""So, you can leave this to us."8We'll make sure this place doesn't fester too much."1Take care. Reborn's got a lot riding on you."HUSTLER: Howdy there!"*I've got a special deal just for you!"/It's a super rare 