Fwah!"5???: Voila! I am Corin-Rouge, the dashing rogue!")CORIN-ROUGE: But-- ah! My fair lady!"LI knew not 'twas you whom I sought the prize of rarity and power from--"PLittle did I know that there was a beauty of far greater rarity just about!"Alas, my heart is pained--"3How could I steal from such a precious flower?"But I must!"$Corin-Rouge stole the Pok√©mon!"FCORIN-ROUGE: Weep for me, angels, for regret shall be my undoing!"?Or perhaps not-- for what has been done, cannot be undone!"PIt is with great restraint, too, that I take from you merely this Pok√©mon.";For a lady such as you, I should steal a kiss as well."But forsooth!"#CORIN-ROUGE: It was not to be!"@Our paths are too different, my lady; our futures too vast."rBut I hope that one day you will think of me as I shall you: eyes, ravaged by beauty, and heart, by distance."Adieu."åCORIN-ROUGE: As a man ever in pursuit of the finest Pok√©mon, it would hardly do to let such a prize slip past right under my nose. As such!"@CORIN-ROUGE: And now, my getaway! May we meet again, never!"HUSTLER: Well, shucks."=By the way, we have a no refund policy, so that's rough."3Who knows? Maybe you'll see him again someday."iBut I have a feeling a man like that can stay hidden as long as the city and police are in disarray."EHUSTLER: Too bad! Who would like to claim this fantastic beast?!"FHey, stranger. Is there something I can do you for-- er, for you?"1I might be able to teach you a thing or two~"JRole Play? Yeah, I get asked for that all the time. One Purple Shard?")Sorry, sugar, I don't work for free."=Thank you kindly. Come again... if you know what I mean~"3Oh, how sweet of you! Three Blue Shards, yeah?"@Electroweb, a shocking choice! Three Green Shards for that~"ÅSky Attack? I mean, I know some people feel a high afterwards, but... How about you give me two Red Shards and we call it square." See you around, sweetheart."7ARCHER: We hadn't seen you around in a while, \PN."5I was beginning to worry something had happened."TAlthough, even if you're here now, there's probably still a lot that's gone on."-Everything's changed, except 7th Street."SBut that just goes to show you this place wasn't as safe as we thought it was."PThe Aqua Gang has kept busy too, but not with our usual method of business."UFrom the beginning, this operation was just an underhanded way to fix this city."WWhen this city started fixing itself, of course I had the other guys get involved."[Then, somewhere between purses and picks, and mortar and bricks, I realized something."Even if we fix this city,"Nothing will fix us."We're a crime rate."jWe're a pattern of habits that pull each other into backwards lifestyles with shallow justifications."+I've decided to disband the Aqua Gang."0Unfortunately, I know it's not that simple."äStudies show that recidivism among gang members is particularly high unless they have adequate alternative social and economic structures."cIn other words, nothing's going to change unless these guys have somewhere else to go instead."(For instance, if they got new jobs."@That could cover both halves of their needs fairly cleanly."@I've already talked about all of this with them, of course."2Predictably, they're not taking it seriously."ZI'll continue to try and get through to them. In the meantime, I have a task for you."ãThey don't really have the motivation for normal work, but if you could find something that would interest each of them, that might change."êWhat I want you to do is talk to everyone, figure out what kind of place they might want to work, and bring them an application from that place."9It's not like they'll ask for an application though."LYou'll probably have to be direct about it. Use it from your inventory."You understand, right?"ECome talk to me once you've got everyone else set on their path."òARCHER: What I want you to do is talk to everyone, figure out what kind of place they might want to work, and bring them an application from that place."=ARCHER: So you were able to find something for everyone?"That's a relief."(Then I guess I'm the only one left."FIt's true that I could just as well go out and search for myself,"YBut perhaps you've found something in your search for the others that might suit me?"BMy strengths lie in team coordination, research and analysis."HThese are fairly marketable skills, so I hope something matches up."!MAXWELL: \PN! There you are!")We've been looking all over for you!"7Feels like it's been ages. You've been doing good?"<We've been doing more good than you would even believe."Racking up that glory!"àBut no, I'm serious! Some of the guys were like, boohoo and whatever about pitching in with the city restoration, but we got a lot done!"UI think it's eye-opening, to be able to look at something, point to it, and say,"That, right there."I did that.""That was a difference I made.",It's what we've been chasing all along."It's a legacy, you know?"'That's why I've decided something."$I'm breaking up the Magma Gang."I don't have any regrets."7For how the city was before, it was our best play."FBut with how things are going now, it'd just be weighing us down.">We have a chance to rebuild this city from the ground up!"MIt's not just the stones we lay the foundation for, but the spirits too!"OBut if they stay cooped up in places like these, they'll never learn that."=7th Street is the only place that hasn't changed at all."Not one bit!"Isn't that weird?""Something feels off about it."7That's how I know the other path is the right one!"hIn order to get the other guys to understand how to shape a future we can hold dear, what do we do?"VI think a lot of them don't have the confidence or skills for that kind of thing."JThat's why it'd be best to start with a small commitment, like a job."1If they had something to work at every day--" Something legal, mind you--"KI think they'd begin to understand how to take pride in a normal life."&That's why I want you to help me!"UI've already talked to the others about it, but they're not having a word of it.",It's all "work this" and "effort that.""VI'll talk some sense into them, but in the meantime, I want you to do me a favor!"jHave a word with everyone and see if you can think of anywhere they might actually want to get a job."&Still, they won't go seek it out."pBut if you bring them an application from a place that sparks their interest, there might just be a chance!"oI don't care if they don't want it, just shove it right in their faces from your item pocket or something!"DAfter you've got everyone sorted, then come see me. You got it?" Let's redefine glory, baby!"sMAXWELL: Have a word with everyone and see if you can think of anywhere they might actually want to get a job."0MAXWELL: You got everyone already? Rock on!"DWell, there's one more matter I was hoping to get your help in."NIt's kind of embarrassing-- but I've also never really held a normal job.""Even so, I want to start now!"eI want to work somewhere where I can make people smile, and leave glory shining in their hearts!"MIf I can make a difference, even for one person, that would be worth it."2But as for a job that would let me do that..."I'm at a loss."6Do you think anywhere like that exists in Reborn?"=Maybe it doesn't yet... but what will I do in that case?"8My friend! Why don't you see what I can do for you?"(Hey, ain't it my favorite customer!"@You recognize your friend in the Pok√©mon trading business?"iThings struck a sour note after you swept my last stock and I got the fuzz on my tail for some time."6But you know how I roll. They can't keep me down!"WAnd a guy's gotta pull Shards somehow, so here I am, now in the teachin' business."$Nothin' wrong with that, right?"1So, why don't you see what I can do for you?"4I can teach your crew some of this kinda stuff."NKnock Off? With a price of only 8 Red Shards, it's practically a rip off!"DHey, you may be my favorite customer, but this isn't a charity!"1You gotta have the Shards to learn the arts!"Always a pleasure!"EFor just 7 Purple Shards, this Iron Head is practically a Steel!"DGiga Drain brings the pain! For 6 Green Shards, it's your gain!"JThis may be Liquidation, but there ain't no sale, kid! 6 Blue Shards!"I'll be seeing you around!"UHello! Are you prepared to be amazed by the amazing moves of the Move Magician?!"nSplendid! Just say the word and Paras-to Change-o! Your Pok√©mon can learn one of these splendid attacks!"`Tricks! My specialty. For two purple shards, I'll show you how you confound your opponents!"ABut don't you have Shards? I need enough to pay back Agate--"gI mean... If I don't have Shards, I won't have enough mana to teach your Pok√©mon! Yes, that's it!"MAbra! Kadbra! And Alomomola! Your Pok√©mon is now one move more amazing!"fAh yes, I can see it clearly now! Your Pok√©mon will learn Defog for the price of two Red Shards!"{Laser Focus, is it? It won't even take an ounce of focus for me to pass that on! Just give me one Blue Shard and it's done!"iThe classic switcharooni! For one Green Shard, you too will make skills move in the blink of an eye!"1Headbutt is gonna run you three Blue Shards."1Bounce is gonna run you three Purple Shards."2Heal Bell is gonna run you four Green Shards."0Bug Bite is gonna run you three Red Shards."1An advertisement is plastered on the wall...""The amazing Agate Circus!")Featuring carnies, clowns and chaos!".Now with the famed Agate Ace Triumvirate!"oTake the challenge and face off against three Reborn League Leaders in a spectacular showcase smack- down!"Just west of Agate City!"Buy"No"Water Pulse"Last Resort"Super Fang"Shock Wave"Yes"Role Play"
