 to ask his help in finding Luna, Bennett has proven a surprisingly useful assistant."BENNETT: Naturally."'I also would do anything for Luna."DThis ceremony you spoke of will be beneficial to her, you said?"UELIAS: Indeed, it is a necessary step for her emotional and spiritual wellbeing."We will begin shortly."GUntil then, please see that \PN is confined safely in the dungeon."-We shall deal with that annoyance later."0BENNETT: Then, \PN, if you would follow me?"9Not that you have much of a choice with our numbers.":Light shall consumeth all within its cleansing fires."
xx-xx"4All shall be white before the eyes of the Lord.")The New World, too, shalt be Reborn."HFrom the memories of eons passed and visions of eons yet to come..."&Suffer not the heretic to escape."Suffer in defeat."5Those without Arceus' light shall surely perish."4Sure is nice to be sanctioned in Arceus' light."It hurts..."I'm so cool."Won't you ascend with us?"Shame."'Misery will be all of our undoing."7Punish the fools who desecrate the Lord's chamber!"You, too, will be judged.")Repent now if you care for yourself."Repent, sinner."/You reject Arceus. So he shall reject you."EThis world is old, and forsaken. Thou art a fool to cling to it."I give my life!"End me... \n...No?"6For what then, shall I live, but the Lord Arceus?"0The Lord shall be witness to your downfall."The Lord favours you."How could he betray us?"Arceus, grant me strength!"Dear Lord..."3Alas, our High Priest shall not bow so easily."ACE: Did you miss me~?"nI'm afraid the nature of show business is such that my work takes me behind the scenes from time to time,"JBut still, I was ever-so impressed with your display against Radomus!"&He's a history with us, you see--"#An illusionist, much like me--"WAnd you taking him out of the picture for just a moment was all the cue we needed!"tWhile 'tis true that a favor done freely deserves one in kind, I'm afraid that this act is one that must go on!"Boss's orders and all."PThe family has business above, and it rather requires you to not interfere."bInstead of intervention, I must insist on instigating an immediate intermission this instant!"(Let the curtain fall alongside you!"'But then, what am I if not a fool?"6ACE: Well, it's another embarrassing mishap then."Delightful."2Perhaps I truly have outstayed my usefulness."rThey've no need for my real talents with "T" about, and paltry tricks can only keep one relevant for so long.")Tell me, \PN, what is family to you?"\Is it those with whom you share blood and status, or those with whom you share loyalty?"#ACE: As many would surely say."@You know, I first came to this region because of my cousin.")She's one for the spotlight as well,"[But her head is always too far in the clouds to see the rest of us down on the ground.";Despite our kinship, I hardly registered on her radar."Pity, isn't it?"DWhat is one to do when shooed offstage but to find a new venue?"%And here was one that needed me."%ACE: It is a lovely lie to tell."*Yet, what is loyalty but an illusion?"HIt is a promise of intentions in a future which cannot be promised."1Still, for some of us, we have nothing else."NWe cling to fantastical illusions because the truth is too empty to face."4And here was a group that needed such promises."3Their goals are neither ignoble nor righteous."But they were family,"And I needed that."%LUNA: Please, stop this already!"Get your hands off of me!"?ACE: Ah, it appears the moment for monologuing has passed."9Let us see what business our happy family is at now."ELIAS: I see neither steel nor charlatan can bar you from thrusting yourself into matters which need not concern you, \PN."So be it."<If you are so determined, you may observe our ceremony."But you will ONLY observe."Bennett?"bELIAS: Move so much as one muscle, and I'll have my assistant put an end to your friend here."SCAIN: Ughh, if you're going to have me tied up, at least ask for my safe word."@ELIAS: Even in these sacred halls, your perversion abounds."&CAIN: I've heard that one before."2BENNETT: Please stop saying things like that."*CAIN: I'm not taking orders from you~" You are sooooo not my type.""What is your hair even doing?"JBENNETT: My time is better spent on studies than on perms, thank you."0ACE: You could stand to find room for both."*For some, presentation is everything!"PCAIN: I don't know how I feel about you of all people backing me up here..."BACE: Ah, still smarting about the taller of my tales, are we?"<As I said just moments ago, loyalty is but an illusion!"7Loyalty is nothing but an illusion, little friend!"HWe allow ourselves to be deceived when it is most convenient to us."4And was it not convenient indeed, for you then?"fIt nearly led you to your own family-- had you but the heart to take a few steps further forward."iELIAS: It seems it is all too easy for the young to turn their back on those to whom they are bound."0Yet what right have you to do so, my child?">You, especially, who are raised in service of stability--"3Selfishness can only be abided by for so long."iThere is a legacy far greater than you or I at stake here, and I cannot permit you to stray from it."bAs my master and I did once resent this, we eventually came to accept our place in the world."So, too, must you."BIt is a necessary movement for the sake of your moral health."BFor you, and for the sanctity of your faith, I shall do this."8LUNA: You may find that I yet have plenty of faith,"NBut rather than in scripture or legacy, I prefer to have faith in myself."dWhat I know, feel, and hold to be true is greater than the rules which tradition bade I follow."'I would not be who I am otherwise."3ELIAS: Who you are has led you too far astray."8It is exactly for that reason that we must do this."^ELIAS: We will begin by correcting your sacrilegious appearance with a shave of the head."^It is unbecoming and antithetical to the traditional style of the servants of our family,"]And I believe you have placed too much fantasy in your notions of looking a certain way."LUNA: Wait, please--".ELIAS: Defaeco, Purgo... Silentium, Pupa."0BENNETT: Sir-- is this... really necessary?"FACE: You're not going to win any favor that way, that's for sure."3ELIAS: You would speak out of line against me?"On this, of all things?"LAnd here I thought you understood that we were doing this for her sake."QThe nail that sticks out will be hammered down, as like that into the cross."TBENNETT: I don't see how she is going to be bettered by you cutting her hair..."&ELIAS: It is a vessel of her ego."1Her resistance only speaks to its necessity."1Let us not forget that humility is a virtue.",BENNETT: No, this doesn't seem right..."IELIAS: You say that only because you are puppet to your own fancies."nYou resent the change in appearance because you are, yourself, caught up in perceiving her a certain way."5Her body exists as an instrument of her virtue--"8Its priority is not for your lecherous consumption."tIf you truly cared about her, you would understand that this is a necessary step for her to correct her spirit."VACE: The boy's motives may be in question, but I'm afraid his point still stands."GWhy do you think magicians always ask the audience to pick a card?"8It is their consent and participation that matters!"HWhat good is the end result if they never had a chance to alter it?"5ELIAS: She has had far too many chances already."She is spoiled for it."?I shall not begrudge her to sins and delusions any longer."1This WILL be done, by my hand or the Lord's."%???: I'm not so sure about that."???: Lights!"Cameras!"Draaama~"GARDEVOIR: Bye bye now~!"LUNA: Master!?"-RADOMUS: You will stay your hand, Elias."?RADOMUS: And if you don't mind, we'll be taking this back."5Radomus grabbed the Amethyst Pendant from Elias!"SGARDEVOIR: Bennett, darling, would you mind stepping away from the pretty boy?"-BENNETT: Gardevoir, it's been a while..."JThis is quite a far cry from the way you behave at my mother's place.":GARDEVOIR: I suppose you were there too, weren't you?"8I hardly noticed-- since I was only there for Luna."TAnd to be honest, dear Bennett, I never liked the way you looked at her anyway."2BENNETT: Nobody asked your opinion on that..."7GARDEVOIR: And what if it makes her uncomfortable?"0Can you really get off, thinking like that?"$Oh, but perhaps you really did!"!BENNETT: It's not like that!"%CAIN: \PN! Help me release Luna!"LUNA: Everyone..."%ELIAS: Unhand me at once, swine!")RADOMUS: I'm afraid I can't do that."WSomeone has to act in Luna's defense, seeing as a certain biological father won't.",And return that key while you're at it!"JThis Amethyst Pendant is very important to me in particular, you see."ELIAS: Tch, so be it!"?If we are making shows of force, then here is one for you."%I revoke your birthright, child."6Elias ripped the Emerald Brooch from Luna's neck!"=ELIAS: Since you are clearly unwilling to live up to it."CAIN: There, she's free!"LUNA: Gracious..."<RADOMUS: I believe we've no further business here then."%Gardevoir, do we have a retreat?"=ELIAS: As if I will simply allow you to leave unopposed!"ACE: No, I think you will.""ACE: The show is over, Elias.">Whatever you hoped to accomplish cannot be done by force."PI won't allow you to make the matter worse for everyone by trying to do so.":ELIAS: After everything, even you presume to defy me?")And what of the family you spoke of?"+ACE: And what did I say about loyalty?"8Is this really the kind of family you want to have?"@ACE: I did say loyalty was only an illusion of convenience."<But is this really the kind of family you want to have?"!Because I don't think it is."(Go, little heroes-- be on your way!"(I will see that his hand is stayed."0GARDEVOIR: You don't have to tell me twice!"Hang on tight, everyone~"???: Oh, little hero~"*...\PN's Soul Candle suddenly lights!"3The fragments of Dark Matter began resonating!"Father Elias has left us."SHe said he cares not if you return; he has urgent business with another party."`We will follow him, and we will trust in Elias above us, as he trusts in Arceus above life."Cedo, Vergo, Libenter."
