 a certain biological father won't.",And return that key while you're at it!"JThis Amethyst Pendant is very important to me in particular, you see."ELIAS: Tch, so be it!"?If we are making shows of force, then here is one for you."%I revoke your birthright, child."6Elias ripped the Emerald Brooch from Luna's neck!"=ELIAS: Since you are clearly unwilling to live up to it."CAIN: There, she's free!"LUNA: Gracious..."<RADOMUS: I believe we've no further business here then."%Gardevoir, do we have a retreat?"=ELIAS: As if I will simply allow you to leave unopposed!"ACE: No, I think you will.""ACE: The show is over, Elias.">Whatever you hoped to accomplish cannot be done by force."PI won't allow you to make the matter worse for everyone by trying to do so.":ELIAS: After everything, even you presume to defy me?")And what of the family you spoke of?"+ACE: And what did I say about loyalty?"8Is this really the kind of family you want to have?"@ACE: I did say loyalty was only an illusion of convenience."<But is this really the kind of family you want to have?"!Because I don't think it is."(Go, little heroes-- be on your way!"(I will see that his hand is stayed."0GARDEVOIR: You don't have to tell me twice!"Hang on tight, everyone~"???: Oh, little hero~"*...\PN's Soul Candle suddenly lights!"3The fragments of Dark Matter began resonating!"Father Elias has left us."SHe said he cares not if you return; he has urgent business with another party."`We will follow him, and we will trust in Elias above us, as he trusts in Arceus above life."Cedo, Vergo, Libenter."
