g."SAMSON: Hey, MOVE IT!"-Why not pick up a boost to your boosts?!"BNo better place than here to have a life-changing experience!"|At 32 bonus EVs a pop and 100% stray EV-proofing satisfaction guaranteed, you've no need to shy away from these babies!"bWith business between booming and literally unable to leave, Agate Circus is looking to hire!"NAre you interested in fun, festivities, and fantastical fantasies galore?"Take an application today!"3Hey howdy ho! Wanna life-changing experience?!"LWell we're fresh out of those! But we can give you a name-changing one!"4Would you like to change a Pok√©mon's nickname?" Which Pok√©mon will it be?!".If you ever got some change, come around!"<Let us call him... Egg! Cuz that's what it is, ya dolt!"+Yes yes yes! Let's change it! Forever!"+Presto changerino! Your new name is..."%\v[3]! That's it! Done and sold!"%\v[5]! That's it! Done and sold!"zPresto-Poncho-Pineco Change-o! Allow us to change the very essence of your Pok√©mon-- Ability Capsules are sold here!".The next one goes for \v[180] Red Shards!"/The next one goes for \v[180] Blue Shards!"0The next one goes for \v[180] Green Shards!"1The next one goes for \v[180] Purple Shards!";Don't be shy! Potential is your middle name, and ours!"WKeep 'em coming, friends and countrymen, there's plenty more where that came from!"RGotta get the Shards if you want the stuff! Shards can be won from the front!"No need? No problem!"Who's next? Don't be shy!"%General goods and trinkets here!"PStep right up and try our challenge for a chance to win a special HM, Dive!"5It costs one Blue Shard to play. Are you ready!?"?Hey there, Trainer! We've got a special challenge for you!"WYou can win a very rare Pok√©mon, on a chance to play for only three Green Shards!"Wanna give a go?!"dGreat! Now all you gotta do is shift around the tiles to put the image together. Simple, right?"You've got it!"And your prize!"$We hope to see you in sometime!"jIt seems you don't have it with you-- Shard tokens can be bought at the front counter! Help yourself!"^Anybody? Come try a brand-new challenge! You haven't faced this one before, we guarantee!"DONPHAN: DOOOON!!!"WRONGPHAN: WRROOOOONG!!!"QStep right up and try our challenge for a chance to win a rare fossil prize!"4It costs one Red Shard to play. Are you ready!?"bIt seems you don't have it with you-- Shard tokens can be won at the front, near the Big Top!"#Chance your luck, win a prize!"6It costs one Green Shard to play. Are you ready!?"PIt seems you don't have it with you-- Shard tokens can be won at the front!"Check it out, win a prize!"CIEL: Please forgive me."5I'm afraid I'm not fit to perform at the moment."Not on a stage,"Nor face to face,"Nor anywhere else.";I may act like a star, but it is just that, after all."XNo matter how clean the makeup is, I know I'm just a country girl in over her head."Often literally."YI grew up in a farm town where the most exciting thing was watching the clouds pass."SI didn't have much in the way of friends, nor avenues with which to meet them."SJust a family that was fractured in exactly as mundane a way as anyone else's."1It was somewhere between drab and vexatious."9One day, a traveling circus came to the nearby city."6My cousin and I snuck away to meet it, and just--"The lights--"The sounds--"Complete sensory overload."I was sick for a week."#But the people were fantastic."9The stars were all good and well, but the audience--"THEY were something."JEveryone from bleacher to bleacher couldn't help but smile and cheer."HI felt more love in that little tent than I had in most of my life."QAnd I was sure that such amazing performers could never be bored, or lonely."#If I could just be like them--"But no."I never could."/I am just a bumpkin flailing in the silks."9I don't have half of their talent, grace, or beauty."`My knees are too stubby, my shoulders too broad, and good graces, have you SEEN my dimples?"DHow anyone finds the strength to put palm to palm is beyond me."7I am sure it is an act of charity, if not mockery."JMy own carelessness pushed my kin away, sights set on stars too high."And even so--"The others never minded."USamson had always looked out for me, no matter how much I rejected his advances."'And Terra-- obnoxious as she was--"7They didn't think about whether I was real or not."They were just there."EBrutish and clamorous and altogether the picture of indecency..."(But I do have such fond memories..."And now they're gone.""Pack it up; the show is over."+Better go back to watching the clouds." That one looks like a star."+Perhaps I could ask for its autograph."=CIEL: I thought stardom might bring me closer to others."CIt turns out that admiration is just another form of distance."%WAHOO! WHO WANTS SOME NEW TOYS?!"7IRON TAIL FOR JUST FOUR BLUE SHARDS. WHAT A STEEL!"EWHAT DO YOU MEAN YOU'VE HEARD THAT ONE?? MY PUNS ARE METAL!!!!!!"8NOP-A-NOPE. YOU NEED MORE SHARDS FOR THAT. BAZINGA!"YOWZA! CHECK THAT POWER!"#FALCON--!! THREE GREEN SHARDS!">YOU KNOW THE DRILL! DROP AND GIVE ME FOUR! PURPLE SHARDS!""PHOTOSYNTHESIS! I AM A PLANT!"TREE RED SHARDS">GET YOUR POWER MOVES HERE! ALL ABOARD THE SWAGGIN' WAGON!"Hello, Trainer!"6Can I interest you in buying a pack of Pok√©Snax?"yPok√©Snax are a delicious treat for your Pok√©mon! Feeding your Pok√©mon Pok√©Snax will make them that much happier!"But that's not at all!"|Just by having these delicious, nutritious sweet treats to eat, rare wild Pok√©mon will be more likely to approach you!"GI don't mean random encounters in the grass-- who would want that?"fBut on special occasions other Pok√©mon that would otherwise shy away might pay attention to you."So what do you say?"Care to buy up some Snax?"2Are YOU ready to take the Rainbow Challenge?!"oFace off against one of our patent color-theme dream-teams in the ring and win yourself a new shard thing!"Will you do it!?"LMarvelous! And now-- we spin the Wheel of Color to determine your fate!"DYour lucky color today is..