ts the floor hard will activate it."ÜBut since Fighting moves take strong power stances, they end up triggering the panels too. See if you can get a bonus from it as well!"VAlternatively, you might use Ciel's type advantage part of the field against him."Some Flying-type attacks like Acrobatics and Bounce can make an extra splash around the Big Top with Ciel's aerial scaffolding.":A few of those, and Samson should go down in no time!"Good luck!"EAME: Glad you picked up. I heard from Cal about what's going on."FI never would have thought Terra of all people would be a Meteor."3I mean, I never liked her anyway, so whatever."wI patched into her computer after I heard there was something up with it, and I can see it reporting her presence."pI'm not going to question how she managed to enter a computer world at all; that girl already defies logic."RI'm running an analysis right now. Hold on, and I'll tell you what to expect."The results are strange."TIt looks like the computer environment is set up to simulate an old video game."OIn this game, attacks are physical or special based on what type they are."äPlus, the Special Attack and Special Defense stats are treated as a single value-- it looks like it works off of whichever stat is higher."IFinally, the Dark-, Steel- and Fairy-types seem to have been erased."%This all sounds familiar, right?"XKeep these things in mind when you're in there. I know you can do what's necessary."$AME: So you need to fight Ciel?"ÇRight. This won't be the first time you've fought on this field, so try to keep in mind everything you used before against Samson."BUnlike Samson's all-out offense, Ciel plays more defensively."PMany of her Pok√©mon have bulky set-ups, so they can be hard to power down."zBut, Ciel is a performer at heart, and it shows in her battles, as she prefers to use dancing and sound- based moves."UAnd being in an arena, it's the perfect place for those things to get her going."^If you can set up and knock her down before she even gets in the air, you should do well!"OBut if she gets her act in the air, it's gonna be a long way down for you."CIEL: Shall we dance?"0CIEL: Right, show me everything you've got!"ACIEL: Take your time, darling. I want your best performance!"ARINGMASTER: All right, that was very well done, both of you!"CIEL: Naturally~"RINGMASTER: BUT."2No more stunts like that in the future, Ciel."CIEL: Who, me?"5I haven't a clue what you might be referring to."hRINGMASTER: The only reason I went with it is because we ARE short on performances with Terra gone."BCIEL: Thank you for your benevolence and mercy, young master~" RINGMASTER: "Young master"?"#Go back to sassing each other."'I've got a closing ceremony to do!"SAMSON: Nice."#CIEL: I don't want to hear it!"%My battle was better than yours."So ha-ha~"$SAMSON: Whatever you say, lass."WI think we can agree that both of our battles beat getting lost in a digital void."RI'm not really in the mood to banter though, so I'm gonna go blow some steam."
