tally-not-my-fashion-inspirations..."Oi, Trainer!"II've been cooped up this whole time-- can we finally get outta here?"äI've been itching to hike up Route 4 again, but we haven't even been able to leave our homes what with all those laser-whatchamacollits..."=You think this time that I can get all the way to Agate?"..."+Maybe that's not such a good idea now."Hail, Trainer!"VThanks to you, I've finally been able to get out and hike to the heart's content!""I'll go all the way to Agate!" No, all the way to Charous!"Oh, finally."UWe've been inside for so long, I was starting to forget what sunlight felt like!"*What do you mean I'm being dramatic?!"-How could you accuse me of such a thing?"I'm wounded!"
Hurt!"DMy back hurts from sitting inside for so long! And I'm only 24!"#...Maybe I'll just take a nap."6...Huh, you actually went and did it? We're safe?"6Now I can finally play Call of Shooting in peace!"AYou know, without worrying about getting hit by a death ray."8There's this one player I keep matching up against."And losing to."XI swear, if he tries to give me a visual aid of what teabagging is one more time..."!Talk about insult to injury."3SHELLY: It's not the same here without Cain..."0Why... Why did it have to happen like that?"\Cain and I went to go look for Anna and Noel and eventually he found that old building."VWe stepped inside to have a look around, and we didn't see anything suspicious..."E...Until we tried to leave, and found the door had been blocked."UWhen we were trying to figure out what to do, I suddenly felt incredibly sleepy,"SAnd the next thing I know, I woke up surrounded by everyone inside that place."RUm, I... I heard that I inconvenienced you when you went to stop Team Meteor."I'm sorry for that...")But really, I just want Cain back..."6I wish I could have done something to save him..."'Thinking about this isn't helping.".I'll go try to talk to someone instead..."SAPHIRA: Well met, \PN."LMeteor's attack seems to have ceased for now, but I'll remain vigilant."GI wouldn't put it past them to just wait until we lower our guard.";So a Team Meteor agent turned off the machine herself?"4That does explain why the barrier has remained."LOne was configured to Calcenon's power system, and one to Labradorra's."zOnce Team Meteor reactivates the PULSE Clawitzer or switches it to the Labradorra power grid, the attack will resume."(Until it is destroyed, I will wait."VNo matter how long it lasts, I won't take any risks with my sisters in this city."ASAPHIRA: I will remain here until I'm sure the city is safe."?I'm sure there are others who need to speak to you though."AYA: Let go of me already!"Stop it!"HARDY: Aya!"'SIRIUS: Good, you're here as well."Our terms are simple.")We know you have the Ruby Ring, \PN."2Give it to us, or the girl's life is forfeit."2SAPHIRA: We aren't interested in negotiating." HARDY: Like hell we aren't!"This is Aya's life!""\PN! Just give them the Ring!"9SAPHIRA: Whatever you do, do not give them the Ring."+HARDY: It's a stupid piece of jewelry!" It's not worth killing her!"*AYA: Apparently some people disagree."No surprise there."3SAPHIRA: Team Meteor is not a pack of thieves."2The Ruby Ring is not just a ring; it's a key."HARDY: Does that matter?"9They're gonna kill her if you don't give it to them."ASAPHIRA: They're going to kill her if we do give it to them.")HARDY: That doesn't even make sense!"ZI bet you wouldn't be saying the same thing if it was one of your sisters over there!"SAPHIRA: Wrong.""That doesn't change anything."*HARDY: Ugh! You don't make any sense!"uFirst you say you'll do anything for your family and then you say you'd willingly let her die for a stupid ring?"1CHARLOTTE: Oh, so that's what this is about."\PN's Ruby Ring?"SAPHIRA: That's right.".Team Meteor is holding that girl hostage."CHARLOTTE: ...So, Sis."BYou'd really let me die over something so insignificant, huh?"HARDY: Oh, boy..."$CHARLOTTE: \PN! What about you?"YWould you be so callous as to throw me to the dogs for the sake of some stupid ring?"#CHARLOTTE: Oh, how could you?!"WIf that's how it's going to be, then I just need to steal the Ring to save myself!"7HARDY: Uh, wasn't it just a hypothetical question?"(CHARLOTTE: I knew you'd understand!"%Then give me the Ruby Ring, now."6If you meant what you said, you'll give it to me!"CHARLOTTE: Now!""Charlotte took the Ruby Ring!"CHARLOTTE: Team Meteor!"I'll give you the Ring!"rI have to run so these people don't take it back, but I'll give it to you at the power supply Control Center!"Meet me there!"HARDY: Charlotte, no!"SAPHIRA: Hardy, stop."SIRIUS: Hmph."I'll send someone down."AYA: Ow, ow, ow!"Stop dragging me around!"xHARDY: Yo, look, I don't expect anybody else to care about her like I do, but you could at least try giving a damn!"'SAPHIRA: Do you have any siblings?"HARDY: Do I-- What?"Yea, I have a sister."You remind me of her.")You're both impossible to deal with.""SAPHIRA: So you're not close."sBut when you've been through as much as my sisters and I have, you learn to have absolute faith in each other."All we have is each other."5If we doubted that, there would be nothing left."?HARDY: That's some kinda absolute faith you got, for sure."BShe just got upset and ran off with our only way to save Aya!"SAPHIRA: No."=She just saved Aya herself, at least for the time being."'HARDY: What are you talking about?"_SAPHIRA: Because of her, Team Meteor no longer believes we have anything of value to them.";Therefore, they have no reason to threaten Aya's life."2\PN, if you want to confirm this, follow her."*You know where she was headed, right?" The same way you just came."SAPHIRA: Follow Charlotte."VShe said she headed to the Labradorra- Calcenon Control Center, beneath the city."6The same one you were at before, as I understand."8SAPHIRA: I'm your worst fucking nightmare, Sigmund."Watch where you sleep."!SAPHIRA: So you're here too."(SIGMUND: You seem to be doing well.";SAPHIRA: This barrier is your life right now, Sigmund."WWhen it goes out, I swear on my own life, I will seek you out and strike you down."'SIGMUND: Yes, yes, I'm well aware."GI see you still derive personal comfort from threats to authority."/SAPHIRA: You aren't the authority anymore."This isn't your jailhouse."wSIGMUND: And yet by the law's discretion, as you well know, I am still the legal guardian of your youngest sister."I'm the guardian."You're the threat."Get out of my sight."CSIGMUND: You are not in a position to give me orders, Saphira."8SAPHIRA: Right. You get those from Team Meteor now?"!Just how low can a man sink?"-SIGMUND: I care nothing for their goals."+But there is something I must confirm."-SAPHIRA: Enough. Your excuses sicken me."%I'm done with this conversation."SAPHIRA: I'm not moving."Not until Calcenon is..."...Sorry."I'm awake."I can stay awake."I'll be fine."JI'll do everything I can for my family, no matter the cost to myself."*"Calcenon City Gym: Caroline Belrose""CAIN: Heyyyy, \PN."No word on Aya yet."@Hardy and Saphira are beating their heads against a wall..."Occasionally literally."qMeteor was predictably peeved when Charlotte never showed up with the Ring, but they know you have it again."dSooo in other words, Meteor hasn't done anything because you haven't been around with the Ring."6If you ask me, I think it might be best that way."HSo try to keep a low profile if you have business here, sound 'kay?"(CHARLOTTE: Hello, Earth to Saphira."EIf you don't sleep, you're gonna collapse on the spot, you know?"1Well, \PN, things are going swimmingly here."MLaura has outright disappeared and Saphira has gone legitimately insane."#I hope you've had better luck."Out cold."8HARDY: I'm not gonna give up. I'll save Aya myself."HARDY: They have Aya."#I'll definitely make them pay!"	Aye!"C'mon out here, Meteors!"HARDY: Agh..."
Aya!!"SAPHIRA: Stop."Someone's coming.";FERN: Haha, so that's why you picked your type, Hardy?""Cuz you're as dumb as a rock?"FERN: Sup, nerds."8You know you're not gonna get through this barrier."#HARDY: Why are YOU over there?"FERN: Simple."I side with the winners."4And at least here, I can actually do some good."II figured it out when I went back to Chrysolia looking for that kid."1Their whole base had been torn in, you know?"A few didn't make it out."&A few did, because I helped them."They actually needed me."gAnd when they finally finish what they set out to do, I'll be in my rightful place at the top too."ILooks like your little girlfriend's just another pawn in their game!"HARDY: Give her back, now!"FERN: As if."2But I'll give her a kiss for you if you want."HARDY: Don't you dare."FERN: Just kidding.",I wouldn't touch her if she paid me to.".HARDY: Mate, I swear on everything holy--"CWhen I get through this wall, I'mma punch your entire face in."'FERN: If you get through the wall."5Wanna keep slamming your head into it some more?"XI'm pretty sure you won't get a concussion for at least another two or three tries,"/But I'm always open to being proven wrong."+That said, some of us have work to do."Later, losers!".SAPHIRA: He seems like a pleasant person."+HARDY: Tch. That's not the half of it."But I'm not gonna give up."I'll save Aya myself."HARDY: Tch."7"Absolute faith" always ends up broken in the end."0We have to take matters into our own hands.">NOEL: I don't really think I'm crucial to anyone's plans."<I don't have a reason to fight like everyone else does."I'll still help."!But it's not quite the same."!You should just go on ahead."$HARDY: I'm not good at waitin'."8There's gotta be something I can DO for Aya, yanno?"I'mma think of something."/Let's set aside Team Meteor for a moment--"<Being trapped on the same side of that barrier as Fern?"Now THAT's torture." CHARLOTTE: Oh, you're back.")I'm still here, stuck on guard duty.">AKA 'make faces at Team Meteor through the barrier' duty."<It's tedious, but at least Saphira's sleeping for once."UOf course, only on the promise that I'd wake her up the second anything happens." But like I'm gonna do that."7Besides, it seems like it's already too late, huh?"KCHARLOTTE: Can we just burn Labradorra City down or something already?"Trust me, I'm a pro."IThen again, I guess Dad's Gym was there, so Saphira wouldn't let me."cShe went down to the Power Control Center under the city to see if there's anything we can do."|That barrier is using so much energy from Labradorra's power grid that it seems like they can't power their offensive PULSE."BThat's why they'd tapped into Calcenon's power supply before."pSis realized that, if they could do anything to us still, they would have already, so she's eased up a bit."=But she went down there to make sure it would stay safe."'And people keep disappearing here."APick me next, mysterious vanishing force. I'm bored already."CAIN: Anna!" Ohhh, \PN! You're not Anna."I hope."*Sorryyy, we're a little on edge here."%And not the good kind of edge..."/All of the sudden, the twins went missing!"QAnna said Nostra wanted to show her something and that they'd be right back."I shoulda gone with them."[Hardy and I have been searching all over for them, but there's totally no sign at all."%I have a bad feeling about this."0Have things been going better on your side?"HARDY: Yo."#Things ain't feelin' too good."@Some girl ridin' a Salamence dropped Shelly off here again."?When she heard the twins were missing, she got real upset."TShe insisted that we go find them right away and then stormed right outta here.".I thought she was more timid than that...":Anyway, Cain went with her to make sure she was safe."]Maybe the two of them are still out lookin' somewhere, but it's been a minute already..."0I'm worried that they won't be comin' back."LUMI: Hi, \PN!"+Don't you think the air here is great?"XIt's been a long time since I've been able to stop and enjoy something like this..."8I hope you don't take things like that for granted."I know I did."LUMI: Oh, hi..."EI don't mean to be rude, but I kind of want to be alone for now.">It's not something I've had a lot of chance for lately..."2By the way, have you talked to my sister yet?"/She wanted to tell you about a few things."1LUMI: Umm... Is that boy over there, like..."
Okay?"=I keep wandering over to peek, even though I shouldn't--"#But I'm just worried, I swear!"ANNA: Another! Another!""ANNA: Tell me more about Mom!"How did you two meet?":RADOMUS: I'm afraid I can't answer that one properly."&She met me long before I met her."+At first, it was a day like any other,"zAnd at second, I was being dragged away by a woman I'd never seen before, who seemed to already know my every secret,")As if I had told them to her myself."@I suspect that is something you can understand well enough."ANNA: Whoa..."NOEL: This is pointless."NI don't know what I expected from finding our father, but it wasn't this."&RADOMUS: Can I ask you something?"ANNA: Of course!"YRADOMUS: Is there perhaps anything about me that's different from most other people?"=Something you might see that others don't, for instance."ANNA: Hmm..."4Aside from an amazing collection of hats, nope!"Not that I can tell!"5RADOMUS: I see... So that's the same as for her."CRADOMUS: I suppose the final battle will begin soon, won't it?"Anna is still absent."=I suspect she intends to keep it that way for some time."And with Noel...",I feel as if I am already in checkmate."<Any move I can take with him seems to be the wrong one."'But that is not a game I may quit."So, how to play..."RRADOMUS: Lost time cannot be recovered, but better times can always be found."hStill, I will be beyond content to play the role of the father I haven't been for as long as I may."=For the time being, I must entrust the rest to you, \PN.",SAPHIRA: Laura being safe isn't enough."!She should be here, with us."QIf ANYTHING happens to her under that boy's watch, he will dearly regret it.""CHARLOTTE: It was her choice."What's the big deal?"GIf she wants to prance off with some new boy toy, then forget her."She can."8In the meantime, maybe try not to have an aneurysm."%CHARLOTTE: And she's gone again."!Out to find Laura, no doubt."Guess I'll stay put here."`If she gets back and I'm gone, I'm pretty sure she'll just up and die of shock on the spot."Thanks, "Mom".",CHARLOTTE: You guys save the world yet?"If not, it's cool."Save some for me."Or let it burn."HI don't care all that much as long as the ones who matter are safe."lEVE: I've told some of the others already, but there's a few things you need to know about Team Meteor."|As time went on, Zero was increasingly ostracized from the proverbial inner circle, so there is much I cannot speak to."JHowever, I can tell you in depth about their remaining PULSE systems.")There are four you must be aware of:"8PULSE-Mime, PULSE-Clawitzer, PULSE2 and Arc- PULSE."8If you want to hear their details, ask me for them."0EVE: Which PULSE do you want to know about?"PThe goal of the PULSE-Mime project was to capture and protect a large area."eOriginally, the resulting barrier was intended to encapsulate both Labradorra and Calcenon City,"óBut willful ignorance afforded me the opportunity to implement some "technological limitations", reducing its effective area to only one of the cities."{I would have liked to minimize it further, however it was difficult to implement such caveats with Zero policing our ideas."éThe PULSE-Mime relies on Labradorra City's power grid to function, meaning its function has been preserved even after shutting off Calcenon's."öOn a long range scale, the PULSE-Mime's capabilities are solely defensive, however in close quarters it is as capable of defending itself as any Pok√©mon."pThe barrier itself can only be permeated by authorized personnel as regulated by the machine system itself."iIn other words, the only way to get through it will be for someone on the inside to grant us access."eUnfortunately, even Lumi and I don't qualify to pass through it, as we were sharing Zero's body."ZThe PULSE-Clawitzer was intended to serve as high-powered super long range artillery."âIn tandem with the original conception of the PULSE-Mime, it would have turned the Labradorra- Calcenon area into an undefeatable weapon."rFortunately, I was able to reduce the effective power and range through a series of serendipitous "mistakes"."@The attacks on Calcenon City were effectively an arms test."AI am personally grateful that the damage could be minimized."ÑThe PULSE-Clawitzer was energized by Calcenon's power grid, meaning unless Meteor recaptures the station below, it is inoperational."yHowever, the Pok√©mon itself is alive and well within the barrier and continues to suffer the system's side effects."éI am relieved that Lumi is not around to hear me advise this, but the best course of mercy for that Pok√©mon would be to put it down entirely."jThe PULSE2 is an entirely separate line of PULSE systems created for mass production and portability."gWhen designing the PULSE2, I was permitted to make the safety of the affected Pok√©mon a priority,"PSo I am relieved to say that it is much less harmful than its predecessors."/In return, it is also much less effective."ÉUnlike the previous line, it is also capable of applying to any Pok√©mon, as opposed to the specific species it is constructed for."mThe PULSE2 does not cause mutations, but it also cannot amplify a Pok√©mon's strength to extreme levels."Its effect is two-fold:"DFirst, the Pok√©mon's abilities are enhanced by a small degree."îThis is done by effectively maximizing what would otherwise be considered effort values, exceeding the maximum limit that most Pok√©mon can achieve."4Second, the Pok√©mon's free will is suppressed."KStolen Pok√©mon, for example, may be controlled without fail this way."OMany high ranking Meteors have treated their Pok√©mon with PULSE2s by now." Please prepare accordingly."iThe Arc-PULSE is an incomplete project combining the functions of the PULSE2 with the original line."^Using the foundation of the original PULSE system, it is designed for a specific species."5As you may conclude from the name, it is Arceus."ôHowever, it is more akin to a PULSE2 in that it does not require a static location, and it contains a strong function to suppress a Pok√©mon's free will."UI cannot fully say what effects it would produce or if it would cause mutations,"KSince, as one might expect, Team Meteor lacks an Arceus to test it on."ÜFurther, with the demands for power, portability and control that have been placed on the project, it requires a unique energy source."ÇTeam Meteor lacks this as well, but I understand that their movements in Agate City have been dedicated to producing such a thing."The PULSE-Hypno was originally created to put Agate City to sleep and allow Team Meteor to freely search for this power source."5Its hypnotic control functions were added later."bStill, there is no evidence that a power source capable of fueling the machine exists at all."îSince that, the Arceus, and now my technical expertise are all absent from Team Meteor, I find it highly unlikely the project will ever be finished.")SERRA: "Happy little family", huh..."0Tch. I'm having these naive thoughts again."&Maybe I could stand to try again."We'll see, I guess."(SERRA: "Happy little family" huh...";SERRA: Geez, I feel like a high schooler or something."TNOEL: You'd think one would be less alone after finding their father, not more."%I guess that's not how it works."RADOMUS: Ah, \PN.":I see you were successful in obtaining another badge."FAs I ever am with your efforts, I am impressed but not surprised."-But pray tell, have you seen Anna about?"XShe said there was something she needed to do and made off alone in rather a haste.",She even insisted Noel not go with her."*I... wonder if this was for his sake.",NOEL: Why are you acting like this now?" RADOMUS: I beg your pardon?"Acting like what?"NOEL: Doting on me."Like Anna."4RADOMUS: Ah, she often takes this role for you?"NOEL: No, for you."You always focus on her."=RADOMUS: Ah, I was just worried, but I see your concern."II assure you, I don't intend to favor either of you over each other."$Both of you are precious to me."NOEL: You 