ery sorry! I dropped my necklace around here and I'm trying to find it!"VI don't want it to get buried underfoot, so I can't let anyone through right now."Really sorry!"/I'll get out of your way as soon as I can!"`I don't want it to get burried underfoot, so I don't want anyone to pass through right now."=Really sorry! I'll get out of your way as soon as I can!"&I never get bored of ice skating!"SMy mom says if I get good enough, she'll let me skate inside the mountain too!"EI love this mountain! Even if we're trapped on it, it's so cool!"8In the past, the peak was used to hold Gym Battles!"UThe old Gym Leader retired-- I dunno why, I guess he got busy with other things?"But he still lives here!"[His name is Blake Whitaker! If you see him around, would you get his autograph for me?">I'd ask him for it myself, but I'm kinda scared of him..."7A-ah... I have to hold onto the edge or I'll fall!"	Eep!"II'm so glad we can get back to playing! Everyone's happy again here!"VIt was really sad when all the food disappeared, because no one had any energy..."cBut recently, someone has been sneaking around and secretly distributing food to all the kids!"It's really cool!"What's the matter?!"Come and catch me! Nyaaaa!":Hrm. It's good to see everyone in high spirits again."âI can't remember how long it was that the streets of this city were empty, or full of vacant faces looking more like zombies than humans."!Hunger can do that to a man."~But when people in the streets started getting fed by a mysterious person, we started to gain hope back. And here we are!"SAhm. But that's all I will say about that person! They must remain mysterious!"WThe previous crisis has really taught everyone not to take daily life for granted."3That's why everyone is out having so much fun.":I kinda wish I could join them, but, I'm too old now."%I'd look silly out there, right?"#Oh? About the previous crisis?"I mean, it's not over yet."$We're still low on food, but..."PEveryone has hope, because as it turns out, this city has a Guardian Angel!"Who's that? Well..."I can't tell you!"dJust being able to stand here right now is a wonderful thing, and it's all thanks to that girl."'Oh my! I shouldn't have said that!"%Please do not tell anyone I did!"fWord has it that if the Guardian Angel's identity gets out, she won't be able to help us anymore!"II promised my son I wouldn't tell anyone, so please keep this quiet."0The air up here may be cold, but it's pure."3I'd take this life over Reborn City's any day."Hunger and all."Howdy, stranger."YYou don't look like you're dressed for this climate. Conserve heat and stay indoors."SAnd remember, try not to move around too much if you haven't got your rations."9You see, most of our foodstock disappeared recently."áWe know that Ametrine Mountain had been blocked off, but that's okay, because we always used to store plenty to live on in emergencies."NBut just when that happened, our emergency supply completely disappeared."We're not really sure how."WEver since then, the city has been living on the rations of the public food store."<It's been very difficult, but we WILL get through this!"A visitor?"9Does that mean the mountain path has been unblocked?"xI never used to like eating bread by itself, but when you're really starving, it's amazing how delicious it can be!"QPretty sure there's some zen philosophy like that or something, isn't there?"#Maybe I should visit Apophyll."Much better!"hThere's nothing to go along with a pleasant snowstorm like an entire crate of newly-reclaimed food!"+Hey hey, do you know about this house?"They say it's haunted!"VA big accident happened there years ago and the girls who were living there died!"'It's super creepy! But super cool!"`SHELLY: Hey! Um, I have a different question about what you t-told me before. Is that okay?"ìYou said before you can't tell me about the Guardian Angel who was giving you all food... but could you maybe tell us what would happen if you did?"7KID: Huh? If I told you who the Guardian Angel is?"7SHELLY: Y-yeah. Can you tell us what would happen?"kKID: Um, well, if I told you who it was and word got out, then we probably wouldn't get any more food."ISHELLY: Huh? This Guardian Angel person would do that to punish you?"KID: No! She would never!""I mean, um, they would never!"&SHELLY: I don't get it then. Why?"IKID: Um, I think it's not the Guardian Angel we have to worry about."'It's the person looking after her."<She doesn't want him finding out that she's doing it..."SHELLY: Oh... Okay."(Um... Can I ask who that person is?"9You aren't sworn to keep a secret about that, right?"KID: I... Um, I guess not.",You promise you won't let him find out?"SHELLY: Yeah! We promise!"Right, \PN?""KID: The man's name is Blake."OHe's kind of a jerk. He wears a light blue jacket and has a mohawky-thing.".SHELLY: \PN! \PN, \PN, \PN! That was him!".Huh? Cain told you Blake adopted Heather?"0Then this Guardian Angel HAS to be Heather!"<She's been the one giving food to everyone in Ametrine!"KID: Hey, quiet down!"SHELLY: Oops... Sorry!"2Um, hey, do you know where we could find her?"KID: Nu-uh."DActually, I think it's been a few days since anyone's seen her."5Maybe she went to go find us more food? I dunno."SHELLY: That's not good.",Well, m-maybe we should just ask Blake?"#KID: What?! You can't do that!"He'll find out!"SSHELLY: Don't worry! We won't say anything about her being the Guardian Angel!"2She's my friend! I'm just trying to find her!"'Can you tell us where Blake lives?"2KID: Um... It's right at the top of the hill."gI'll go leave it open for you if you want... But then I'm not gonna be involved with this anymore!"5SHELLY: Thank you so much! I'm right behind you!"SHELLY: Brrr!"1I don't know how anyone can stand this cold!"@But if Heather is here somewhere, I'll definitely find her!"#Let's split up and ask around!".I bet someone is bound to know something!"8After we talk to everyone, let's meet up somewhere."6Hm, maybe there's a suspicious place around here?"=I'm going to look for something like that once I'm done!"Good luck!"jKID: Um, well, if I told you who it was and word got out, then we probably wouldn't get anymore food." SHELLY: \PN! \PN, \PN, \PN!"That WAS him!"%I thought so, but I wasn't sure!",Maybe she went to go find us more food?"I dunno."SHELLY: Don't worry!">We won't say anything about her being the Guardian Angel!"She's my friend!"!I'm just trying to find her!"1I'll go leave it open for you if you want...":But then I'm not gonna be involved with this anymore!"SHELLY: Thank you so much!"I'm right behind you!"Locked."SHELLY: Heather!"Can you hear me?"
