I don't want her to leave me like Papa did.".Please, please, please don't let her go.""U-um... Next entry.""Dear Diary,"%Mama is with Papa now after all."%Evelynn and I are all alone now."wShe's doing her best to take care of us, and the city is helping as much as they can, but it's still really tough."!I don't want to be alone...""I have bad news."^Evelynn called the doctor and he says that I've developed the same disease that Mama had."NWe knew it ran in the family, but nobody thought it would happen so soon."Diary, I'm really scared."[The doctor says I still have at least a few years, but I don't want to die that young."I don't want to go...".I'm not ready to face Mama and Papa yet.""I feel so guilty.",Evelynn has been worried sick about me."uShe's been staying up all night, always reading and researching to see if there's anything that could be a cure."cI'm really glad that she cares about me so much, but I don't want her to push herself too far."What if she gets sick too?"/Maybe it would be better if I died sooner."2I would be less of a burden on Eve that way.""2Evelynn has been working herself to the bone."cShe's building some kind of machine that she says will enhance the healing powers of Pok√©mon."kShe says that if she can amplify her Pok√©mon's healing potential, maybe it could cure my disease too."PEve has always been really smart, but if something like that is possible..."I would be so happy!""If anyone can do it, she can."0I'm so afraid to hope, but I can't help it."%Maybe I have a chance after all."?Maybe I'll be writing to you for a very long time, Diary.""I'm scared.":Today, a man dressed in black showed up at our house."qHe said that he had heard of the machine my sister was making, and he wanted to use it for his organization."(Evelynn was going to refuse, but..."I'm so stupid...">I got in the way and he used me as a hostage against her."RNow poor Evelynn has to do whatever he says, otherwise he says he'll kill me."RWhy is it that every time I hope things can be okay, they go horribly wrong?""...Um.""The handwriting changes here."It looks really unsteady."I'm sorry."'This is going to be my last entry."OIt's really, really bizarre, but there was an accident with Eve's machine."TShe was applying the finishing touches for a test run and something went wrong."pBecause of the machine's energy, the Magneton she was testing it on accidentally evolved during the test..."D...and then because of the evolution, the machine went haywire."XOh, did you know, Diary, that when Magneton evolves, its three parts fuse into one?",...I don't know how it happened, but..."HThe machine transferred that energy into everyone who was nearby..."0...And when Magneton emerged a Magnezone..."EI was looking at my own body, like it was a mirror or something."PAnd I could hear Eve's voice, and that man's voice, and they wouldn't stop."They still don't stop."eEve says the machine's energy accidentally fused the three of our consciousnesses into one body."PI don't know what's going to happen to Evelynn and I-- our bodies, that is."!They might die without us..."4But it seems that we're going to have to leave."I hate this."But it's stupid."I hate this so much..."I got what I wanted."I won't die."#And I'll never be alone again."Ever.""SHELLY: Uh, well..."'That's an... interesting... story."3It doesn't really help us find Heather though."???: Hello?"SHELLY: Eep! Hi!""We weren't reading any diary!"???: Uh... huh."%This ain't a place for visitors."What are you doing here?"SHELLY: N-nothing!",I m-mean we were looking for s-someone!"QHave you seen a young girl, a little shorter than me, with bright pink hair?"???: ..."Can't say I have."I...Yo, aren't you the Gym Leader from the Lapis Ward in Reborn City?"SHELLY: Eep!"He knows me!"Yes, sir, I am!"???: Riiiiight. 'Kay.")SHELLY: Um, a-and, what's your name?""You look an awful lot like..."???: Nunya."'SHELLY: Hm? That's a weird name..."NUNYA?: I said it's Nunya."Nunya B. Snes."Get outta here already."SHELLY: Um... O-okay."'Why does everyone react like that?"ÉEvery time I asked someone here if they knew a girl with pink hair, they just awkwardly refused to talk and ended the conversation."2It's like they're trying to keep her from us!"...Wait."Maybe that's it!"zOne of the kids told me that he had sworn not to tell anyone about a Guardian Angel who was secretly giving out food!"%What if Heather is that person?!"_And they just don't want to talk about her because they were all sworn to keep the secret!"But why would that be?";Why would she need to keep something like that secret?"*I'm going to go find out! C'mon, \PN!"%A note is scribbled on the page:""aevianmissy""-FLORA: Ohhh, so that's how that works..."(FLORA: And... What's this part for?"PEVE: Without that, the voltage doesn't come through at the right frequency."FIt wasn't the best solution, but circumstances were... desperate."2FLORA: You really designed all this yourself?"That's so incredible!"AAnd you can't be more than a few years older than me, right?" EVE: Not much, I'm... sure."1EVE: Oh, \PN. I'm surprised to see you here."JI was just grabbing a few things for work when this student appeared."dIt seems that she's doing a paper on this kind of machinery for school, and had some questions."3EVE: ...But it seems you two have already met."^FLORA: Haha, what, no! That's totally ridiculous! I've never seen this person in my life!"YAlso, just wondering, do you usually let strangers walk into your house unannounced?"|That seems a little unsafe, perhaps? It might be good to invest in a lock, or at least start setting proper boundaries!"You could start now."XEVE: All right, one of you is going to need to tell me what's really going on here."lFLORA: Okay, so I might've bumped into \PN, and we might've talked a little bit about PULSEs already..."0But he totally got the wrong idea about me!"1But she totally got the wrong idea about me!"2But they totally got the wrong idea about me!"&EVE: And what idea would that be?"~FLORA: ...Well, \PN seemed to think that I wanted to do something like build my own, and of course that's nonsense! Haha!"?Especially with how much stress it puts on the Pok√©mon..."*EVE: And you don't want to build one.":FLORA: Of course not! My interest is purely academic!"aEVE: That's why you've been sketching down the schematics when you thought I wasn't looking."0FLORA: J-just for education purposes! Haha!"Forget it."RThis was going so well, and then you just HAD to come along and ruin it, \PN."%Yeah, I'm going to build my own."ZWhat's a washed-up Champion and a second rate engineer like you going to do about it?"1EVE: I'm sure I can think of a thing or two."YFLORA: Oh, please. You can't even stop your machines from hurting your own Pok√©mon."@Or will you say it was negligence rather than incompetence?"%You're the worst kind of person."@Scum like you doesn't deserve to hold technology like this."^EVE: ...I did not wish the subjects to come to any harm, but I was not afforded a choice.",FLORA: Incompetence, then. And excuses."I'm not interested."êObviously you have the Champion wrapped around your finger, but do the local authorities know it was you who was responsible for all the damage?"<I think they might be interested in hearing about that."iSo unless you want them to find out, you're going to shoo \PN away, and tell me what I want to know."QEVE: ...Do you really believe you can fix the subject physical stress issue?"!FLORA: Do I "believe" I can?"8What is this, some feel-good family education crap?"I'm GOING to fix it.")Unlike some people, I actually care."@Besides, this region's technology is practically stone age."cIf you saw what we're used to back where I'm from, you wouldn't even know what to think of it."PAll I need is a living example to confirm, and I've practically cracked it."MEVE: If you're confident that you can solve it, I'll cooperate with you."FLORA: It's not an "if"."!Glad to hear we have a deal.