 be too hasty to push me out the door!"CAfter all, I still have my half of the deal to uphold for \PN."JFLORA: Magearna is still in the Glass Workstation, near where we met."It's on the second level."eI went ahead and set up a ladder so you can reach it, so don't say I never did anything for you."óI would've gone after it myself, but there was so much trash in the way, and that glowy aura around it looked a whole lot like somebody ELSE's problem."$So, you're welcome or whatever."I'd say it's been a treat,"SBut if it were, it'd be the kind that makes your stomach hurt after eating it."Ta."?EVE: I do hope she doesn't do anything we'll regret later.":Despite herself though, she has opened a door for me."6There's much work to do again, and time is short."/Please forgive me for not staying to chat."+Best of luck dealing with the Anomaly.[¸""PULSE-0A-PRO""SHELLY: Oh, \PN!"/You were checking this place out too, huh?"JSHELLY: U-um, is it just me, or d-does this place feel kind of weird?"AI get the feeling that something really bad happened here..."BA-actually, it's something one of the kids from here told me."6He said that two girls died here... Is that true?"SHELLY: \PN?"...";That machine is like the one in the m-mountain, right?"(SHELLY: B-but maybe in that case..."8Maybe it really is a good idea to look around here."BThis house is scary, but I don't mind if you're with me, \PN.")SHELLY: S-so, um, where do we start?"SHELLY: Hey, isn't this..."H-here."$It's, um, it's from the Circus."0It says it's for Reborn League challengers."That's you, so..."JSHELLY: It must have been mailed here after this house was abandoned."A-anyway..."Books!"Let's start at the books!"4Books are always safe, even when they're scary!"+SHELLY: It looks like this is a diary."KWell, since the house is abandoned, it's probably okay to read, right?"JPlus it's not like reading diaries ever really got anyone in trouble."Okay, here goes."FIt looks like this diary belongs to someone named Lumina Seijaya?"Um... "Dear Diary,"'Now Mama has gotten very sick too."mWe moved to Ametrine to get away from the polluted city, but the doctor says it may already be too late."0I don't want her to leave me like Papa did.".Please, please, please don't let her go.""U-um... Next entry.""Dear Diary,"%Mama is with Papa now after all."%Evelynn and I are all alone now."wShe's doing her best to take care of us, and the city is helping as much as they can, but it's still really tough."!I don't want to be alone...""I have bad news."^Evelynn called the doctor and he says that I've developed the same disease that Mama had."NWe knew it ran in the family, but nobody thought it would happen so soon."Diary, I'm really scared."[The doctor says I still have at least a few years, but I don't want to die that young."I don't want to go...".I'm not ready to face Mama and Papa yet.""I feel so guilty.",Evelynn has been worried sick about me."uShe's been staying up all night, always reading and researching to see if there's anything that could be a cure."cI'm really glad that she cares about me so much, but I don't want her to push herself too far."What if she gets sick too?"/Maybe it would be better if I died sooner."2I would be less of a burden on Eve that way.""2Evelynn has been working herself to the bone."cShe's building some kind of machine that she says will enhance the healing powers of Pok√©mon."kShe says that if she can amplify her Pok√©mon's healing potential, maybe it could cure my disease too."PEve has always been really smart, but if something like that is possible..."I would be so happy!""If anyone can do it, she can."0I'm so afraid to hope, but I can't help it."%Maybe I have a chance after all."?Maybe I'll be writing to you for a very long time, Diary.""I'm scared.":Today, a man dressed in black showed up at our house."qHe said that he had heard of the machine my sister was making, and he wanted to use it for his organization."(Evelynn was going to refuse, but..."I'm so stupid...">I got in the way and he used me as a hostage against her."RNow poor Evelynn has to do whatever he says, otherwise he says he'll kill me."RWhy is it that every time I hope things can be okay, they go horribly wrong?""...Um.""The handwriting changes here."It looks really unsteady."I'm sorry."'This is going to be my last entry."OIt's really, really bizarre, but there was an accident with Eve's machine."TShe was applying the finishing touches for a test run and something went wrong."pBecause of the machine's energy, the Magneton she was testing it on accidentally evolved during the test..."D...and then because of the evolution, the machine went haywire."XOh, did you know, Diary, that when Magneton evolves, its three parts fuse into one?",...I don't know how it happened, but..."HThe machine transferred that energy into everyone who was nearby..."0...And when Magneton emerged a Magnezone..."EI was looking at my own body, like it was a mirror or something."PAnd I could hear Eve's voice, and that man's voice, and they wouldn't stop."They still don't stop."eEve says the machine's energy accidentally fused the three of our consciousnesses into one body."PI don't know what's going to happen to Evelynn and I-- our bodies, that is."!They might die without us..."4But it seems that we're going to have to leave."I hate this."But it's stupid."I hate this so much..."I got what I wanted."I won't die."#And I'll never be alone again."Ever.""SHELLY: Uh, well..."'That's an... interesting... story."3It doesn't really help us find Heather though."???: Hello?"SHELLY: Eep! Hi!""We weren't reading any diary!"???: Uh... huh."%This ain't a place for visitors."What are you doing here?"SHELLY: N-nothing!",I m-mean we were looking for s-someone!"QHave you seen a young girl, a little shorter than me, with bright pink hair?"???: ..."Can't say I have."I...Yo, aren't you the Gym Leader from the Lapis Ward in Reborn City?"SHELLY: Eep!"He knows me!"Yes, sir, I am!"??