#[[e""The shattered glass hurt \PN!"2Welcome to Miss Serra Voclain's mirror arena!""I'll be happy to assist you--"If you're worthy!"1Hee~ Sooo you wanna say you're worthy, then?"EIn this place, you progress by breaking through the mirror wall."But be careful!"VThere's only one spot to pass through, and breaking the wrong one could hurt you!"Need a tip?")You'll have to prove yourself first!"$Haha~ Consider yourself proven!"VIn order to tell where to pass through, look for the point where symmetry breaks!"6Lady Serra is such a remarkable person, you know?" I won't let you get to her!"ZDid you know she used to be a famous model? She used to be all over TV and magazines!"HMaybe if I keep working towards it, I can reach her status someday!"#Lady Serra used to be so cool!",Are you sure you're worthy to face her?"~She could've had anything she wanted, but she gave it up for her son. Isn't that some dedication? But it's also kind of sad..."@You'd think Bennett would be more grateful to her though..."-BENNETT: \PN. You seem to be doing well."!I'll cut right to the chase."3I would be much obliged if I could battle you."FThat is, I do request to battle with all of Mother's challengers."gAs I hope to be a Gym Leader myself one day, is this not the most efficient way to prepare myself?"6Then please, allow me to test myself against you!"QAh... Well, it looks like I still have some adaptations to undergo myself..." EL: Impressive, young ones.":I believe you both have been gifted by Arceus' light."ZBENNETT: I don't believe it's any such 'light,' but instead diligence and commitment."5EL: And such diligence will indeed take you far."WBut, Bennett, would you believe me if I told you that you were dreaming too small?"BENNETT: Too small, sir?"EL: Yes.")You say you want to be a Gym Leader,"dBut I believe that with your determination, you could even go so far as to join the Elite Four."JBENNETT: That-- that would be... unthinkable! The Elite Four, really?"!That sounds fantastic, but--"QAs you can see, I still have a long way to go before I even have a chance..."EL: Perhaps."RBut for someone of your dedication, I believe I may be able to be of service."1Let us leave your friend to their challenge."`We will discuss the details elsewhere, and you may find yourself in a new position in time."BENNETT: Do..."Do you really mean that?!"EL: I do."/BENNETT: Then let's go right away, Mr. El!"Follow me!"'EL: Blessings to you as well, \PN.".All is reflected in the eyes of the Lord."Do remember this." SERRA: Welcome to my arena."VMaybe some might consider it vain, but I always have been rather fond of mirrors."-They reflect much more than appearances.":I've watched my whole life painted in a silver frame."TAnd I've watched that same frame splinter and shatter into what my life is now."#Which is just fine, I suppose."$Ice is the most beautiful type."?Within reflections and crystal imperfections, there's art."But enough about me."@I'm sure you don't want to listen to an old doll ramble on."Shall we begin?"'SERRA: Every experience is unique."/A mirror never shows the same image twice."IIf you're feeling discouraged, remember that everything will change."SERRA: Then let's."Take your place.":SERRA: Failure inevitably follows constant successes."You'll have your moment."!BENNETT: Right in here, sir.""EL: Can they hear us in here?",BENNETT: That's a weird thing to ask..."'But probably, if they're not busy."bThis is a one-way mirror, so they definitely can't see us, but it's not like it's soundproof."EL: I see."1SERRA: This will be over before you know it."Just like everything else.":So you've found success. Hold on to it while you can.">SERRA: I'm afraid I've already reached my breaking point."4EL: Bennett. Step outside with me for a moment.")BENNETT: Um...? Yes, sir, I suppose.")SERRA: This Rime Badge is yours now."!\PN received the Rime Badge!"XSERRA: With the Rime Badge, Pok√©mon up to level 55 will be happy to listen to you."'Additionally, ple