t..."MI was trying to make some food and accidentally melted one of the, uh...""The plastic cooking thingies?"A spatula?"#Is that technically a spatula?"îWell, I left it on the edge of the pan, so then when I picked it up, a bit of plastic dripped down on me, and I accidentally yeeted the whole thing,"1And it hit the wall and knocked out a light."âShe heard the glass break and came to check on me and I kinda tripped over my words explaining what happened, cuz I was still in shock..."l...And I forgot I was cooking, so the smoke alarm went off while she was still standing in the doorway."RUh, but she helped me clean everything up even though it was almost midnight.";...Cuz I kinda woke up at like, four in the afternoon."1I should like, buy her flowers or something."Or like,"A casserole?"NThat's a normal thing to bring your neighbor as a thanksorry gift, right?"<Actually, I'm not even sure what a casserole is, but..." Maybe I'll try cooking one?"3Wait, \PN, would you help me make a casserole?"8If you're around, maybe I won't burn it... Ahaha..."+TAKA: Hey, I'm glad we went out today."This is nice."#All of this really has been..."II mean, I know I'm not great at this whole living on my own thing..."ELuna, Elias, or the grunts usually did the cooking and cleaning.">But I would've never gotten the chance to do this before."XEven just waking up at whatever time I want, as opposed to for the morning drill..."It's really nice."0I didn't think I'd ever be able to do this.";Thanks for being here with me through all my disaster~"Yes"No0Iu;␀¶b[[Ø"=You shoulda seen this place before the water cleared up."OWe'd clean up the walls, and then they'd just be grimy again the next day."7What a nightmare. I'm thankful it pulled together."SDon't take this the wrong way, because I'm glad the city's looking better now."/But on the real, it doesn't feel the same."WWe used to own these streets. Now everything's wrapped up in order and perfection."No thanks."IThis city is still far from the technological paradise I dream of..."%But it'll do for the time being."cSo much to do now! Houses to refurnish, a new market to visit, and I still have work tomorrow!"qWho knew that all it would take to make the plants here bloom again was clean water and some Pok√©mon magic?"*And a bit of elbow grease, of course!"turbo thrusters: ACTIVATE"+Hey, Trainer. We fought before, right?"*You only had one Badge then. And now?"Sheesh.":Makes me feel a little better about getting thrashed."If only I had known."8This city was always marvelous beneath the surface."AIt only took everyone's help to bring it out into the light."!To go some place far away..."That sounds nice.":I want to go somewhere with open seas, shining sun..."+And most importantly, you, my darling."AAfter the Grandview Station reopens, let's leave this place."HI never realized how much I wanted to leave until I wasn't able to."<Now that I can again, I don't want to miss that chance."ZImagine being able to make an entirely rebuilt city in such a short amount of time..."+The power of technology is incredible!";Trainer, would you like to hear something fascinating?"=For a long time, I've been researching Hidden Abilities."{In most regions, it's very rare that Pok√©mon in the wild have different Abilities, but in Reborn, it's almost commonplace."I wanted to know, why?"3The truth is, I still haven't found an answer."åFor a while, my hypothesis was that pollution and radiation from Reborn City was prompting rogue genetic mutations in Pok√©mon of all kinds."FThis renovation project provided the perfect chance to test this."bAfter all, we've closed most of the wasteful factories, and cleaned up our act significantly."WBy now, Reborn produces only a small bit more pollution than any other major city."ÄIf my theory were correct, then we should have seen a decline in the number of Pok√©mon with alternate Abilities and coloration."@But surprisingly, nothing with regards to that has changed!"rEven among newborn Pok√©mon, the difference in mutations between then and now is statistically insignificant."&So, I must find a new hypothesis."}Could past radiation produce lingering epigenetic changes? Could there be some other energy source hidden near the city?"_Maybe it could even be the work of a legendary Pok√©mon! Arceus or Rayquaza, for instance!"CNo matter the case, I will definitely find the answer one day!"IFor a long time, I've been researching Hidden-- Oh, what? You don't?"Well, uh... Okay."Can you hear the voices?"?"Thank you", they command me to whisper, "For everything.""*<>- Grandview Avenue\n^ - Opal Bridge">TESLA: Oh, are you on a stroll through the Opal Ward too?"qI'm here for some work and I decided it'd be fun to turn the experience into a mini vacation with my family!"+My family being my little girl, Amber."PAMBER: I'm not little anymore... I'm twelve now, you don't have to baby me!"I wish Dad was here..."pTESLA: Yes, your father would have a nice time for once if he wasn't so obsessed trying to cause trouble..."<That man... I don't know what I'm going to do with him."BOh, I'm so sorry to take up your time with all this nonsense!"ILet me treat you to something for all of that... Hm.... Let's see..."TESLA: Ah-hah!"PThe vendor down by Obsidia gave me an extra bit of cotton candy by mistake."Here, you can have it!"7TESLA: Please, have a wonderful rest of your day~!"@TESLA: You look like you've been traveling for ages, hun..."UYou better make sure you're eating properly-- And hydrating as much as possible!"JAlso getting enough sleep. It's good for your skin and mental health!"4And make sure you're taking your vitamins too--"EAMBER: Mom... Give it a rest. They didn't ask for your advice..."KTESLA: Oh, true! I'm so sorry! I can get carried away pretty easily..."!Please have a wonderful day!"5Hey there! Can I interest you in some ice cream?"AMBER: ..."#Can I help you with something?"!TESLA: Amber, don't be rude!"IAMBER: I'm the rude one? This adult is the one talking to a child..."$TESLA: I'm sure they mean well."AMBER: Sure..."(Anyway, I'm Amber. I wanna go home."#TESLA: But we just got here..."CAMBER: Yeah, but it's like... I don't know this place, y'know?"MI've never been this far from the resort. I dunno, I just wanna go home."8TESLA: That's the fun about visiting somewhere new!"*You can explore and see the sights..."FFind foods you've never even heard of! The sky's the limit, dear!"SAMBER: I am pretty hungry... All I've had were Red Hots from that candy store."4They were fine and all, but I want actual food.">TESLA: Okay! We can go somewhere soon! Your choice, okay?":AMBER: We passed this place that looked kinda good..."BI think it was called the "The Spyce" or something like that."ATESLA: Let's have a nice meal there then. That sounds great."8AMBER: Hm... Okay! That sounds nice... Thanks, Mom!"GOh, sorry but you can't come with. This is for me and my mom only."=TESLA: Oh Amber... Please don't be so rude all the time."9AMBER: Hey, I'm not rude to you! Most of the time..."MI just don't trust anyone else, that's all. Don't take it so personally."TESLA: Sigh..."7KIXUR: We're on a quest to build the perfect city!"/Always happy to help when I can, stranger."sIf we all do just a little bit of that here and there, maybe we'll find a world worth sticking around for yet."W"Here lies inscribed the names of the many hands who helped to sculpt our city...""
