"Are you ready?"5FLORA: Fabulous! Let's make our way inside then!"FLORA: ..."I'm sorry?"BYou said this isn't actually the building where the PULSE is?"XBut I'm 100% sure that this is the only Devon Building in the entire Reborn Region!"†Not only did I have to stop and find a way to look it up, but when you took so long to get here, I even had to ask a filthy old man if I was in the wrong place!"So please, \PN, explain to me how it is that, after YOU told me to go to the Devon Building and then refused to come with me, leaving me to navigate for myself all alone in a completely unfamiliar region, now we are here and you are telling me that this is the WRONG BUILDING?!"O-oh, hi there, officer!"/Don't mind us-- all the yelling is just...")We're rehearsing for my school play!"
