What?"$B-But I came all this way, \PN!""Please tell me you're joking!"*Well, I'm sure you're just very busy!"2Thankfully for you, I am a very patient girl!"+(My patience has its limits though...)"@I got so carried away shopping, but I still wanna get more."&Could you hold these bags for me?"Take it easy, Champion."=We'll make sure you hear about anything we can't handle."Ah, it's you!"GWe were raising your Pok√©mon, and my goodness, were we surprised!"&Your Pok√©mon was holding an Egg!">We don't know how it got there, but your Pok√©mon had it."You do want it, don't you?"0\PN received the Egg from the Day-Care Man."You take good care of it."6I really will keep it. You do want this Egg, yes?"2Well all right then, I'll take it. Thank you."I'm the Day-Care Man.";I help take care of the precious Pok√©mon of Trainers."LAny Pok√©mon you'd like to have raised you can leave in my wife's care."$Ah, it's you!\nGood to see you!"#Your \v[3] is doing just fine.".Your \v[3] and \v[4] are doing just fine."DThe two play with other Pok√©mon rather than with each other..."0The two don't seem to like each other much."The two seem to get along.")The two seem to get along very well.""Sweet Co. HQ""cSo much to do now! Houses to refurnish, a new market to visit, and I still have work tomorrow!"$<>- Main Street\n^ - 9th Street"GI'm still not convinced I haven't already died and gone to heaven."9This can't really be Reborn City. It's unbelievable."SDon't take this the wrong way, because I'm glad the city's looking better now."/But on the real, it doesn't feel the same."WWe used to own these streets. Now everything's wrapped up in order and perfection."No thanks."XThere's more Pok√©mon here lately than I thought there could be in the entire city!" Think I can catch 'em all?!"<It's everyone's responsibility to keep this city clean."*That's what Adrienn has demonstrated.",Lower class citizens deserve peace too!":Who wants to live in a tar-smellin' factory all day!?"fThe administrative office will write it off in terms of priorities, but don't believe their lies!"XThe people in charge do not care about you! The government does not care about you!"(This city is so cool now, isn't it?"!It's like it keeps evolving!"FMy momma used to worry about me going out alone, but not anymore!"It's cuz I grew up, huh?"jThere's been so much to do lately! Commerce is really kicking up since the changes started coming in!"-Gotta play the market to make a killing!"Hail, Trainer."gCity watch is on the look-out for trouble. If you see anything suspicious, please report it to us."."Madame Meganium's Magic Medicine Market""1Have you heard the rumours about Agate City?"BPretty crazy, right? Even if it's not true, it's interesting."Really?"@They say it used to be part of a different region entirely."GAnd! I heard there's even a magic stone buried deep underneath it!"4If only something like that could exist here..."uAME: We're ready. Once you, Victoria and Arclight are in position, we'll head in there and draw their attention."NDevon's basement entrance should be somewhere in the Underground Railnet."BYou can find it, right? The others are there waiting for you."+ADRIENN: Were you checking on us, \PN?".Don't worry, we're going to be just fine."7Head on down to the Railnet and we'll get started."FI think I really took this whole nature thing for granted before."_Now that I've seen what it's like to have a peaceful area in the city, I wanna protect it."3But I don't think there's anything I can do..."&Huh? They need help at Coral Gym?"cMm, I'm not sure if I'm the kind of help they're looking for, but I'll go check it out anyway!"Hello, sweetie!"|Has your home already been renovated? If not, just tell one of the construction leaders, so it can be put on the queue!"GI'm done with finals, but now I don't know what to do with myself."OSchool always seems so boring and forced, but breaks always feel so empty."QIt's like, out of the frying pan and into the void of meaningless existence."tSilph Co. has really bursted into business lately. Have you SEEN the stuff at the top of the department store?!"kHey, wow! Like, you would have never believed it, how everyone came together to make this place great!"5It's totally changed my whole outlook on people!"(<- Saffron Street\n^v - 11th Street"Can you hear the voices?"?"Thank you", they command me to whisper, "for everything."" Honey, whatchu waitin' for?"Welcome to my candy store!"6Time for you to prove you're not a loser anymore~"!So step into my candy store!"Oh, hi there."BDon't mind me, I'm just waiting for my Pok√©mon to get it on."&Breeding is so tedious, isn't it?"JI wish I could just skip over having to worry about IVs altogether..."(I wish I could do something like..."BJust tell somebody who asked me for a password "mischievous"!"\And then suddenly every Pok√©mon I ever laid hands on would have 31's across the board!"(Yeah, wouldn't that be something..."4Ah, I wonder how this batch of eggs will do...?"0"Sweet Kiss"\nReborn's One-Stop Candy Shop!"DThere's never been a better time for me to kickstart my career!"eIf I get into real estate during all of this development, I bet I'll soar to the top in no time!"%<>- Main Street\nv - 10th Street"SThey say we still want a revolution, but the class system isn't goin' nowhere."0There's no bad guy to beat up for that one."Just the world."You in?"Yes"No[î"'>- Saffron Street\n^v - 8th Street""Goldenrod Station""*<>- Goldenrod Street\n^v - 9th Street"(<>- Saffron Street\n^v - 9th Street"7You see all this construction done, lookin' tight."/But do they find time to get to the Slums?"-Do they find time for the little people?"1Hell no. Shows you where they priorities at."2<- Opal Bridge\n^ - 8th Street >- Main Street"!Pok√©mon Day Care- This way!"_Tch, everyone says I'm only broke because I keep spending all my money on small pleasures."XBut isn't that just an excuse for the fact that the cost of living is way too high?"SThis city renovation is grea