eed more time to recover first..."4...Nah, fishing is a lifestyle! I'll go for it!"3My skill in swimming is bar none! I'm on fire!"You burnt me out..."6Maybe I should work on my battling skills, too...")This is the kind of place I'm about."qAll of the stench from the city before seems like a distant nightmare in the face of this fresh water scent."(<>- Greycast Street\n^ -11th Street")LILLIPUP: Ruffruffruffruffrrrrrr...!"Lillipup ran away again!"^Coral Ward is totally the place to be, now that there's so many pretty things to look at!"+Oh, and I don't just mean the scenery~"^All right boys, let's pull it together and haul out! We got a lot of work to catch up on!"'I wanna go out there and help too!"MI'm so tired of sitting around this city all day. Take me with you guys!"(<>- Faeward Street\n^v -11th Street"*<>- Shantyport Street\nv -10th Street"MWe've got our work cut out for us, now that it's safe to ship out again."gThe water may look clean, but there's still a lot of pollution in it, and sick Pok√©mon suffering."VIt's up to us to get out there and tie up the loose ends no machinery ever could!"You smell that, kid?"It smells like home.")You seen that lighthouse over there?"ÅIt was built way back when Reborn City was a small upstart town, and what's now Coral Ward was only a small pier on the lakeside."KHowever, it's been out of service ever since the city's first decline."UDoor's locked up tight, too. Probably no one left alive has a key to it anymore."tBut who knows? Maybe there's another way to get in. Like a secret entrance, just barely out of sight somewhere!"dHeh, just kidding. But thinkin' that way keeps me entertained during the dull parts of fishing."FSay, do you think I'd have better luck over at Apophyll, or here?"RThen again, since it's all the same lake, maybe it doesn't make a difference."?I can't wait to get back out there on the water's surface!"EI've idled for so long. Gotta lose my land legs... and this gut!"8Heck with the lake's health. I wanna eat some fish!""You ever had a Seaking Steak?"WI made the right choice, choosing to move here when they were still rebuilding it!"XI was in Beryl all my life before that went haywire, but this is way more my speed!"5On a night like this, there's something surreal."|I can look at the sky, the lake, the stars, all fleeting as they are, but I feel like it could slip away at any second.",Like, maybe it already has once before."5You ever get that feeling? Sort of like deja vu."aThis has already happened once, and what you see now is the result of someone's imagination.".I'm not sure if I would like that or not."MI moved here from Spinel Town when I heard the city was being rebuilt..."5But I never imagined it could be this grandiose!"sThe most recent report suggests that the toxicity level of the water is still declining at an incredible rate."QThe Water Treatment Center alone is powerful-- when operational, of course--"eBut there's no way it should have been able to make this much of a difference in so little time."I have a new hypothesis."]The Pok√©mon must have woken up, come back, or out of hiding-- whatever the case may be."6I bet they're working hard to clean the lake too."-We just had to give them a little shove."Now, how to test this..."Locked.""Shantyport Station""\PN used the Coral Key."The door opened!"RHey there, kid. I don't suppose you're interested in gourmet dining, are you?")I got some fresh Slowpoke Tail here."Cut's as juicy as any."9And you better believe this stuff is rare down here."ISlowpoke in Reborn are a prized and rare sight to see while fishing."!So you know it's a delicacy."3I'm sellin' for only $500,000. That's a steal!"\GWhat do you say?"$Nice. You know how to cook 'em?"CI can give you some recommendations if you like, on the house.")Oh, you're delivering for the Spyce?"3Tch, you should've said so in the first place."CI've got a standing deal with them, so they'll cover the cost.";Geez, you were really about to pay that much yourself?"That's some devotion..."Anyway, here.".Keep it cool so it doesn't spoil, got it?"Tch, your loss.",Come back when you learn what taste is."Oh, and uh..."=I'd appreciate it if you kept quiet about this exchange."4Not everyone's a fan of the business, you know?"nADRIENN: Okay, document the design maintenance procedures and draft a schedule for employees to check it."/ADRIENN: Public safety regulations, right?"iGet it online, print fliers, and have one of the volunteers post the ordinances throughout the city."WOMAN: Um..."WADRIENN: You are... Steinsman. Crystal Street Complex, 2C. Am I remembering right?"KWOMAN: Y-yes. Uh, we're still having the issue with the electricity..."NADRIENN: What, really? Someone was supposed to go by for that on Tuesday."#WOMAN: Um, nobody showed up..."BADRIENN: Gracious. Okay, I am so sorry for the inconvenience."fThank you for telling me. I know it must have been a huge let-down to deal with that for so long."7ADRIENN: You finished with the place on Kingsbury?"AVOLUNTEER: Yes, everything should be shipshape up there now!"ADRIENN: You're an angel."[Could you escort Mrs. Steinsman here to Mr. Finesilver at the Neo-Circuit Power Plant?"LHe's filling in for Julia at the moment and should be able to help her."AADRIENN: There's your signature. Did you need anything else?"BMAN: That's all! I'll get this back to the office right away."hADRIENN: Thank you-- all of you-- for your hard work. Please come find me if you have any problems."5ADRIENN: Deep breath... Everything is wonderful.",\PN. It is a pleasure to see you again."MADRIENN: My apologies for making you wait, \PN. I hope you've been well.":I understand you've been gone for a while-- but look!"This whole place--"-This is the city that I can be proud of."@Even if it fell apart before, the pieces were always there."4It just took someone to put them back together."~With the help of the local Gym Leaders, students from Apophyll and Onyx, and more volunteers than I could have ever hoped for,"5I think we've really made a miracle happen here."It was daunting--"7No, in the beginning, I'd almost say nightmarish--"ZBut one doesn't make this happen with announcements and inspirational speeches alone."hI started one house at a time, taking a personal interest in each crack and story within its walls,"pAnd from teaching others to do the same in return, everything has erupted outwards into some kind of dream."But we're not done yet."Not even close."EThat's enough though. You came to see me for a reason, I assume?"Ame's calling for me?"$Understood. Please go on ahead."DI have a couple more things to finish, but I'll be right there."What should I do next?"#About these new regulations..."*I need you to sign this, Mx. Adrienn."CThe waterway filter has been completed. How should we proceed?"Um, excuse me...".Don't tell my chief that I'm skating off."..."%Man, now I gotta go do sweepers."<I like swimming shorts! They're comfy and easy to wear!".... At least until the elastic wears off."*Say, you think I should get a speedo?"Yes"No[É"WSay, you think it's ethical to start fishing right after the environment recovers?"@Maybe the Pok√©mon would need more time to recover first..."4...Nah, fishing is a lifestyle! I'll go for it!"3My skill in swimming is bar none! I'm on fire!"You burnt me out..."6Maybe I should work on my battling skills, too...")This is the kind of place I'm about."qAll of the stench from the city before seems like a distant nightmare in the face of this fresh water scent."(<>- Greycast Street\n^ -11th Street")LILLIPUP: Ruffruffruffruffrrrrrr...!"Lillipup ran away again!"^Coral Ward is totally the place to be, now that there's so many pretty things to look at!"+Oh, and I don't just mean the scenery~"^All right boys, let's pull it together and haul out! We got a lot of work to catch up on!"'I wanna go out there and help too!"MI'm so tired of sitting around this city all day. Take me with you guys!"(<>- Faeward Street\n^v -11th Street"*