 region and now i'm just walking around and nothing is happening?????",hellooooo, wanted war criminal here????"ULIN: it was a lot easier to interact with your friends when i was literally god."...")maybe i shouldn't say that too loud."/let's not look a gift horsea in the mouth.""LIN: oh, great, you're awake."#i guess that's to be expected."ANNA: ...Lin?"6I almost didn't recognize you without the puddle!"LIN: the what." ANNA: You know, the puddle!"HThe eternal puddle of gloom that occludes your every waking moment!"+LIN: anna what the fuck are you saying"ANNA: Oh, nevermind!".Do you want to come in and meet everyone?"LIN: no?""ANNA: Okay, but do it anyway!"0You're done trying to end the world, right?"ùPutting yourself out there and meeting people for real is the first step on the path to showing everyone that you're trying to live a normal and better life!"LIN: ..."àANNA: I know we had our differences before, but following \PN's example, everything that happened just shows we need to set those aside!"!Come on, come on-- Let's go!"2LIN: okay, well, they are YOUR friends, so..."!hopefully they don't kill me"because that would suck.":Welcome to the Reborn Nightclub! --ACE MEMBERS ONLY--"Gotta hustle!"2If the city's gettin' in shape, I should too!"ÇIn order to stop people from getting lost or hurt in the caverns below, city ordinance has mandated restricted access to the area.";As such, all general civilians are asked to turn back."&You, however, may go right ahead."$Take care if you go down there."Have a good day."KI hear Sweet Co.'s hiring. They really are on the up and up here, huh?"Maybe I should apply."Hail, Trainer."gCity watch is on the look-out for trouble. If you see anything suspicious, please report it to us."Hey, did you hear?"dThis place is super exclusive, so most people can't get inside, but I heard they were hiring..."YI wanted to get in one way or another, so I grabbed a bunch of applications and ran!"CI was already rejected, but now I have all of these left over."Here, take one! Why not?!"???: Yo."6You were looking for me? I don't think we've met."?DJ Arclight, at your service. Arc's fine for short though."Remember the name."So, Ame sent you?"!ARC: Yo, \PN! How you doing?"ARC: Yo. \PN, right?"Ame sent you to get me?"FYou're really running all over the place since getting back, huh?"FRight. I think I've got a pretty good idea of what this is about."~I ended up getting pretty involved in the city's business after Adrienn asked me to throw a tag out for xem on the broadcasts."hWe were able to recruit a lot of volunteers that way... though some of them just wanted to meet me."That was a mess..."EUh, anyway, I recently got a call-in tip from a listener about--"0Well, it seems like it's Team Meteor again."Big shock, I know."AAll right, I'll go on ahead. Gotta clear out the area first."8Tell Ame that I'll be waiting at the meeting place."/ARC: \PN! I'm comin' with you on this one."|It's a little hard to get details out of that Smeargle, but from what I've gathered, we ain't gonna be alone out there."aThere've been some other reports coming in since all this Legendary business went dissonant."CYou and I, and the leaders-- we hunt them to keep others safe."WOthers hunt them for more problematic pursuits-- profit, power, and personal gain.")You already know I ain't about that."=Had enough of cages, between Devon and 7th Street alike."[We can't stop folks from making a living, but we can't let 'em do it like this either."TI'm heading straight over there-- That old Railcave in Chrysolia, I've figured."BThe poachers said something about following the rocks inside."See you on that side."6Gosh, I kinda miss the lazy days of our old city."=Now everyone's all 'business that' and 'community this'.""Bonjour, my beautiful friend."TI have heard rumours that you have been behind many of the city's strides, non?"#We thank you for your service."0It seems I was right to invest in Sweet Co."<Now what other companies are going to be up and coming?"Transportation, maybe?"I'm on a roll!"OI knew putting stock into the resurging Railnet was the right thing to do!"9Soon, I shall be the economic centrepiece of Reborn!"ADRIENN: Okay,"First question: Why?"Second question: How?";I thought we were at the top of Devon Corp., not here."FVICTORIA: Adrienn, when you were with Ame, what exactly happened?"ZADRIENN: When Arclight activated the signal, we entered through the front as planned."ZThere was the expected resistance, but then as soon as we finished dealing with them,"The exits sealed.""It was some kind of gas trap."/I don't remember what happened after that."VICTORIA: When I was trying to keep a path clear for \PN, another group of Meteors came from out of nowhere and knocked me out."sADRIENN: So it seems likely that after rendering each of us unconscious, they transported us to this building."4VICTORIA: And again, I was too weak to stop it."Now that I think about it,"Kiki was also weak."!Her body was killing itself."She couldn't stop that,"1And I'm not sure she ever truly accepted it."AI think I understand how the student becomes the master now."#We've got a lot of work to do."ADRIENN: As always!"=VICTORIA: But despite all of us being so pitifully weak,"Look how far we've come."ADRIENN: Yeah."Let's protect this city."<So this building was a cover for a Meteor facility too."That's a lead."GWhoever was responsible for this probably has ties to Team Meteor."/Those records should be at the Grand Hall."nVICTORIA: I'll take care of searching those, and I'll inform the other staff there about what's happened."oADRIENN: Then I'll get Arclight into medical care, and organize a party to search Devon and this building."lThe fact that they led us here and then set us free probably means they don't intend to use it anymore."2So there may be something we can still learn."6\PN, would you come by my Gym a little bit later?"(I have one or two requests for you."(VICTORIA: I'll be in t