or, but their other neighbors beat them to it."!Ah well, what's a guy to do?"!Oh? They need help in Coral?"+Hmm. What comes around must go around."'Seems like it's my turn after all.")<>- Spitrail Street\n^v - 3rd Street"1I just came here on the first train I could!"@I heard Reborn had a great League, so I had to come try it."#Hey, what's the Champion like?"%It's such a good day for a swim!"'It's a good day for a battle, too!")I'm so glad the lake has cleared up.";Pah. All these uppity folks be on this community shit."=This ain't my community. It's just a hole I landed into."8And no matter how shiny it is, it's still the pits.""SEACREST: Welcome, my friend!"*It's been quite some time, hasn't it?",I've learned much since I last saw you."SBack then, I was always intent on keeping my garden closed off to preserve it."tAh, but now I understand it is much better to let serenity out, so it may infect the world and thereby heal it."-After learning this from young Adrienn--"3Not a day older than I remember xem, I swear--"LI besought xem to let me tend to the public gardens all over this city."All of us together..."6We've truly been able to make this city flourish." SEACREST: Welcome, Trainer."]I am in charge of the city's public garden and park areas. You may call me Mr. Seacrest."9Please enjoy the city gardens with respect and care."7Actually, there is something you can help me with."?We've gotten ourselves into an unfortunate situation here."tSee, my amnesiac worker over there was supposed to deliver some mulch to me, so that we could continue working."uUnfortunately it seems that, of four bags, he's managed to lose every single one in his travels across the city."wFrom the sound of it, you probably won't see them laying around, but if you do find them, please bring them to me."HHe also might be able to give you some idea of where they could be."QSEACREST: Oh! I see you found the Growth Mulch. I'll take it off your hands."&\PN handed over the Growth Mulch."PSEACREST: Oh! I see you found the Gooey Mulch. I'll take it off your hands."%\PN handed over the Gooey Mulch."OSEACREST: Oh! I see you found the Damp Mulch. I'll take it off your hands."$\PN handed over the Damp Mulch."QSEACREST: Oh! I see you found the Stable Mulch. I'll take it off your hands."&\PN handed over the Stable Mulch."xSEACREST: My amnesiac worker over there was supposed to deliver some mulch to me so that we could continue working."(SEACREST: Oh! So that's everything!"+You're quite competent, young Trainer."FI hope it wasn't too much trouble. Please take this as my thanks."HSEACREST: I found that when we were cleaning up an area to work in."CHopefully someone as adventurous as you can find a use for it."Hmm... Take this, too."JSEACREST: I suspect you'll get more use out of that than I ever will."(Good luck on your travels, Trainer."JSEACREST: When I was young, I was all about fighting and exploration."gI thought, "What kind of person could spend all their time just looking after plants? How boring!""GSometimes I wonder if my younger self would be disappointed in me,"ãBut I think he would be surprised to learn that something simple like this can bring a greater satisfaction than any thrill he ever sought.":Ah-- I guess he did learn that in the end, didn't he?"0Oh, and by the way, we recently found this."*SEACREST: Hopefully you can use that?"Hail, Trainer."gCity watch is on the look-out for trouble. If you see anything suspicious, please report it to us."^When all the city's a garden, how can anyone appreciate the flowers that bloom brightest?".Ah well. I will always appreciate myself."$<- Neopath Road\nv - 4th Street"???: ...y!"...y, are you okay?!"Wake up!".VICTORIA: Thank goodness, you're alive..."(I just found you passed out here...".Do you have any idea how long it's been!?"&We thought you were gone forever!"FAnd now you just show up, sleeping in the middle of the pavement?"Geez...",Anna told us everything that happened--"mHow you defeated Lin finally, and how the real Lin is still hiding out there somewhere in the New World."Listen, it's been crazy."DA lot's been going on, but we're trying to work on it together."5Meet up at the Nightclub in North Obsidia, okay?"oArc's been ring-leading the efforts to deal with this, so I'm sure we can better explain everything there."6I'll meet up with you later too, but for now I..."..."Paperwork...".There's always... so much... paperwork..."DI'll just tie up a few loose ends and be over when I can, okay?"$See you later at the Nightclub!"VICTORIA: Oh, and--"I'm so glad you're back."Thank you..."-ADRIENN: Thank goodness, you're alive..."=It seems like that last excursion gave you some trouble?";Like you were stuck in some kind of bad dream still..."dTo be honest, I'm always a little bit worried that something will happen to either of us again."ZSomething like falling forward another decade, or disappearing like you did before..."BI can't even express how relieved I am to see you back again.")Take whatever time you need to rest."1This region needs its Champion in shipshape!"FIf you're all right, I should hurry back to the Nightclub though."^I was only meant to be taking a brief walk to clear my head before returning to business."CAs always, please let me know if there's anything you require."FYou have mine and all of the region's fullest support behind you,"!As any good Champion should."+I really enjoy spending time with you."+Let's do this again really soon, yeah?";As for tonight... we could always go back to my place.")<>- Spitrail Street\n^v - 2nd Street"4"Neo-Circuit Power Plant- A Silph Co. Service.""*There's something written underneath."z"Neo-Circuit is such a LAME name! I officially retitle this place the Electro-Dazzle Happy Boom-Time House of Cheer!""$Home of the official Name Rater"(Nothing like a battle on the water!"I got washed away!"Man, I missed this lake.""Grandview Station""Friend!"+Do you remember me? It's been so long!"/You helped me find a home when I had none."GIt is true, I was planning to leave this place as soon as I could."2And now, Grandview Station is finally open..." But I have decided to stay!"]Your kindness, and that of this city, have shown me this is a better place to be anyway."fThat old shack you found me was hardly a home until one day a fellow named Adrienn knocked on it."OThat person laid out their plans, and you can see what has become of them!"jNot a bad investment, and I was all too happy to help them rebuild other parts of the city in return!"So, Reborn is my home now!"'And I will not forget you, friend."<I want you to have this as one last token of my thanks!">I hope you have been taking good care of my Onix as well!"9Be strong! Reborn does not break, nor do its people!"6I hope you have been taking good care of my Onix!"&<>- Union Street\n^v - 3rd Street"?KELVIN: Boy, Reborn City sure has been through a lot, huh?"+But then again, I suppose we have too."I'm grateful to this city."XAfter all, if I hadn't come here to Reborn, then I would never have met you, Jasmi."GI think I'm ready for us to start our next big adventure together."0"Neo-Circuit Power Plant / Peridot Ward Gym"Operation Hours:"?MON-SUN: Entirely dependent on how much coffee you bring.""<Now this place is the sort that I've always dreamed of!"5City's teamwork makes the citizens' dreams work!""Grandview Station-"!Subway service coming soon!""#Subway service now available!""GThose of us who ain't got nowhere to be still got to be somewhere."9But I'll appreciate it being a nice place like this."&<>- Neopath Road\n^v - 2nd Street"/I finally earned my first Badge a bit ago!"*Now I've gotta train up for Florinia."@Ugggh, but there aren't any good spots to grind, are there?"rHello! If you're interested in helping with the city's reconstruction, make sure to report to the Grand Hall!"/Now open for tickets outside Reborn City."")<>- Grandview Avenue\n^ - 3rd Street""Hey, Trainer. Can I help you?"2I'm just tryna enjoy my break here, y