rrently unavailable.")"Ticket Purchase within Reborn City"")Would you like to purchase a ticket?"Hello!"You see this beauty here?"~This is the first in a line of new trains we'll be rolling out across the city once we just secure the remaining funds for it."%The long-awaited 9R000 series..."êThese babies are clean, lightning fast, and will take everyone to stations all across Reborn City faster than they can say 'modern locomotives!'"Look forward to it soon!"2It's about time this place got back underway!"UNow that it's an option again, you can bet I'll be traveling all over the place."-I got a bucket list to finish, you know!"Hrmm..."iPerhaps it's because we've only recently opened, but there's hardly any trains scheduled to come in."[Now that this place is restored, I just have to hope that my son will come back to me."I like trains!"I wanna ride on one!"I wanna ride on two!"At the same time!"?Goodness, I seem to have dropped my ticket. Can't be late!"Zzz..."@7:15 to Goldenrod. 7:25 to Peony. Tuesday. 7:25 to Ivyline."KWednesday. 7:25 to Shantyport. 7:30 to Heatherhill. 7:40 to Goldenrod."[Monday. 7:45 to Kingsbury. Tuesday. 7:45 to Ivyline. Wednesday. 7:25 to Sunset. Click."1Hello! I'm with Reborn Construction Company!"ÉAfter just completing our last major product, in the revitalized Railnet, we're raring to hire up and take on even grander designs!"oIf you or anyone you know is looking for a hands-on career to shape the future of this city, please apply!"(ADRIENN: \PN! My favorite champion!"=I'm grateful you could make it, and you're just in time."?I was just discussing the particulars with the chief here.",CHIEF: Allow me to summarize once more."MTwo of your compatriots recently unearthed a couple of unique artifacts."/But not too unique-- they were recognized:"The Red Orb and Blue Orb.">We're aware of what happened in Hoenn with these items..."eAnd I think I speak for everyone when I say that Reborn has had enough of world-ending disaster!""We've put all that behind us!"+ADRIENN: At least, I dearly hope so..."CHIEF: We want none of it!"}So I've taken the liberty of contacting some foreign experts, and we've arranged to have the orbs safely contained elsewhere."+All that's left is to ship them there."'ADRIENN: That's where you come in.".We think the shipment's been compromised."4Some information regarding it was leaked, and--"OIn short, it's almost certain someone is trying to steal the orbs already."gWe'd like you to take the train ride abroad and make sure the orbs reach their destination safely."eCHIEF: With a champion as beautiful and powerful as you, I'm sure no one will dare try anything!"?With the champion on board, no one will dare try anything!"ßADRIENN: I know playing security isn't exactly the most glamorous, but I don't think anyone wants to risk an incident with, say, Azurine Lake drying up or something..."?With any luck, it'll be an uneventful trip there and back.".You could even think of it as a vacation!"ACHIEF: I hate to rush, but I believe we are short on time..."~ADRIENN: Right-- since the original shipment was compromised, the Chief arranged to sneak it on board a passenger train early."åCHIEF: Our hope is that the change in operation will be inconspicuous enough to escape the notice of whomever the information was leaked to.".And by the time they find out-- too late!"CADRIENN: Your ticket and boarding is already arranged as well."ÇThe Chief will be going with you as well-- he'll show you to the storage car and keep an eye on the passengers during the mission."CHIEF: Yes, yes!">Together, we'll keep both these orbs and our region safe!";But the clock is ever-ticking-- let us be off at once!"0ADRIENN: Are you ready to leave right away?",ADRIENN: Good luck, \PN! Safe journeys!"#ADRIENN: Well hurry, hurry up!",We can only hold the train for so long!".ADRIENN: ...So, let me get this straight."The Chief was an imposter,"*The train was grounded in the desert,"The Red Orb was stolen,"The 