 still useless at it."^TITANIA: And our friendly local cinderblock remembered that I used to play as a teenager.">So I have once again been called in to clean up his mess."'AYA: Sorry about all this again..."hTITANIA: If you're really sorry, you can start apologizing by not calling yourself useless anymore."8It's not doing me any favors, and you least of all."AYA: Right..."...Thanks."qTITANIA: And if you want to thank me, you can do so by focusing on the play so I don't get called back here."Go again; from the top."'TITANIA: Just let us do our thing."1She'll be fine, if she can get over herself." CAIN: Heyyyy \PN, you came!"5Okay, so this is kind of out of the blue, right?"eBut I was thinking, there's hardly anything I can see myself doing for a long time, but singing?"I can do that."çI've wasted enough time running in circles, so even if I'm not 100% on a path in life, I've decided I need to at least start doing something.",So I started talking to Hardy about it,":And he mentioned he was already teaching Aya to play,"-And then we asked Arc if he knew anyone,"FAnd one thing led to another and now we're here making it happen!"{We're not exactly rockstar material, but if we can make a few people smile for an evening, I'd say that's good enough!"7And these folks seem like they need a bit of that!"5So you're keeping watch during rehearsal, right?"EI doubt anything'll happen, so feel free to keep all eyes on me~"?CAIN: I feel like it's been a while since I sang properly.".Maybe black hole time does that to a guy."What's going on here?"Some kinda concert?"
