 her, you'll get tenfold from me."-HARDY: Make that double on my count too."LTEZ: Tch... You can't really expect to get away with threats like this."ARC: Funny you say that."AEvery other thing I've heard you say has been half a threat."<If you don't like the music, best you change your tune."6TEZ: The authorities are gonna hear about this..."!CAIN: You're still doing it."HTITANIA: Threats are the only way some men know how to communicate."ARunning to their betters is just the last resort form of it."`ARC: You do know that all of us work in tandem with the police and city authorities, right?"_Don't suppose you picked up on that among the whole escorting civilians out of here thing?"AYA: That's enough."Mom, get him out of here."Take him or whatever."@Consider finding another set of divorce papers on your way."LANA: I..."%...Let's... Let's just go, dear."TEZ: Hmph."$HARDY: Yo, that was... intense." AYA: Thanks for the backup."CFrankly I'm glad I had it there rather than with the Genesect."JThey may be scarier than him, but they're not waiting for me at home."...I hope."KCAIN: Making it day by day with the help of your friends isn't so bad~"AYA: I bet.".Starting to think you had the right idea."OHARDY: I guess I really don't gotta look out for you so much anymore, huh."6AYA: Only thanks to your help in the first place."!AYA: Yours as well, Titania."&Even if you can be a bit harsh..."It helped. Thanks."TITANIA: Glad to hear it."You did well."AYA: You're cool too."ARC: Word."GAYA: And thanks, \PN, for being the one actually there for it all."3AYA: ...Well, should we get back to rehearsal?"CTITANIA: Are you sure you're even up to that after everything?"AYA: Psh."After all that?"
