 me great pain to resist against an encounter so clearly willed by the fates as this one."Nevertheless..."BThough my heart may be torn asunder, I can never be with you!"%It is a pitious end, to be sure."QAnd I pray that you will not be too crestfallen, my lady, when I tell you..."-CORIN-ROUGE: Most impressive, my friend!"_So you were able to find my companions, solve the riddle, and trace me all the way here..."'You are a worthy adversary indeed."However!"It is still not enough."And why?"Well, that is because...")I, too, am not the real Corin-Rouge!"5But now, I'll have to put an end to your plight!"EYou may have won the battle, but I'm afraid you've lost the war."USo, would you like to know where the real Corin- Rouge is? No tricks, this time!"/After all, his plan has already succeeded!"ECorin just needed to buy some time until his get-away was ready."$And now-- it's nearly the time!"SThe real Corin-Rouge is one of the three fools you fought before you found me!"But which one?"1If you hurry, maybe you can still catch him."1Ahah, just kidding. There's no hope of that."!So long, my bewildered babe!"#And now, I will take my leave."May we meet again, never!"'ADRIENN: \PN, you're here already!"/That's okay, I just wasn't quite prepared."+To tell the truth, about my request..."I want to battle you."3It would be an official Gym Battle, of course."YGiven recent circumstances, the actual status of the Reborn League might be unclear."WHowever, Victoria and I will handle the administration, and as for the Champion..."That's my second request."+I want you to become the new Champion."bThat might have been your goal in the first place, but now I think it's especially important."ÖAnd I'd like it if it were you in particular, because from what I've heard, you've been the one who's done so much for Reborn's sake."ZOf course, that still entails collecting all the Badges and defeating the Elite Four.":Probably no one would accept your new role otherwise."And Lin--"&Uh, actually, let's not go there."[Even if she defeated Ame, I personally will refuse to acknowledge her as the Champion."1But we need someone who can stand up to her."#You're our best hope for that."You'll do it, right?"ADRIENN: Thank you."ZADRIENN: I know you might be scared, have other priorities, or think you can't do it."-But I think you're the only one who can."VAnyway, let's just take it one step at a time in the direction that's best. Okay?"3To start, I would like to have our battle now." However, I'm a bit swamped."?I've got a handful of workstations that are short- handed."yNot to mention planning the recovery party for Devon Corp. and what I've begun referring to as the Devonyx building."ZIt's going to take me a small bit to get those sorted, but I could use your help too."(That said, I won't force it on you."]Management is tedious work, and I would understand if you have better uses of your time."IAre you willing to help me out with a small errand before we battle?".ADRIENN: You are a genuine treasure, \PN."ZThis will be somewhat menial, but I would like to ask for your help with recruitment."~If you could explore the city and find anybody who might be willing to lend a hand to our work, I'd really appreciate it."SIf we can get at least five people, that should be enough for me to work with."TCloser to ten would be ideal, and I'd make the difference worth your time, too.":Please have them come here if they wish to volunteer."I'll handle the rest."7After that's settled, let's have our battle. Okay?".ADRIENN: That is entirely understandable.">Let's waste no more time, as it's clearly of the essence."QI'll take my place in the arena. Take yours whenever you're ready to battle."I'll be waiting!"ñADRIENN: Even though it's menial, if you could go explore the city and look for anybody who might be willing to lend a hand, I'd really appreciate it."TBut closer to ten would be ideal. I'd make the difference worth your time, too."ADRIENN: You're back!"^I just finishe