red it was just the local Steelix givin' it a good tussle again."$Name's Europa. Good to meet ya!"PAs you might imagine, we don't exactly get a whole lot of visitors up here."KBut, this here's Train Town, as some of us affectionately refer to it."gThere ain't of many of us. We just a ragtag group who ain't found their place around other people."8But we got each other here, and that's all we need."JIf you lookin' stay a while, why not stay and hang out with everyone?"}EUROPA: There ain't much to live on up here, so we vagabond types gotta be responsible for growin' some of our own food."oAin' no small matter either. Sometimes we go hungry, but I'd say it's worth it to have this kinda freedom."nBy the way, if you need any supplies before headin' back out into the sands, talk to ol' Bouffalant Bill."2He should be able to sell you a thing or two."8EUROPA: This is kind of our nightly tradition here!"cWhen in good company, a little drink doesn't last as long, but the spirits sure go a long way."!PERCY: Unless Bill's around!"???: Unless Bill's around!"KBOUFFALANT BILL: Bahhh. Ain't anybody told you to respect your elders?"????: Bahhh. Ain't anybody told you to respect your elders?"6ALDUOUS: You think she'd be out here if they had?"2???: You think she'd be out here if they had?"PERCY: Oh, they told me..."???: Oh, they told me..."I just didn't listen."EUROPA: You see?"-Call it our way of keepin' sane up here."9Well, well. We don't get many new faces around here.""Just call me Bouffalant Bill."?You need anythin', I just might be able to hook you on up."[Ain' no shortage of odds and ends we been salvaged from the supply trains 'round here."0Gimme a holler if you wanna see what I got."7BOUFFALANT BILL: You wanna know how I got my name?"CIt all started back when my nanny still lived out on Route 1--"*EUROPA: Oh, Bill, not this one again."'???: Oh, Bill, not this one again."We've all heard about how you exploded the bubblegum machine with just a toothpick and Bouffalant's molar like ten dozen times!"Give it a rest already."GBOUFFALANT BILL: Bah... Anyway, you here to buy somethin' or what?"]BOUFFALANT BILL: Money don't do you too much good out here. Might as well buy somethin'!"IALDUOUS: Hey Bill, don't you go short-changin' our guest or nothin'."E???: Hey Bill, don't you go short-changin' our guest or nothin'."BBOUFFALANT BILL: Bahh, you don't know what you talkin' about."&Hey there, welcome to Train Town!"*Name's Alduous. Al for short is fine."/I suppose you already met my wife, Europa?"åThe two of us got a little stir-crazy cooped up in the city, so we decided to hoof it out here and see what kind of adventure we could make.",In the end, we never wanted to go back."uOver time we've picked up a few stragglers here and there-- mostly people lookin' to escape the city themselves."For instance, Miss Percy?".We found her collapsed out in the desert."$PERCY: I was just taking a nap.""???: I was just taking a nap."5ALDUOUS: Face down in the middle of a sandstorm?"5PERCY: I didn't say it was a well-planned nap..."3???: I didn't say it was a well-planned nap..."?ALDUOUS: Anyway, I hope you'll make yourself at home here."5If you need anything, you let my wife or I know."8ALDUOUS: Feel free to pull up a seat and get comfy."3Our ragtag gang is always open to new company."wThe group is pretty much just those you see here, plus the Stephoscope, one other guy, and sometimes Miss Titania."ÅShe only stays to chat on occasion, but she does look out for us, bringing us food and drink from the city whenever she comes in."[PERCY: And if we ever have trouble with the wild Pok√©mon, she beats them back for us!"Y???: And if we ever have trouble with the wild Pok√©mon, she beats them back for us!"WShe also said if my ex ever shows up here that she'd protect me and take him down!"*In the end, she's pretty cool, right?"4Hey, you think she's interested in other women?".EUROPA: Percy, how much you had to drink?"+???: Percy, how much you had to drink?"PERCY: Not enough!"Hey there, stranger!"Name's Percy."Nobody sent you, right?"iCuz lemme tell you, if you're here to cause trouble, you're gonna have to deal with Bouffalant Bill,"PAnd just in case you haven't noticed, he's got a meaaan right armpit stank."1BOUFFALANT BILL: Percy, the hell you sayin'?"%???: Percy, the hell you sayin'?"PERCY: Gottem!"6EUROPA: Well, Bill, it's hard to say she's wrong."3???: Well, Bill, it's hard to say she's wrong."eBOUFFALANT BILL: Well excuuuse me, why don't I just go hop on into the nearest river-- oh, wait."Y???: Well excuuuse me, why don't I just go hop on into the nearest river-- oh, wait."3PERCY: Don't worry, Bill, I'll hold you under!"ALDUOUS: Percy, no."???: Percy, no."-PERCY: You know this is the place to be!"Reborn City who?!"4We've got the raddest crew in the region! Whoo!"OBOUFFALANT BILL: Settle down there or you gonna fall right off that train."C???: Settle down there or you gonna fall right off that train."?PERCY: Pshaww, it's cool, we've got a doctor in the house."IEven if she's too much of a party-pooper to actually come socialize.":EUROPA: No need to be cold about it though, you hear?"7???: No need to be cold about it though, you hear?"YIf'n I rightly recall, you was pretty timid of us your own self after you came here."Now look at you.":And it hasn't been all that long since she came here."8Besides, I'm not so sure she's actually a doctor..."8PERCY: Still, at least I talked to you guys at all!"OBut it's like little miss Stephoscope over there doesn't want to even try."0EUROPA: She'll try when she's ready, Percy."-???: She'll try when she's ready, Percy." Ain't no two ways about it."GCORIN-ROUGE: Ah, my dashing dame, you have returned to me at last!"UA most dear delight, for today, I have a special unveiling planned just for you!" CORIN-ROUGE: There you are."'I'd like to tell you about myself."}Whether it is the sands, some other force, or just the sheer amount of shrapnel-tumbleweed already scrapped around here,"ASomething about this place has a habit of pulling others in."-Sometimes through full trains at a time."]CORIN-ROUGE: I was just coming to the Reborn Region via train when something went wrong."I lost everything." Many people around me died."^I was remarkably lucky, so I did what I could for the survivors. They could not move far."ZI found one of the less damaged cars further into this rat's nest and pulled them in."wThere, I did what I could for them. But with no money, medicine or food, my options were as limited as their time."KThe time it would take to receive a paycheck would have been too late."1CORIN-ROUGE: That was when I began stealing."-I just needed to help the others get by."Some of them didn't."ROthers made a full recovery and went on to lead the lives they came here for."(Some stayed here, and in time left."\Since then, there've always been people here, though the faces change with the seasons."OFugitives... Refugees... Sinners and those who have been sinned against..."=Everyone is equal here, but always wanting by necessity.",I've done what I could just to deliver."%In time, necessity became skill."Skill became renown."?Now it's almost too dangerous for me to try anything else."FCORIN-ROUGE: Even now, there are people here who need protection.";I wanted to be able to offer them that protection too."8That was why I had to steal your ultimate Pok√©mon."Nothing personal."uI haven't even had time to do anything with it between evading you and the police, and gathering other supplies."$But I hope you understand now--"!I can't just give this back."This place is my home."ISo, even if it pits me against a brilliant angel such as yourself..."I will protect it!"	I..."CORIN-ROUGE: ..."2CORIN-ROUGE: I'll just go turn myself in now." ???: Well, howdy, partners!"!TAKA: Uhh, nope. No Steelix."(Just two crazy people with a train."+???: Well, you know we all been there."NSome good ol' fashioned train-joustin' is the best sport we got out here!"TAKA: That sounds safe."#???: Anyway, my name's Europa!"'Y'all lookin' for a place to rest?"9TAKA: Rest? I don't think I've heard of that before."EUROPA: Ohh, you joker!"tWe don't exactly get a lot of visitors out here, but there's a few of us who hang together for our own reasons.";Some of us are chasin' peace, others fleein' violence."\It don't matter who you are though, you're welcome to stay with us as long as you like."4We got each other here, and that's all we need.""TAKA: This... might work out."'EUROPA: Y'all got a story to tell?"$TAKA: \PN probably has several."And I uh...")I'm just looking for somewhere safe."*EUROPA: Well, congrats! You found it!"rIf'n you'd like, I can set you up with one of your own personal trains and what few accommodations we've got."ATAKA: So-- wait, you guys just, live in the trains out here?"Cuz you can?"EUROPA: Pretty much!"TAKA: ..."Yeah, sounds great."3If it's no trouble, that'd be... a big relief."'EUROPA: Well, right this way, sir!""EUROPA: Well, this here's it."IAin't much in the way of amenities, but it'll keep you out the sand.",EUROPA: He your boyfriend or somethin'?"*EUROPA: Oh, I'm just playin' with ya."gBut if you lookin' to stay too, the two of you can share, or I'm sure we can find you another car."kEUROPA: If you lookin' to stay too, the two of you can share, or I'm sure we can find you another car."EUROPA: What do you think?"iCertainly needs some TLC, but with a good broom and a bit of elbow grease, should be all hunky-dory."+AMARIA: And you're officially all set!"OSTEPHOSCOPE: Now we can really begin making some developments around here."ZPERCY: Well, thank whatever divine creature rules above these days and all their kin.")No more supply hikes just for water!"+BOUFFALANT BILL: No more sponge baths!":ALDUOUS: I'd kind of gotten used to the sponge baths."7EUROPA: No more sponge baths, and that's an order."ALDUOUS: Yes ma'am."=EUROPA: Thanks again for doing this for us, Miss Amaria."$AMARIA: It's no trouble at all!"&AMAR