lotte."-CHARLOTTE: Fine, fine, fine, fine, fine."DI hereby swear to be the least sarcastic person on this planet,"For three minutes,"If you're lucky." LAURA: Perhaps that's okay."6It's not as if I don't sometimes enjoy your sass."\CHARLOTTE: That one's going in writing; I'm reminding you of it next time you complain."}LAURA: Now, I've gotten the feeling that perhaps Anomaly-hunting is a bit beyond us as a family unit for the time being,"HSo how about instead we all just try and have a nice time together?"ÉWe haven't gotten too many of those, and I believe there is always something to be said for stopping to smell the flowers together."2CHARLOTTE: You know we're in a desert, right?"+SAPHIRA: There are still flowers here."1LAURA: These are metaphorical flowers, okay?"SCHARLOTTE: And just what, pray tell, do these metaphorical flowers smell like?"@LAURA: Love, trust, and the experience of growing together."?CHARLOTTE: Yikes, you just said that with a straight face."'SAPHIRA: It was almost impressive."Almost."LAURA: ........"-Well, \PN, it has truly been a pleasure."1Once again, I am much obliged for your help."IIt was indispensible, and I believe all of us will be better for it."ONow, if you'll excuse me, I will be dragging these two home by their ears."8SAPHIRA: I'll take her other ear if you spare mine."LAURA: Deal."CHARLOTTE: Wait."6CHARLOTTE: Hold on, we can still talk about this!"/Mature and reasonable adults and all that!"#Hey, hey, wait-- \PN, save me!"&LAURA: Have a wonderful day, \PN.Iu;␀Ç[[	""The shattered glass hurt \PN!""TAKA: This place is so weird."MIt might have been made by my forebearers, but why make it so confusing?"8TAKA: I don't think that's gonna be moving anymore.[	""The shattered glass hurt \PN!""TAKA: This place is so weird."MIt might have been made by my forebearers, but why make it so confusing?"8TAKA: I don't think that's gonna be moving anymore.;[	""The shattered glass hurt \PN!""TAKA: This place is so weird."MIt might have be