 that you regret the things you've done after doing them without a second's hesitation!")SOLARIS: I do not regret doing them."I regret that I had to."MVICTORIA: Your choices are your own, and you alone will answer for them."SOLARIS: That may be so."But are you not the same?")VICTORIA: Don't insult me like that."ãSOLARIS: We do not know each other, but I am reasonably confident that chasing old men for the sake of revenge is not your choice of hobby."9VICTORIA: It's not my hobby; it's my responsibility."You-- Team Meteor..."5All of you have caused so many people to suffer!"1Taking you out is what's best for the world!"9SOLARIS: Still blaming your feelings on the world..."*VICTORIA: It will be best for me too."SOLARIS: That's right."'Whatever helps you sleep at night."Whatever eases the guilt."%Why couldn't I be strong enough?"&Why couldn't I be there for them?"EWhy is it this world is one that is set on ripping people apart?"Nothing is fair,"2But oughtn't someone do something about that?"%VICTORIA: What are you saying..."-SOLARIS: We are not so different, child.""I remember my parents fondly."5I remember the feelings I earned in losing them."TI remember the feelings I lost when I stood over the one who took them from me,"Or what was left of him."<I did not have the luxury of making revenge my purpose."zBut I had a responsibility to do what I could to make the world the better place that my parents had always tried to."KAnd if the world were sure to not pull any punches, then why should I?"8SOLARIS: As you can see, I have failed wonderfully."So, this was inevitable,"cBe it by the hand of one who lost their light to me, or the hand of she who I lost my hand to."\SOLARIS: If you truly believe that this is the path you must take, then take it freely."0I will not survive a fall from this height."=A stiff breeze could do the job, if you so wanted it to."VICTORIA: ..."YSOLARIS: Just as I thought, you don't have the will to go through with such a thing."\You may m