ate well enough."*If it is not her, it will be another."SOLARIS: Go freely."9The outcome of our conflict was made clear in Agate."We need not rehash it."II suspect that, despite her mercy, my time is at its end regardless."8Please create a world in line with your own ideals."The struggle to do so..."8Perhaps that is the only meaning life has to offer." SOLARIS: I thought as much."=I will not pretend to be capable of fighting you either."lI understood that as soon as I had to resign to asking for your help, I had already forfeit everything."4I pieced together what happened to Ace as well."TI have but three questions for you, if you will grant me the kindness for them."Then I shall go in peace."9SOLARIS: I'll take your silence as tacit compliance."My first question..."SWhen you first joined our team, were you already planning to make this happen?"2Or was this simply the result of opportunism?"ILIN: The only thing better than a well-laid plan coming to fruition,"AIs a well-laid plan coming unraveled at the hand of impulse."SOLARIS: I see."Second question."I understand your goal."nYou will make the lie we promised others in order to manipulate them a reality, and create the New World."9But just what kind of world do you intend to create?",LIN: The only one where hope can exist."'LIN: The only kind worth creating."#One where anything can happen,";Whether that is everything at once, or nothing at all."SOLARIS: Uh huh."My third question..."-LIN: I did not agree to three questions."TVICTORIA: Thanks for coming up here for me, despite how I've acted towards you."5CAL: Forgiveness was a staple of our curriculum.".I would not be who I am today without it."VICTORIA: Y-yeah..."..."+You really saved Kiki's Medicham, huh?"CAL: Yeah."#Do you want to meet her again?"VICTORIA: Not right now."%Let's... do it back at Apophyll." You'll come with me, right?"FI could use some help, between that place and Reborn City duties."#CAL: After this is all over..."Yeah, I can do tha