 infuriating."But... I miss her."=I saw what Sirius was doing to Meteor, but I couldn't..."No; I DIDN'T stop him."ZSirius was a poison, claiming radical action could help us achieve the Order's goals."/Maybe that was the right course of action?"But it was doomed to fail."8Because Sirius cared nothing for the Order's goals."$He just wanted to make history."$Perhaps if I had stopped him..."HIf I had tried to convince the others of his selfish motivations..."OPerhaps then Lin would never have been able to gain the influence she did.")Perhaps then Elena would still be..."+Perhaps then Phoenix would still be..."6ELIAS: ...Watch yourself in your battle, my Lord."AShe was one of the most formidable trainers I've ever known."HEATHER: Another 2-for-1?"âGeez, \PN, I thought it might get lonely all the way back in the Champion room, but I didn't expect you to make it a tourist destination!",SHELLY: Nah, you've got the wrong idea."I'm not here with him."He's here with me!"I'm not here with her."She's here with me!"I'm not here with them."They're here with me!"<I wanted to show \PN how far I've come since last time!"XAnd I decided the best way to do that is by taking on all the other Leaders myself!"VObviously, this is just a practice match, since I haven't fought my way up yet..."HBut you and \PN are both my friends, so we can just do that, right?""HEATHER: I don't see why not,"WIf you're really that desperate to lose, I'm always happy to give you a go for it!"=SHELLY: You know, Heather, that's what I like about you."3You're always so confident and full of energy,"BEven right before your world gets totally turned upside down!"HEATHER: Oh???".Are you actually trying to trash-talk me?"@Is little Shell Bell finally learning to have an attitude!?".SHELLY: Er, no-- No, I wasn't trying to--"Be rude or anything..."HEATHER: Hey!",You started this; don't shrivel up now!"(I never said I was mad or anything!"QOn the contrary, I can't wait for you to put your mouth where your money is!"FIf you're gonna give it your all anyway, you may as well, right?!".It's more fun that way anyway, isn't it?!"0SHELLY: All right, fine-- you asked for it!"jIf that's really the way you feel, then I have no choice but to punt you straight into the New World!" HEATHER: That's the spirit!"6Bring it on-- I'll squash you like your own type!"4SHELLY: Let's go, Heather! It's take-down time!";HEATHER: Please, Yanmega doesn't even learn Take Down!"2SHELLY: Who said I was talking to my Yanmega?"cDon't forget, you're talking to the girl who's gonna be the best Trainer in the world someday!"HEATHER: Back again, huh?"Well, you know the drill!"%I'm not gonna go down so easily!"%Think you can rise to my level?!")I have total control! Total freedom!"(I'll never let anyone beat me down!"#Salamence, it's take-off time!"HEATHER: HEY!"?I was wondering when you were gonna show up already. Geez!":You have any idea how long I've been waiting up here?"0I'll give you a hint-- it's almost forever."TAnna said I had to be here for something "soon" but then it still took so long!"...Anyway,"
Uh..."JTo tell the truth, there's something I've been wanting to say to you.",I know I've been, well, kind of a brat."CBut even despite that, you were there to help out in Ametrine,"zAnd even though I didn't really understand what was going on at the time, you were there at the doctor's place too..."WYou and Shelly have always done your best for me, even though I never deserved it."4I'm not really used to people being nice to me."*I mean, you saw what my dad was like."2And I ended up finding an old journal of his."TI guess in his own weird, roundabout way he was just trying to look out for me."5It's a lot to take in, but I think I understand."5Even if I don't really know... how to handle it?".Um... God, I sound like Shelly right now."The point is, okay...?!"Thank you!".For... trying to help me even though I..."Uh, well, whatever!!!"+You don't care about all that, right!?"0None of that matters; you're here to fight!";But if you underestimate me now, you'll be blown away!"VI didn't really get what was going on, but I know you were helping me out before."With that, um, doctor guy.".I guess back then I probably needed that."And then in Ametrine, too."
