 here and not even bring a full team to fight with?"Do you WANT me to lose?"?(Seriously, how did this moron ever get to be champion...)"\Go back and get some actual goddamn Pok√©mon before I lose my fucking patience already!"FLORA: Hey, \PN?"What are you doing?"SDid you perhaps somehow manage to forget that you need to PICK SOME POK√âMON?!"#This has been a genuine treat!"1FLORA: Free. Even with this jacked up arena."iLAURA: I don't know that I would particularly estimate the battle as having been "free", but........"aLAURA: If your victory can be a point of pride for you, then that's more than enough for me."FLORA: ...Whatever."(You put up a decent fight, I guess."K(And it is nice to see someone with Grass Types in a high position...)",(Maybe not EVERYONE here is worthless.)":But you are seriously WAY too nice for your own good."5LAURA: I........ do hear that from time to time."<I don't suppose you've met my younger sister, have you?"8I believe the two of you might get along very well."&Possibly dangerously well........"=........Perhaps it is for the best that you do not meet."*FLORA: I'll put it on my bucket list."I'm going ahead."HLAURA: She seems to be of a similar type of girl to my own sisters."öI think all of them would be much benefitted by setting down their respective objectives, and learning to enjoy a moment of tranquility among the flowers."|I don't know her that well, but is it too naive to hope that, perhaps knowing that is why she uses Grass Types herself?"6It really is good to see you back here once more."NDid you see how well the flowers in my garden have been growing recently?"`In moments like these, I'm grateful to have someone else here to witness their beauty, too."5Shall we enjoy a moment to admire them together?"Wonderful as always.">LAURA: Any moment shared with you is one to be cherished."FI hope that the rest of your moments today are just as beautiful."<You're always welcome in my garden whenever you please."MLAURA: I hope that the rest of your moments today are just as beautiful."Yes"NoIu;␀#;[[â"ELIAS: Dominus vobiscum."So you return."IRepetita iuvant, but let us hope your conviction is stronger for it."With no time to waste,"Let us test them at once."/Show me the spirit He has placed unto you!"*ELIAS: Descensus in cuniculi cavum...":You go ever-onward through madness and monster alike."YI implore you, though with little merit to it, to not think of me now as the latter."7As I have failed in my duty, my master has passed."*As he has passed, so has my contract."QCuiusvis hominis est errare, nullius nisi insipientis in errore perseverare."(Only a fool persists in his faults."8My loyalty now lies not with mortals, but the Lord."ZAnd even I could not be blind enough to believe that that woman acts in His interest."EI understand that the one who fares the best against her is you."=You have always had the blessing of power, have you not?"8I first heard of how it shone atop Pyrous Mountain.":Thus, retribution is a mission I will entrust to you."It is not the only thing."I wager this against you--"%Thus, I wager this against you--"The Emerald Brooch."7This artifact of my Lord will choose its own fate."Your light..."My conviction..."7Let us witness firsthand which His destiny favors!"So be it."$ELIAS: Virtus tentamine gaudet."-Yours is a power that grows with defeat."*Against this, even she will not last."Your way is clear."+ELIAS: Your belief has won this fight."I give this freely."7ELIAS: Let destiny carry you to your true purpose."(That, not even my Lord may predict."NI, for one, will pray my daughter lies safely somewhere at the end of it.".Until next time, pax vobiscum, and adieu.".ELIAS: Little have I gained and not lost."5Beauty is said to be in the eye of the beholder,"FBut what good is sight without that which one loves to gaze upon?"0Even my Lord does not permit me to see Him."Dominus illuminatio mea..."The Lord is my light,"(But men may not stare into the sun."RPerhaps 