 was still at the orphanage, we all used to play games as much as we could together.":And there was one game that I was always the best at."Chess, of course!"NNo one could even stand a chance against me... except for one other girl."Her name was Lin."0In the end, we developed kind of a rivalry."nI thought it was all in good spirits fun until one day, I suddenly reversed a losing game on her and won."YShe snapped at me, and the Doctor got angry, and both of them started yelling and..."DWell, I never saw her again after she was put into the Circuit."RI heard she escaped that night, but the Doctor refused to ever talk about it."[Then, before long, the Lin we know now appeared and started pulling strings elsewhere."8There's no doubt in my mind that it's the same Lin."And I think..."9All of this has still been some kind of game to her.",She hasn't come after me in specific..."+But if I were her opponent, would she?"HI know I'm such a child to have let a stupid rivalry come this far.">But that's all the more reason why we have to end it now!"$I couldn't do it myself before."$That's why I'm counting on you."Thank you for everything."Please..."ANNA: Take this."?ANNA: It may seem like a bad thing at first, but trust me."This is for the best."-We'll be right there with you too, okay?"You can do it.")Because you're the one Nostra chose."*Because you've already come this far."And because...")For everyone's sake, we have to win."Good luck out there."ANNA: Go ahead."+You aren't fighting this battle alone."!Me, Nostra, your Pok√©mon..."(We're all with you to the very end."XAME: Anna's a great kid, but somebody needs to tell her to treat her toys better..."1I can't believe she requested this set-up..."WShe said something about it being because she feels guilty, but I don't... get it."MI should never have approved this, I should never have approved this~...";Celebi seems curious about who that voice belonged to."=Celebi seems pretty tired out after all the time travel."1Celebi seems full of energy and ready to go!".Do you want to travel through time again?"jYou once again feel your surroundings fade away around you as Celebi brings you forward through time!"<Celebi looks a little impatient, but will wait for you."@TAKA: But why would she be in here, she's not Elite Four...",TAKA: ...I don't really like this room."+I didn't have proper toys growing up--")So, seeing all of this is kind of..."ELIAS: Of course it's her."5Another person who's death I am responsible for."[ELIAS: As eerie I find this room, she at least made the right choice going for stairs.",My floating platforms constantly break."UTAKA: We're so close to our time, the next jump will have to get us back, right?"7ELIAS: We should be going back to the present now."$These meetings have all been..."*I'm glad I got to see them all again."#AME: Shimmer, give me a boost."I can almost reach them..."AME: Gah!"{Officer, I swear, I didn't sneak into Anna's room while she was away with the sole purpose of rescuing all these toys!"GThat's a preposterous accusation which I can't believe you'd make!"I'm hurt!"Wounded!",My heart weeps at the mere insinuation!"%AME: And even if it were true..."mI shan't be pressured and shamed by some thuggish officer of the state for trying to do the right thing!"MI will give each of these toys a safe home, and nobody is going stop me!"5...This doesn't mean you're Champion now, right?"MAME: Whoa, what kind of officer are you that you can beat me so easily!?"9TAKA: Uh, hi. We're nothing to do with the police...".TAKA: I'm Taka. And you just battled \PN."#We're kind of from the future."sAME: Oh! And over there must be that time traveling lettuce Pok√©mon I saw in one of the books in Elias' room?"]TAKA: ...Do you make a habit of going into the Elite Four's rooms when they aren't here?"6AME: Do you make a habit of impersonating police?"That sounds like a crime.""TAKA: We didn't... Nevermind."iCelebi just needs to rest before time traveling-- so we've been making small jumps to get back home."sIt seems like we're pretty close to our time period though, so we can get out of your hair and leave you to..."0Doing nothing criminal whatsoever, I guess.""AME: Hey, hold up a minute..."0\PN, right? You're a very talented trainer."1Have you challenged the League in your time?"IIf not, you should-- you might have what it takes to go all the way!"TAKA: About that..."'\PN is your successor as Champion.".AME: Wait, so you've beaten me twice now?"That's incredible!"cMy dream was to build up this League to attract the best trainers from all around the world..."2And clearly it worked! I couldn't be happier!"?To think my League attracted such an incredible trainer..."!Well, don't let me keep you!"IYou should get back to your time-- say "Hi" to me when you get back!"FAME: Whoa, what kind of officer are you that you can beat me so--",Wait, Elias!? Is this trainer with you?"8Did you sneak in here to rescue all of Anna's toys?"@Bringing a friend was a good call; I'm struggling to reach."ELIAS: Amethyst."+That's very much your hobby, not mine."3AME: I have no idea what you're talking about."DI have never done anything of questionable legality in my life."pShimmer appears to be doing a dance to try to distract you while Ame hides a definitely-stolen Cleffa doll."ELIAS: ..."-ELIAS: Amethyst, this is \PN. They are--"!AME: From the future, right?"ELIAS: How did you--"nAME: Oh, please, one doesn't get to be the head of a League without learning a few things here and there."It can time travel, right?"5Although honestly, what I noticed first was you."You seem a bit... softer."ELIAS: If you say so."\Ahem, well, yes. We're from... I'm not sure exactly how far, but definitely the future."RAME: Well however long it is, I'm glad you seem to be a bit less high-strung."Anyway though!">Who is this \PN person, and why are you both in the past?"ELIAS: Ah, he is..."ELIAS: Ah, she is..."ELIAS: Ah, they are..."!The next Champion of Reborn."You did your job well."0AME: Thanks El, that's very sweet of you..."..."
