Hope.";AMARIA: All things have to end eventually, don't they?"3Perhaps it's only fitting for someone like me,">But if the world burns out, I'll never learn to be happy."F\PN, I trust you to make sure the thing that ends is Team Meteor."2SAPHIRA: This long fight is coming to an end."Go for the throat.".And if that's not enough, then the heart."WSHELLY: One day I'm going to be the best Bug Type Trainer in the whole wide world!"EThat's right, this world! The one we've all fought for together!"/CAL: Everything has the ability to change."$Let's count on it doing so now."8NOEL: There are too many things I don't understand,"%Like love and family and people."But I'll figure it out."#That probability still exists."OCHARLOTTE: Oh, please, like \PN would get this far and just fall flat now."&The job's already like, 99% done.""Finish it out, wrecking ball!"CAYA: If it weren't for \PN, we already wouldn't still be here."=HARDY: But we are here, and nothing's gonna change that!"\PN'll see to it, right?!"hSERRA: Even if everything is in pieces now, that doesn't mean that nothing good can come from them."AAll that's necessary is the strength to move forward anyway."LUNA: Forget us not, \PN."&I am yet closer than ever to you."6I, too, will not allow this to end in such a way."1This is not the darkness we should treasure."TITANIA: Hmph."AYou really think \PN's gonna give in to something like that?";I don't think he even knows the meaning of 'quitting'."<I don't think she even knows the meaning of 'quitting'."<I don't think they even know the meaning of 'quitting'."ADRIENN: Champion!"/If you're out there, then make no mistake!""This is your moment to shine!"ETake everything the future has for you in hand once and for all!"ECIEL: That buffoon's really gone out there somewhere, hasn't he."PStill, I have faith that he and his pig-headed attitude are alive and well."<Don't you go flipping the script on us either just yet!"This show is not over!"2ASTER: That group's gotten so far, h