ld get."7Wouldn't have blamed you if you never looked back."*In fact, I considered following suit."But here you are."	Why?"CIt sounded like a perfectly reasonable course of action to me.":Maybe some day I'll get the chance to take it myself."/TITANIA: Thanks for snapping me out of it."(Feel free to snap harder next time."TI don't want an embarrassing mistake like that on me for longer than necessary."'Zero recollection until I came to."?I don't like anyone having that kind of influence over me."0...But what's done is done, and in the end,"Maybe it was for the best."&Now I have the distance I needed."Freedom to think."Nothing to run from."....I've been thinking about writing more."Easier than battling."Whenever I lose, I think,"%"Maybe I should stick to books.""`But even when I mess up at writing, I'm not thinking "Maybe I should've stuck to battling.""There's something there."Something important."mTITANIA: I know a lot of people won't believe me, but I don't exactly relish turning my blade on people."I don't love violence."9It's just the only thing that some people listen to.";It's the only thing some people can listen to anymore."FIn the case of Aya's step-father, I'm sure a threat will suffice.",But that's its own kind of tragedy too."%I'm so beyond tired of conflict.";And there's nothing to do but build a little bridge..."4TITANIA: Taking a rest after the train jacking?"Yeah, I know about it."BMr. Rock Dundee over there hasn‚Äôt stopped talking about it."XI‚Äôve got to say, I wish I‚Äôd been able to see those Orbs before they got stolen.">They sound like a pain, but I‚Äôm honestly a bit curious."vOf course, now they‚Äôre lost and that thief‚Äôs probably in the back end of nowhere by now, but what can you do."9Maybe they‚Äôll turn up again and I can have a look."pI don‚Äôt have much faith in Reborn‚Äôs police department, but I think they‚Äôre pretty steamed about this."Anyway, good job."6You‚Äôre good at not dying, I‚Äôll give you that,"YAnd Julia seems