om the way Julia talked about it."CDon't tell me the secret lover you took with you already left!"8I'm always here if you need to talk about anything!"You know what's funny?"DJulia originally said that it was Tania that you took with you!"Isn't that funny?"ZOf course, she was in the next room over when she said that, so I knew she was lying."BBut then you really were gone for quite a while, weren't you?";Next, someone's gonna tell me that you and Lin were..."....Perhaps it's better we don't go there!"$Anyway, great to see you again!"#AMARIA: Oh, \PN. Back so soon?"So nice to see you again!"8Julia told me you... "eloped"... after beating Lin.""To Kalos," she said."..."With Tania"..."..."IWell, it was a funnier joke after Tania showed up again without you!"3She's not exactly the eloping type, of course!"/So there's no way it could be true, right?"5Anyway, you should come by my gym again someday.""I had a lot of fun last time.",AMARIA: Oh, I‚Äôm surprised to see you!"eAfter what happened with the train heist, I wasn‚Äôt sure if you‚Äôd be around here for a while."<You were security detail when it was robbed, after all!"uOh, but I‚Äôm sure you couldn‚Äôt have predicted what might happen. I was just worried you might be embarrassed."%I did want to ask you, actually!",What was it like, holding the Blue Orb?"lI‚Äôve always wanted to see it. An artifact swirling with the pure, concentrated essence of the deep‚Ä¶"It sounds wonderful."MI do hope the thief gets caught. I‚Äôd really love to see it for myself."DIn the meantime, don‚Äôt let one failed mission discourage you."&I‚Äôm sure there‚Äôll be others!~"?AMARIA: Oh, \PN! I wondered if we‚Äôd see you around here."UI‚Äôm so glad you were there to make sure that train heist didn‚Äôt go too awry.">Oh, I know it was a bit of a fiasco, but no one was hurt!"1I do almost wish I‚Äôd been there, though‚Ä¶"7I‚Äôve always wanted to see the Blue Orb up close."aAn artifact swirling with the pure concentrated essence of the ocean‚Ä