 mean that girl who fought me with you."CNo offense, \PN, but you‚Äôve got some weird taste in company."What a bitch!"ãI know, I know, you have to deal with all kinds of people when you‚Äôre a League employee, blah blah, whatever. That doesn‚Äôt make it fun."]She was pretty strong, though, I‚Äôll give her that. The battle was actually pretty fun."6Just don‚Äôt tell her that, if you see her again."DSome things aren‚Äôt worth it no matter how cool the battle is."FHEATHER: Y'know, I heard about what happened at the Battle Wheel.""With Meloetta and everything."<I know it sounds kinda dumb, but I wish I'd been there." It sounded like a fun time."2And the Battle Wheel sounds pretty cool, too."<I think they're closing it up for a while, which sucks,"CBut as soon as they open it up again, I'm gonna give it a try."9Meloetta won't be there, but it should still be fun."HEATHER: Hey, \PN."7I know all this Anomaly stuff is kind of a mess..."#But it's kind of awesome, too!"4Shelly and I are gonna get back out there soon."IHEATHER: Hope you're ready to lose next time you drop by the League!"HEATHER: Hey."Thanks for helping."9HEATHER: I hope everyone's doing okay over in Beryl.""I haven't been by in a while."$Maybe I should stop over later." VICTORIA: \PN, you're back!"How was your meditation?"$If that was what was happening."ìI heard from Bee about that Pok√©mon she asked you to look after, and I wondered if maybe it got out of hand and you were training it or something."0I don't know much about those Ultra Beasts."5Either way, I'd love to have been in your shoes."6A little vacation up on a mountain to meditate..."Sounds nice."DMaybe if I can get caught up on a bit more at the Grand Hall...""Anyway, I'm glad you're back."GI'll let Adrienn know, if I see xem before you. Xe's been worried."4VICTORIA: I wonder how much I've missed out on."6Between trying so hard to keep everyone together,"$Trying so hard to be like Kiki,"'To keep the Reborn League running,"*To do everything r