d everyone thought its UNUNUNUNUN was just part of the beat?"9I wonder how long it would take someone to notice..."LIN: Welcome, \PN."&ADRIENN: What are you doing here?"We've already--""\PN has already defeated you!"8LIN: You were quite generous to show that boy here."I thank you for that,""Since he, in turn, showed me."*ADRIENN: What are you talking about?!"PLIN: He is beyond incompetent, but his victim act must be quite compelling."7Everyone is so quick to give into crocodile tears,"EBut when they come to the jaws of the beast, they act surprised."DLIN: I think we'll be seeing each other a lot more from now on."&After all, we have the same goal."/LIN: All we have to do is get it from her."Candy from a baby."Flowers from a grave."Isn't that right?"#Welcome to the Battle Factory."3Would you like to fight in Singles or Doubles?"ÄFor the Battle Factory, you may choose to have one random field for the entire set, or a different random field for each battle."Which would you like?"9You'll get one random field effect for the full set."3You'll get one random field effect per battle." Congratulations on the win."HI will take your rental Pok√©mon back and return your own Pok√©mon."6We've been waiting for you. Please come this way."SSHADE: Fortune favors the forsaken, but few find the forsaken be such forever."SHADE: ..."NYU: Haihaihai, \PN!"cI heard they'd give me foodstuffs if I helped out here so I'm pretending to do work right now."'Hey, do you wanna go do it for me?"4I won't share my food but I will share my love."<NYU: Haihaihai, random person who just walked up to me!";We didn't meet in a different file or anything, right?"_My name is better left unsaid, but if you must know, I am Sir Elyvilon Nyunyunyu Esq. III."You can just call me Nyu~"wTechnically I created Reborn's PC server system-y stuff, but I prefer to think of myself as just a simple Pikachu.">Anyway you're here because you wanted to help out, right?"NYU: Oh, it's you again~""Did you bring food this time?"3Or did you just want to hear about the thingy?"GLately there have been some earthquakes in the Chrysolia region..."$Huh, didn't that happen before?"BWell, if it was a really big Pikachu that caused them before,";It's probably a really big Pikachu causing them again~"wSooooo we need someone to go down to Chrysolia Forest and poke around until we find what's causing them this time."II think someone said something about hearing train noises there too?"GBut maybe the Pikachu just got hungry and ate the train for lunch."1That can't be healthy... Trains are so oily."%Were we talking about something?".Oh, will you go find that Pikachu for me?"Super sweetness~"YIf you look for train crumbs in Chrysolia you'll probably find it eventually, maybe.")And remember, when in doubt: Eat it!"But I don't wanna..."KA really really big Pikachu ate a train somewhere in Chrysolia, maybe."<Maybe it also didn't eat it and just made train sounds?"%Or maybe the Pikachu is a train?"6Maybe it's just training to reach a higher level?"I don't remember..."Hey, do you smell muffins?"!Mmmm, mollycoddling muffins~"NYU: Haihaihai~"kRecently, there've been some reports of multiple Pikachu swimming underwater within Ametrine Mountain."EThey're probably not hurting anything there, but it's a Pikachu,"1So someone should probably go check on them~"One person already went..."+Um, what's her face, with the glasses~"bBut since there's more than one Pikachu, it probably makes sense to send more than one human!"D'you wanna go too?"3NYU: I'm sure you're in for a spicy adventure!"AIt'll be somewhere underwater in the greater Ametrine area--"CI think someone said something about looking for Ametrine B1F?"Probably?"Or maybe not.",Even Pikachu have to breathe sometimes."$NYU: Oh, well. That's fine too~"fNYU: There've been some reports of multiple Pikachu swimming underwater within Ametrine Mountain."Lso someone should probably go check on them~ One person already went..."=She'll probably be fine even if you take a while though!"LI'm sure even now, she's camped out, having a nice, tantalizing picnic,"7Featuring such delights as the boisterous biscuit!"!And serendipitous sammiches~"3Hey, hey, bring me back a sandwich, would you?"ERANDALL: Hang onto your knickers, partner-- we've got a big one."]Reports are saying that people were seeing one of those Animes up on the Wasteland Wall."IYou know, the one that divides Chrysolia and Byxbibsixthshypsixsion?"But get you this...")The 'Mon they said was in the Anime?"Mewtwo."'Yeah-- I didn't believe it either."SBut I think some folks are gonna be wantin' to jump on this Anime right quick."You one of 'em?""RANDALL: You got it, partner."@Get in there and show that Anime who's what and what's who!"0RANDALL: Leave it to the little people, eh?"eSure is generous of you to give the others a chance at an Anime as powerful as that one first..."URANDALL: There's were some reports of an Anime spotted up on the Wasteland Wall." Thems says it was a Mewtwo!"HThe wall is between Chrysolia and Byxbuxbaxbexbestbysinthewestsion."ÑBut just betwixt you, me, and the ol' ragged fencepost, I reckon you'd have an easier time gettin' up there from the Chrysolia side."=Done some exploring around there myself, don't you know?"Look hard on that one."Good luck, partner!"NYU: Haihaihai again, \PN~"5Today, I have a special invitation just for you!"JNo Pikachu today, but some of the others are having a special picnic!"BI don't remember their names, but it was a bunch of the kids!"*And they told me I should invite you~"0Like as a cherubic chaperone type of thing?"NYU: Sweetness~"_They said they were gonna try and find a good picnicketty spot over in Rhodochrine Jungle."Maybe near that tree?"I wish I could go too,"pBut I don't wanna intrude, and it's okay because secretly I'm hiding all my snacks behind this desk anyway."You have fun~"1NYU: Wait, you don't want to go on a picnic?"*Where you sit outside and eat things?"I don't understand?"9NYU: Some of the others are having a special picnic!"But why picnic near there?"1It's not like you could eat the tree, right?")It's not like a gellatinous juniper,"Or a crunchy confier,"!Or the splendiferous spruce."It's just a tree?"5Then again, you don't have to let that stop you."When in doubt, eat it!"INYU: So I heard that a Pikachu ate all the color from your picnic..."SI don't see this as a problem, but I guess we gotta protect the pretty colors."HSo anyway you need one 100% organic Zygarde to continue the picnic?"_I'm not here to judge anyone's dietary choices, but I don't think those cells cook well..."!Well, when in doubt, eat it!"ARC: And here he is!"The man of the hour!"ARC: And here she is!"The lady of the hour!"ARC: And here they are!"The savior of the hour!"ARC: \PN!!!!"Always knew you'd do it."uThere's no words enough to express our thanks, so instead the memories we make from here on out will have to do."\With the Champion back in our back pocket, there's no fight we can't both pick and win."'ARC: But there's a lot to explain."%Why don't you come on over here?"pARC: I'd ask where in the world you've been, but for better or worse, I've got a few guesses on the matter."&Lemme cut straight to the chase--"-Meteor's out, but the chaos is still in."fThe good news is that any grunts that weren't turned in turned over a new leaf, and the admins..."#Well, ain't none of them left."!Not even Lin, thanks to you."FAnyone who still had ties in the higher ranks is on our side now."0It's a total team KO if ever I've seen one."-The bad news is that the damage is done.">Their goal of opening the New World ultimately succeeded."HThanks to you, it didn't get so far as overwriting this one, but..."3To put it simply, they're starting to overlap."zThe unformed New World has been leaking into ours for quite some time now, causing this, that, and the other problem."mFor one thing, the energy from the New World has awoken new heights of potential in Pok√©mon everywhere."zWhere it was impossible to go above Level 100 before, Pok√©mon have been sighted growing to as high as Level 150 now."8Double the worlds, double the power-- or somethin'."+An' there's one other... complication."gYou know how there's supposed to be some Pok√©mon out there that there's only one of in the world?"Yeah, so... about that."Not... anymore."AIt seems like anything can appear or exist in the New World."Uh, so..."What I'm trying to say here is that yesterday fourteen Genesect fell out of the New World and were running amok on Main Street."[We already took care of them, so no need to worry about that, but-- you get the point."úAll sorts of Pok√©mon have appeared in all sorts of places, but Legendaries in particular, given their big power, tend to create problems when they show up."YFor instance, the TV station was totally trashed after a Zapdos spawned inside it..."cThose few seconds of the recording before it cut out were pretty incredible though, can't lie."eLots of the other leaders are already away hunting them and putting out Legendary-related fires."9If you're up to it, we can definitely use your help.">My bad for springin' this on you right when you get back."åAfter shit hit the fan, I decided I'd convert this place into a base of operations for dealing with these kinds of issues all over the city."sBy the old policy, only League Leaders and Champions would've been allowed in, but that was Ame's idea, and...",Well, this works out better now anyway."uThere's a lot of cool stuff in this place that might be worth checking out too, so by all means, take your time!"QWe've got an arena behind us that you can use to spar with the friendlies..."HThe Battle Pavilion's on your left-- free use for all trainers now."GNo end to the fights there, and you might see some familiar faces."eAnd finally, I rigged one of the dance floors into a pseudo-map of the region over on the right."xWe're using that to mark down where reports of New World Anomalies come in-- be it Legendaries or overlap points..."?So talk to the folks over there if you wanna help 'em out!"8Whatever you do, champ, it's good to have you back!"$Hit me up if you need anything!"ARC: Hey, Champ!"5What's this I hear about you capturing Meloetta?""Maaan, I wish I'd been there."ARC: ...")Hey, I know now's not the best time,"<But do you think sometime she'd want to do a show here?"-It'd liven up the place, and honestly..."=Collaborating with an artist like that would be a dream."2But after things have settled down, for sure."#Maybe float the idea past her?";In the meantime, keep up the good work as always, \PN."6ARC: Glad everything went well with the poachers.">I've got to admit, I wasn't so sure about this at first--"-Working with Pok√©mon poachers and all--"%But I'm glad it worked out well."I was surprised, actually."=They seem like a pretty good lot, all things considered."NA few of 'em have even been stopping by to battle it out at the Pavilion."DJust more proof that people can change for the better, I guess."[ARC: Man, when I offered to help out with the band, I wasn't expecting that to happen."Y...Even without the New World stuff, it's been a bit more than I expected, honestly."pThey're all working really hard, but between you and me, not one of those kids knows anything about mixing."It's been a lot."èI don't mind helping out, but... between running this place, organizing the Anomaly hunts, and the band, I feel like I'm in a bit over my head.";Maybe I'll see about trying to teach Hardy the basics."~He seems like a quick learner when it comes to music, and maybe if he picks up a few things I can stay more in the background."JStill be there to help out and all, but not have quite so much to do."7Ah... Sorry, \PN, I guess I was thinking out loud.".I'll talk to Hardy about it, don't worry."*You just focus on relaxing for a bit."Arce-- Uh."#Everyone knows you deserve it."1ARC: How've you been managing it all, Champ?"FSeems like you've been helpin' ou