 did it, boss."You finally ran 'em dry."?Turns out, no new Anomalies have been created for a while."GSeems like they stopped even before you encountered that Giratina."[The ones that already existed were hidden, and now the ones that were hidden are gone."End of the road."HMaybe some of us can finally get some shuteye around here for once."CAIN: Hey."/Thanks for helping me out of there, ahaha."7I may be pretty good at gettin' around, but that--"+That was a heck of a place to wake up."8I guess... I've got a lot of things to think about,"-But when I got in here and saw everyone?"It felt good."2So maybe that's a good place to start, right?"#Anyway, this place is awesome!"KI never thought something like this could pop up right in Reborn City!"=I'm gonna hang around for a bit, catch up with everyone."MApparently there's a whole bunch of those Anomaly things running around?"/That sounds like it'd be fun to check out."=...As long as, y'know, I don't get stuck in there again."1But if I do, I'll count on you to rescue me!"Your fair prince!"Haha..."!But seriously, thanks again."wCAIN: Looks like I gotta add dealing with our messed up family to the loooooong list of things I owe you for, huh?"$Thanks for looking out for Aya."4I wish I coulda done that better myself, but..."=Uh, well, in my defense, I am still the younger sibling."!I don't act like it, I know~"CBut my youthful complexion and dulcet tones do not lie to you~"I am still young~"Still fertile~""I mean-- what, who said that?"FBut you know, it's nice to actually have a crew to sing with too."TYou'll still come to all of our shows even if they keep getting invaded, right?",You can invade our shows any time, \PN~".CAIN: \PN, you've been holding out on me!"/I've been catching up with everyone a bit,""And Julia told me everything."So did everyone else."XAll that time in that cave, and you never mentioned you got kidnapped by a Darkrai?"3Or that you went off on some romantic getaway?">Or that all this time you've 