ies running around Labradorra, leave it to me, got it?"+I've already had my Gym hijacked once;".I'm not letting anything else fuck it up."So let me know, hm?"#SAPHIRA: Be careful out there."QIf you meet any immovable objects, you know which unstoppable force to call."6SAPHIRA: You're part of the family too, you know."'Not in the same way as my sisters."3There's a pecking order you have to deal with,"But you're in it."7SAPHIRA: I'm not here to party, just to chaperone."Seeing everyone safe..."That's enough for me."XACE: So this is where all you little heroes have been camping out in all this time!"2I've got to say, I quite enjoy the spectacle!"sWhere all life is but a precession of stimulation, a bit of smoke and mirrors do a lot to light up our nights!"cIf what all we know is constrained solely to our experiences, then is illusion truly delusion,"1Or was it just a memory made special for us?"*Make some fine memories, little hero!"$Some days, they're all we have."*ACE: Ah-- \PN, a moment of your time.",Back at that awfully chilly New World--"ZCertainly a rather... frigid and unpleasant place to wake up in my own right mind to."ZBut perhaps, it is the company I kept that made the spectacle all the more tolerable."yI hadn't the chance before to express my thanks truly and properly for rescuing me from that predicament of its own."SIt is admittedly still difficult to remember all the details before I came to."7Ah, but why dwell on matters out of our own hands?"{I'd simply wanted to find the time to thank you from the bottom of my heart for rescuing the little prince as you did."kI had enough lucidity at the start from the box I was in to save ZEL from Magnezone's explosion, but--"àI-- I-I'd never quite lived out my own nightmares in reality as I did when I bore witness to his fate in that Steel Leader's Gym, and..."UACE: ...Well, all I can say is that I have never been more grateful as I am now.")...For you, and for his safe return."8ACE: Trouble with a disappearing dragon, was there?"5You know, I always did think it was a bit queer,"SThe wasteland packed more whimsy and pizzazz than you could punt a whiffle at."Why would that be?"8Some kind of Legendary force just living out there?"*Something real that no one could see?"oThings like that-- they're always in such a way that someone must be trying very hard to keep them hidden."`It is perhaps surprising that someone of my persuasions didn't see through the ruse sooner!"xAh, but if we could see all of life's illusions with just a glance, then what would be the point of looking at all?"?It does this performer a spot of good to be outmaneuvered!"8Still, all for the best for you to still the beast."QAnd don't bother asking something silly like how I would know what happened."Didn't I ever tell you?" I can read minds, you know!"LACE: Still finding all those antagonistic Anomalies out there, are you?"YI've heard quite magnificent tales of all the magic you've mustered on your journey!"2Ah, you needn't be shy about it, little hero!"+Why, what's the gain of embarrassment?"$Only to dim a spectacular show!"úYou've committed an admirable amount of splendor amongst all your adventures-- but even then, what is any adventure but another stepping stone to the stars?"YLet yourself shine-- the stars will thank you themselves, to see another among them!"cACE: By the by, I understand you picked up a little friend down in the Water Treatment Center!"FAnd I know you won't do something silly like ask how I know that!" I was perhaps, wondering..."May I see the little one?"EACE: ...Hm? That doesn't seem to be the little one I remember...";ACE: You're still quite small, aren't you, little one?"?ACE: You're growing stronger under \PN's care, aren't you?".ACE: Ah, you're all grown up, little one!""I'd missed seeing you dearly."iIt was a bit of a rushed job, you see-- the circumstances hadn't exactly permitted me any different."7I'd hoped that it wouldn't be too lonely in there."M...Perhaps you and I aren't so different in that regard, hm, little one?"HI count myself grateful that you're in more than capable hands now."And to you, \PN--"TACE: You may consider your debt of paying it forward as fully imbursed already!"ïIf this little one helped you step forward at any part of your journey between saving the world and freeing me, then it is a miracle play in my book!"And if it didn't...".Well, no accounting for taste, I suppose!"2Do take care of each other anyway, won't you?" ACE: Ah, understandably so."&Perhaps I could ask another time." ACE: Pick a card, any card!"Ah, of course!"&I knew you'd pick the 'Yes' card!"ACE: Ah, of course!"%I knew you'd pick the 'No' card!"'It was written all over your face."8Now I'll simply spin it around twice like so, and--"ACE: Voila!"+The card has completely changed color!"$You may keep it, as a souvenir!"<ACE: ...That really was the end of the line, wasn't it?"LI must be honest, I might find myself missing the excitement of it all.""...Minus the danger, that is."xAny chance to remedy any prior ill will or to merely enjoy the presence of those dear to me is gratefully accepted."3Still, you are, as always, deeply appreciated."You know, little hero,"<If you ever find yourself not wanting the magic to end,"4Or perhaps you'd like to make some of your own?"=I'll let you in on a little trick of my own, with love--")You might be familiar with this one~"But guard it with caution!"0A magician must never reveal their secrets~"]The next time someone asks you for a password, you might try and tell them "mintyfresh"!"LAnd perhaps teach me a little of your own magic while you're at it, hm?"jACE: I can't help but feel just the slightest bit out of place among all of your allies, little hero."xThough some are my own friends too, to have truly resolved any conflict is as magic as I've ever managed to muster!"uACE: If you ever have need of strength, I'm sure any of these other strapping Trainers will readily back you up.")Ah, but if what yo