 lot to manage."But it just... felt right."5To finally be able to do something right myself."LBeing able to support you there, and support behind the counter here..."ZERO: ...Y'know, \PN..."3All that time behind the desk got me thinking."VKinda want to see if there's some other places where I can try and help out, too."3Helping manage all of those Anomaly reports..."It just... felt right."~If we could all do the little things within our power to help the people around us, then maybe things wouldn't be so bad."0...U-uh, sorry to lay that on you suddenly."You know, again."'Thanks for hearing me out, though."JZERO: Heh, guess I've gotta figure out what else to do nowadays, huh."/It's uh, weird to not have anything to do."K...Don't have to tell me twice how much I've been blabbering about it."mI'm just glad that there's even been something that someone like me could do for this whole clusterfuck."ZERO: ...Uh."7"Someone like me" is only rude to myself, I guess."uThis is... embarrassing, but sometimes it still helps me to think of myself as if I were still different people."7I wouldn't want to talk like that to Eve and Lumi.")I know they wouldn't say that to me."So, uh... to correct it..."9I'm proud that I could still make a difference here.".Help around with fighting the good fight."8ZERO: I'm glad you stopped by for a chat over here."*...Maybe I'll join everyone sometime."*ZERO: Need any kind of support today?"#...Or were you just saying hi?"9ZERO: It can be kind of disorienting here sometimes."Not that I mind, though.":Good music, people who... still tolerate me? Friends?"It's nice."-SERRA: Now here's a sight for sore eyes."+I just have one question for you, \PN."Was there really a movie?"Or was that just a line?"SERRA: Heh. I figured."bA while after you disappeared, Julia 'let slip' that you'd been scouted by Pok√©star Studios."Wasn't sure what to think."#But really, I should've known."Anyway."RWe're both working on these Anomalies, so I'm sure we'll run 