 and my sisters will be able to make it, too!"7LAURA: I hope you've been taking care of yourself?"'Actually, I'm glad you stopped by."aI........ wasn't exactly thrilled, when I found out Bennett had sent you out to check on me,"/But at the same time, I was very grateful.""I was so worried, and........"$I couldn't handle it on my own."-But you found them both, safe and sound."JAnd as worried as I'd been, when I saw them both, I was even happier."#I really appreciate your help."#Things with my sisters........"9Aren't going to be as easy to patch up as I'd hoped."KBut while we were out there, I felt like we were taking steps forward."#They may have been baby steps,"5But any step forward is better than none at all!"I have faith in all of us."?LAURA: It's good to see you again outside of battle, haha!"7Truthfully, I was a bit........ concerned for you.">That girl who was with you-- Flora, I think her name was?"She was a bit........"Well........"1Well, she reminded me a little of Charlotte,"%When Charlotte was at her worst."So angry, and dismissive."But Charlotte--"FI won't say she's perfect now, but she's certainly gotten better."&And I really hope Flora can, too!"_I'm sure she can. She just needs a little time to grow, and some people to believe in her."TI‚Äôm glad you were able to be there for her, \PN, at least for a little while."pLAURA: I was talking to Serra a little while ago, and she told me about the adventure you had with Victini!",It sounds like a nice trip you all had."8I wonder why Bennett didn't tell me, though........" I never knew he could cook!"*Haha, I wish I'd been able to see it!"QMaybe I'll go check out Aegir Cave sometime, when the League's not too busy."8If you wanted to come along, that would be amazing!"CMaybe we could get some more people to come along, too........"7We could make a whole picnic! Or even a tea party!"1Aah, a tea party with friends sounds lovely."2I'll talk to everyone and let you know, okay?" Before I do, though........"7I wanted to thank you for being there for Bennett."jI know you've had some trouble in the past, and I'm really grateful you're giving him another chance."'I know it means a lot to him, too."=LAURA: Bennett and I were just talking about the League."BIt's been........ fairly quiet, since all of this started up."àI guess since most people who would be strong enough to challenge the Elite Four are already helping out here, with all the Legendaries."(And I don't mind the quiet, really!"7But I can't help worrying a little, about Bennett."1He's only just got the position, and........"aPlease don't tell him I told you, but I think he might still be beating himself up a little."(About what happened before, I mean."~Anyway, I think it might help him if he could do some more battling, just to remind himself that he deserves to be there."ISo, for his sake, I hope the League gets some more challengers soon.",And for yours, of course, new Champion!"@LAURA: I can hardly agree with this atmosphere, but........"<I'm glad that everyone seems to be enjoying themselves."@LAURA: You'll come by my garden again some time, won't you?"6LAURA: Do you think that bar carries herbal teas?"0I haven't wanted to bother about it........"JLAURA: Make sure you're taking plenty of breaks and staying hydrated!"-People aren't so different from flowers."We all need time to grow."DANIELLE: Hi again."WSo, turns out you're some kind of bigshot celeb who saved the world or whatever..."`If I'd known that, I might've shown you a little bit more respect in the times we talked..."...Hah!"As if."#You're just too easy to bully."1Now strap up, hero. There's work to be done."'A witness reported a new anomaly--"I...Okay, "anomaly" is so pretentious, let's just call it what it is."ASomeone saw a legendary at the Glass Workstation on Route 4."ÉShe also specifically requested we send someone familiar with the building, and from what I've heard, you technically fit the bill."nI'm assuming she's still in the area, so you probably need to get up there before she causes any trouble."$That's all I've got. Get going."6DANIELLE: Don't tell me you forgot the direction." Route 4, Glass Workstation."{We've reason to believe there's a witness loitering around up there, not to mention, you know, the Legendary Pok√©mon." Maybe get to it eventually."$ARCHER: Emergency for you, ace."<Apparently something's going down in Ametrine Mountain."_And by "going down in Ametrine Mountain," I mean "Ametrine Mountain itself is going down,""If we don't do something."1The mountain is melting from the inside out.")We think something spawned in there."iYou'll have to do some swimming to get to the very center of the mountain, but look for an icy area."%Or a formerly icy area, perhaps."-It may even be connected to Celestinine."*Apparently the damage is worst there."Good luck."#MAXWELL: There you are, champ!"<We've got an emergency going down in Ametrine Mountain,"8And that emergency is Ametrine Mountain going down.";Apparently something's meltin' it from the inside out."ISome kind of burning hole of desire melting through its very core..."BYou gotta get in there and check it out before it's too late!"eYou might have better luck getting into some parts of Ametrine by going through Celestinine too."jReport comes from a super deep part of the mountain, so you might need to take a dip to get in there."But best you get dippin'."For glory, baby."VDANIELLE: Okay, so apparently there's a huge cult chamber underneath Jasper Ward?"Subseven whatever?"Did you know about this?"íIs everyone just like, totally okay and accepting of these giant underground spaces under a densely- populated area belonging to fanatical groups?"(....Okay, you know what, forget it."8No wonder this city was nearly taken offline twice."You all had this coming."HAnyway, apparently there's some kind of energy fluctuation there..."ã...That's what I was told, but again, let's be real, it's probably just another Legendary that decided to stick its nose into our business." So that's your problem now."&Smeargle takes out its noteboard.""help human back !"" "hellogreetings help human"""new bigmon""$"help human help smeargle now?"""ok good"" "bigmon boom by beach cave"""red tail human go too""$"one eye red tail human go too"""black fur human go too"""go fix bigmon !!!""
"ok?"""ok good good!!""""go fix beach cave bigmon !!"""apopplio cave?"""beach beach beach beach""!"help human go go go go !!!""/"ok help human busy help smeargle not now""#It draws a picture of a beach."(DANIELLE: What the hell did you do?"ΩAfter Zero mentioned we weren't getting any readings, I heard you went off to the other meteor site and then all of the sudden we've got like four new reports and also our equipment busted."ûLike it wasn't picking anything up until you got that Giratina, and then all of the energy it should've been detecting came through at once and overloaded it."So nice going."wDoubt we're going to have any luck finding more Anomalies after the current round unless we can get that repaired."KAnyway, one of the reports we suddenly picked up was super high-speed."ÇNo idea where it came from, but it shot halfway across the region in a blink and currently it's stalled out atop Charous Mountain."0Easiest access is from the Pok√©mon League."Hardy already went up there, but I'm pretty sure he permanently forgot his brain cells at home, so you might wanna go help out."$FLORINIA: Greetings again, \PN."&I am... relieved to see you well."9This speaker is grateful to see you return unharmed."%There are two reasons therefore:"lFirst, it is only natural to be concerned about another's well-being after an untimely disappearance..."However..."dWhile the obvious level degree of human sympathy naturally still takes precedence and priority,")An additional selfish aspect exists."It's... Julia."rShe has repeatedly attempted to correlate your disappearance to a variety of statistically impossible causes."6It is... what some would probably call obnoxious."Maddening, perhaps."íAnd because I alone have continued to doubt the validity of her claims, she has made it a personal undertaking to repeat them as much as possible,"5And in increasing magnitudes of improbability..."tJulia has repeatedly attempted to correlate your disappearance to a variety of statistically impossible causes."OWhen this speaker did not believe her initial suggestion, she tried again."JAnd when the second trial produced additional failure, she continued."ãThe only worthwhile comment that can be said of any of it is that persistence is rivaled only by the sheer magnitude of her ridiculousness."BTherefore, additional gratitude for your return is warranted."-Thank you for inadvertently rescuing us.";FLORINIA: This is all very difficult to process fully."REmotions are ultimately mere electrical stimulation on a biological hardware."YEven then, what part of that electricity-- what neurotransmitter is responsible for,";The peace that the system feels upon accepting itself?"dWhat evolutionary mechanism had already adapted to protect even the very concept of mechanisms?"ZAnd even naming the specific chemicals and voltages involved, the routes they trace--"IHow should such things influence my perception as a conscious being?"AWhy is it my eyes that I, as a conscious being, see through?"YWhat makes my emotions so special that they need to be felt more than anyone else's?"All of the questions..."$...Don't have answers, do they?"HNo amount of science or study is equal to the task of solving them."\No, it's better to simply accept the way things are, and enjoy the lightness of it all.")There can be peace even under siege."bFLORINIA: I am grateful to not have closed the proverbial book on my former friends entirely."uIt is perhaps lamentable how regularly they require one to go in and avail themselves of their own drama, but..."9I suppose that is what some refer to as being the..."..."Mom friend"..."3...I do not know how I feel about that phrase."5Julia appears to be planning something sinister."^...Against my better judgment, I am rather looking forward to finding out what it may be.",FLORINIA: There's too much to identify."8A solution of hope and fear and relief and anxiety,"jBut independent of all of those feelings together, I can say with confidence that I'm glad he's back."<No analysis was necessary to settle on that conclusion."FLORINIA: ...\PN?"Something has happened?"Fern has--"...Understood.",I am glad to see that you are unharmed."7Actually, I had wanted to ask you about something."QSince the emergence of this 'New World', in addition to various Legendaries,"CCreatures known as 'Ultra Beasts' have been appearing as well."%I've been... curious, I suppose,"ÜAbout the differences between them, and would much appreciate the chance to inspect any further instances of them you might encounter."dThis speaker recognizes the dangers you have faced, and is glad that you have emerged unharmed."A query:"áSince the emergence of the phenomenon known as the 'New World', in addition to the presence of an unusual number of Legendary Pok√©mon,"NReports of the creatures known as 'Ultra Beasts' have also been received."àWhile this speaker has encountered one so far, further study of multiple samples is merited to ascertain validity of prior observations."-Have you encountered any such creatures?"Interesting."May I see?"?A moment, while this speaker examines the relevant data..."FLORINIA: Interesting.",Your assistance is greatly appreciated."IFLORINIA: The pertinent data has been downloaded from your Pok√©dex."8FLORINIA: Please return if you find an Ultra Beast."A shame."CIf you encounter any, I would appreciate if you would tell me.",I find the creatures quite interesting."vIf the subject encounters any such beings at any time in the future, this speaker would be interested in knowing."'FLORINIA: Thank you for your help."AI have been fascinated by these creatures for some time now."Thank you."QI've acquired a few of these specialized Poke Balls since all of this began."9To show my gratitude, I would like you to have some.".FLORINIA: Your assistance is appreciated.">The opportunity to study this data will prove invaluable."#In return, please accept this."oA small number had been collected to aid in study, and it would perhaps aid you in your endeavors as well."IFLORINIA: So Fern has decided to loiter around this place now too..."H...Perhaps it is for the best that he is no longer hiding his face."There is..."8...A surplus of confounding emotional information--"Er, that is to say...",I'm... not sure what to feel right now."NFLORINIA: There will always be uncertainties and confounding variables..."BTo gather all of one's anxieties and face them head- first..."%Perhaps that's what luck is for."AFLORINIA: I appreciate you taking the moment to check on me.".FLORINIA: This place is still a little..."Overstimulating.":Still, I would rather be here with everyone than not."FLORINIA: Good day."What do you require?"ELIAS: Master \PN!"HI heard you've decided to grace us with your presence once again..."vI dare not pretend I understand your intentions, but know that I am humbled, repentant, and beholden nonetheless."NIt is for this reason that I've returned to see of what service I may be."RIf you have but a moment to listen to the apologies of a humiliated servant--"BI wish to express my heartfelt regret for my prior blindness."[Not any blindness that affected my eyes, no-- but the blindness of my misplaced faith."CTruth be bared, I have been informed as to your true nature..."1That is, that you are the avatar of Arceus--"VDo not try to deny it, Master \PN. It is by your power that my eyes are open now."I understand fully how it was you who willed Meteor unmade, and how you triumphed over the blasphemer Lin to save your own kin.",Of course, I am not without discretion."ëI understand that any attempts to deny this truth are merely to preserve the sanctity of your secret, privacy, and the faith you ask from others.")This, I shall respect unflinchingly."lIn the meantime, from now until the end of my days, please understand that if you need anything at all,""I am wholly at your disposal."ELIAS: My Lord..."CI see you have returned my Master's progeny to us after all...":That your mercy and power would run even this deep..."Truly...""I am moved to tears of joy...":...Though, I also received a curious report recently."*There was a blaze within the sanctum?"&And the entrance has been sealed?"These events..."#Surely would not be related..."Would they..."...My Lord?"*I had many personal affects in there."äMemorabilia, personal writings, sermons and scripts, and tokens of history, both of the order and of my time with my dear former master..."!If that has all been lost..."#...Please forgive me, my Lord."XI have just remembered that I needed to inspect the quality of the stock back here."W...I believe I shall be inspecting and sampling it quite thoroughly for some time."RELIAS: I say, there was quite a strapping young Trainer around here recently."+Sunglasses and a black coat and hat..."8A wonderful choice of attire if I do say so myself."=ELIAS: To have been on a pilgrimage with you by my side,"1And to have witnessed the future for myself,",With these two eyes that you gave me..."/No amount of devotion is equal to my debt."HFor as long as I yet draw breath, I shall not forget this blessing.""ELIAS: Greetings, Master \PN."*It has... been an ordeal, has it not?"PI refer, of course, to our prior battle, and the guest who accompanied you."JI understand well that I am not well-versed in the ways of the young,"HBut it seems to me that that young woman was particularly spiteful."kHer strength in battle was admirable, but I fear that the strength of her character was not its equal."IBut she is yet young-- perhaps there is still time for her to learn.".Here I am, going on. Forgive me, my Lord."BI am sure there is none of this that you do not know already."+As always, your patience is admirable."'With myself, as well as... others."ELIAS: My Lord!"My apologies. \PN."/Please, have a seat, if you have the time."(I understand your time is valuable,"#And there is much still to do.")But if ever you are in need of rest,"Or even want of it,"'This may be a good place to do so."]If truth be bared, I have found it... a strangely good place to contemplate some things.";ELIAS: Ah, my child has taken one step into the light."This, too, is your doing,"Isn't it, my Lord?")ELIAS: Care to partake in communion?"XThough, I suppose that is a rather contentuous ritual for someone such as yourself."+ELIAS: What can I do for you, my Lord?"HELIAS: It is never too late to share a few spirits between friends."ELIAS: Pax tecum, my lord."6ELIAS: Do tell me if I can get you anything else."2ELIAS: Mx. Flores, would you care to join us?"ADRIENN: Ah, why not?",I can spare a few minutes at the least.",ELIAS: What can I get you this evening?"&ADRIENN: Something light, please."1I prefer to have my wits within arm's reach."&ELIAS: For our esteemed director,"Perhaps a ros√© wine,"6With a strawberry accent and pea flower flourish,"(ELIAS: Shall I put it on the rocks?"#ADRIENN: If you would, please."!ELIAS: It is yours to enjoy."ADRIENN: Much appreciated~"RWhen we first met, I wouldn't exactly have taken you for the bartending type.".How did you get into something like this?"/ELIAS: It is, perhaps, an expected answer."jMy former master bade me learn the basics, that I might better serve him in the realm of leisure too."M...That is what I had thought before, but I cannot help but believe now,"xPerhaps he requested this not for his service, but that in partaking of my craft, I might lower my own inhibitions."EI might find the closeness I falsely believed I was barred from."$Vinum et amici laetificant cor."PIt is too late for him to see it now, but I believe he may have been right."YAs a humble servant left in this world, I suppose I simply have faith that it is so,"iAnd that a moderate knowledge and practice of mixing might go the mile to brightening another's day."DELIAS: It is especially so, should that be the time of my Lord."ADRIENN: ...Ah,":You do know that \PN isn't actually an Arceus, right?")That was just a rumor Julia started."8\PN has even dealt with the actual Arceus by now..."8ELIAS: I am aware of both of these things, in fact."-But I ask, what difference does it make?"&For some, the Lord is in the sky."Others, in the heart."OFor an old man past his prime with little left but the time to find peace,"GI find the Lord in the bonds and triumphs shared in close company."IWe find God in our friends that we might have each other to cherish."JIt is here in these moments that we know we are not alone, sola fide."!What more can faith ask for?"0ADRIENN: An English translation, perhaps..."ELIAS: Ahah.".Quidquid Latine dictum sit altum videtur."*That is the way of things, after all."BWelcome to the Battle Pavilion and Battle Factory challenges."_The Battle Pavilion is a traditional Battle Tower style challenge using your own Pok√©mon,"lWhereas in the Battle Factory challenge you instead fight with a selection of randomly rented Pok√©mon."^In addition to this, random Field Effects may be optionally generated before each battle."mCompleting a 5 battle round in either challenge with Field Effects enabled will increase your BP reward."3Would you like to enable random Field Effects?",Random Field Effects have been enabled."-Random Field Effects have been disabled."#SHELLY: \PN, is it really you?"(You're back, safe and sound, truly?"Huh..."5Don't get me wrong-- I'm relieved you're back..."6But to be honest, I'm also a little disappointed."ZI heard that you'd fallen into a Darkrai's nightmare and it wouldn't let you wake up!"\And-- And I wanted, you know, since you had always been going around saving everyone..."`Um, I was thinking that, this time, maybe it would be nice if I could be your hero instead."_I've been going on a lot of Legendary hunts, hoping I'd eventually run into that Darkrai--"<...But if you're back, I guess it's already dealt with."9And that's what's most important-- that you're here."+I'm so glad you made it! Welcome back!"SHELLY: D-don't tell me..."#I heard about what happened..."1\PN... You were attacked by a Darkrai again?"+And-- and I still wasn't here to help!"@I suppose it's probably easier after you've done it once..."5B-but still! That's twice I've missed my chance!",And of course, twice you've been taken!"KI'm not sure why Darkrai keep coming after you, but they need to stop!"_Maybe-- maybe it was the same one? And now that you've caught it, it will leave you alone!"I hope so, anyway..."B-but don't worry, \PN!"8I know I missed the first two times, but I promise,"$Someday I'm going to be a hero."8I've gotten so much stronger, and so much braver..."&I'm going to keep helping people!"SHELLY: But, um--"Please do be careful."5A-and maybe... stay away from Darkrai out there."VJust in case it wasn't only the one, and more are angry with you for some reason."<Even if you can break out, nightmares aren't very nice."SHELLY: \PN?"9I was wondering-- did you really go and time travel?"`Heather wouldn't stop talking about it after she'd gone to ask Simon about what happened..."*Um, and I just had to ask for myself!"eI'd heard that you met Heather and her mom, and I was, um... wondering if-- if I was there, too?"5I-I mean, you don't have to tell me or anything!"1SHELLY: O-oh! You really met my future self?"What was the future like?"What was I like?"Did you have a nice time?"#SHELLY: No, no, don't tell me!"pI know the future of Reborn has to have been so bright thanks to you and everything you've done, after all!"1With all the Anomalies that are popping up--"DI know there'll be more that I can help out with in the future!";I know that you were able to see the future yourself--"VBut I want to find what's in my future on my own-- whatever it'll turn out to be!">SHELLY: I'm glad everything went okay out at Rhodochrine."HI-- I went over everything in the Underroot, just to be extra sure.".Everything seems to be back in order now!"=I'm sure that's thanks to everything you all did up top!"I'm so happy for Noel..."2I just wish I'd been able to do more to help."D-don't worry, though!"1I know there'll be more to do in the future!"3And I'll be the first one in line to help out!"SHELLY: Oh hi, \PN!"^Heather and I were just talking about helping with some more of those Anomalies in a bit."%I wonder what will turn up next!"4SHELLY: I wonder how that Kricketot is doing...""SHELLY: Don't worry about me.""I know what I have to do now.";I'll keep getting stronger, in battle and as a person."I owe it to myself."OSHELLY: I love helping out here, but it's not the easiest place to read..."(SHELLY: Thanks for being my friend!"#I'm so grateful to all of you."LIN: uh."hi?"ANNA: Hi, \PN!"Still on duty?"+Don't worry, I'm right there with you!"8Mr. Shadow and I are gonna have the region on lock!"T...Like, in a friendly, non-authoritarian not-at- all world-ending type of way!"Obviously!"Like, um--"7The other day we helped rescue this lost Lillipup!"@Did you know that Mr. Shadow secretly really likes puppies?"Don't tell anyone!"Except the puppies!"Do tell them."Tell all of them."sIt's nice to see you around here still, but you've totally gotta come with us to play in the toybox next time!"=You wouldn't believe what we found in one of the chests!"&It's totally gonna be a surprise.":Eeeeee, no just kidding, I can't keep it a surprise--"It was an entire"Inflatable"Jumping castle!"Just like Dad's!"But, um, bouncier!"And smaller."$And not really like his at all."	BUT,"sIt's still awesome and we're gonna see what happens if we surrounded it with those pink jumpy bubble thingies!"/It's gonna be-- what is it Charlotte says?"	Lit!"It's gonna be lit."9ANNA: Hey, so, what exactly happened to Lin anymore?"HI mean, I was asleep for so long, and now everything is so quiet..."DI heard what happened, but not exactly what happened, you know?"GIf I'm being honest, there's a part of me that kind of misses her?"CI mean, sure, she was responsible for nearly ending the world,"!Uncountable property damage,"%Ending who knows how many lives,"FAnd personally giving Laura at least three more severe phobias...",And I'm not saying any of that is okay,"\...But it feels wrong to not have to be at least a little bit on guard for her anymore."}Like when you're going down the stairs and there's one more step than you think there is and you have like a mini earthquake!"?I gotta just count how many stairs there are again, right?")That's how these things go, I guess."2Remind myself and take it one step at a time.":Thanks for taking care of everything until I woke up!"+I feel like I really dropped the ball,"But there was no gravity?"?So it just kinda floated away and became one with the sun,")And now I don't have a ball anymore."So that's kind of sad.":But now that I'm awake, I can just go buy a new ball!"2I don't know how that fits into the metaphor,"'But I'm sure that it does somehow!"&What were we talking about again?"(...Oh, I should get Lin a ball too!"Maybe three!"LThat way she can learn personal responsibility and also how to dribble!"IOnce again, don't think about the metaphor too hard, okay? It's shy."Just like her!"}She'll never show it, but I'm sure she really appreciates everything you've done in her own, twisted, rule-breaking way."(But don't tell her I told you that!">She'll probably replace my conditioner with silly string."9Actually, you can tell her; that sounds kinda funny!"ANNA: Keep smiling!"PIf you hold a smile for five minutes, you start to feel happy accidentally!"1It's like, muscle conditioning or something?"@Does the smile make the joy or does the joy make the smile?":ANNA: You gotta come by the castle one of these days!"KDad and Noel and I have been trying out a new three- way chess game..."WIt sucks, but it probably won't suck more if we deal you in and make it four ways!"ANNA: Hey, did you know?".Nostra's still watching over us even now.".She didn't tell me or anything this time."I just know it's true."QANNA: Okay, but it would be funny if, like, a Regirock spawned in this club,"CAnd everyone thought its UNUNUNUNUN was just part of the beat?"9I wonder how long it would take someone to notice..."LIN: Welcome, \PN."&ADRIENN: What are you doing here?"We've already--""\PN has already defeated you!"8LIN: You were quite generous to show that boy here."I thank you for that,""Since he, in turn, showed me."*ADRIENN: What are you talking about?!"PLIN: He is beyond incompetent, but his victim act must be quite compelling."7Everyone is so quick to give into crocodile tears,"EBut when they come to the jaws of the beast, they act surprised."DLIN: I think we'll be seeing each other a lot more from now on."&After all, we have the same goal."/LIN: All we have to do is get it from her."Candy from a baby."Flowers from a grave."Isn't that right?"#Welcome to the Battle Factory."3Would you like to fight in Singles or Doubles?"ÄFor the Battle Factory, you may choose to have one random field for the entire set, or a different random field for each battle."Which would you like?"9You'll get one random field effect for the full set."3You'll get one random field effect per battle." Congratulations on the win."HI will take your rental Pok√©mon back and return your own Pok√©mon."6We've been waiting for you. Please come this way."SSHADE: Fortune favors the forsaken, but few find the forsaken be such forever."SHADE: ..."NYU: Haihaihai, \PN!"cI heard they'd give me foodstuffs if I helped out here so I'm pretending to do work right now."'Hey, do you wanna go do it for me?"4I won't share my food but I will share my love."<NYU: Haihaihai, random person who just walked up to me!";We didn't meet in a different file or anything, right?"_My name is better left unsaid, but if you must know, I am Sir Elyvilon Nyunyunyu Esq. III."You can just call me Nyu~"wTechnically I created Reborn's PC server system-y stuff, but I prefer to think of myself as just a simple Pikachu.">Anyway you're here because you wanted to help out, right?"NYU: Oh, it's you again~""Did you bring food this time?"3Or did you just want to hear about the thingy?"GLately there have been some earthquakes in the Chrysolia region..."$Huh, didn't that happen before?"BWell, if it was a really big Pikachu that caused them before,";It's probably a really big Pikachu causing them again~"wSooooo we need someone to go down to Chrysolia Forest and poke around until we find what's causing them this time."II think someone said something about hearing train noises there too?"GBut maybe the Pikachu just got hungry and ate the train for lunch."1That can't be healthy... Trains are so oily."%Were we talking about something?".Oh, will you go find that Pikachu for me?"Super sweetness~"YIf you look for train crumbs in Chrysolia you'll probably find it eventually, maybe.")And remember, when in doubt: Eat it!"But I don't wanna..."KA really really big Pikachu ate a train somewhere in Chrysolia, maybe."<Maybe it also didn't eat it and just made train sounds?"%Or maybe the Pikachu is a train?"6Maybe it's just training to reach a higher level?"I don't remember..."Hey, do you smell muffins?"!Mmmm, mollycoddling muffins~"NYU: Haihaihai~"kRecently, there've been some reports of multiple Pikachu swimming underwater within Ametrine Mountain."EThey're probably not hurting anything there, but it's a Pikachu,"1So someone should probably go check on them~"One person already went..."+Um, what's her face, with the glasses~"bBut since there's more than one Pikachu, it probably makes sense to send more than one human!"D'you wanna go too?"3NYU: I'm sure you're in for a spicy adventure!"AIt'll be somewhere underwater in the greater Ametrine area--"CI think someone said something about looking for Ametrine B1F?"Probably?"Or maybe not.",Even Pikachu have to breathe sometimes."$NYU: Oh, well. That's fine too~"fNYU: There've been some reports of multiple Pikachu swimming underwater within Ametrine Mountain."Lso someone should probably go check on them~ One person already went..."=She'll probably be fine even if you take a while though!"LI'm sure even now, she's camped out, having a nice, tantalizing picnic,"7Featuring such delights as the boisterous biscuit!"!And serendipitous sammiches~"3Hey, hey, bring me back a sandwich, would you?"ERANDALL: Hang onto your knickers, partner-- we've got a big one."]Reports are saying that people were seeing one of those Animes up on the Wasteland Wall."IYou know, the one that divides Chrysolia and Byxbibsixthshypsixsion?"But get you this...")The 'Mon they said was in the Anime?"Mewtwo."'Yeah-- I didn't believe it either."SBut I think some folks are gonna be wantin' to jump on this Anime right quick."You one of 'em?""RANDALL: You got it, partner."@Get in there and show that Anime who's what and what's who!"0RANDALL: Leave it to the little people, eh?"eSure is generous of you to give the others a chance at an Anime as powerful as that one first..."URANDALL: There's were some reports of an Anime spotted up on the Wasteland Wall." Thems says it was a Mewtwo!"HThe wall is between Chrysolia and Byxbuxbaxbexbestbysinthewestsion."ÑBut just betwixt you, me, and the ol' ragged fencepost, I reckon you'd have an easier time gettin' up there from the Chrysolia side."=Done some exploring around there myself, don't you know?"Look hard on that one."Good luck, partner!"NYU: Haihaihai again, \PN~"5Today, I have a special invitation just for you!"JNo Pikachu today, but some of the others are having a special picnic!"BI don't remember their names, but it was a bunch of the kids!"*And they told me I should invite you~"0Like as a cherubic chaperone type of thing?"NYU: Sweetness~"_They said they were gonna try and find a good picnicketty spot over in Rhodochrine Jungle."Maybe near that tree?"I wish I could go too,"pBut I don't wanna intrude, and it's okay because secretly I'm hiding all my snacks behind this desk anyway."You have fun~"1NYU: Wait, you don't want to go on a picnic?"*Where you sit outside and eat things?"I don't understand?"9NYU: Some of the others are having a special picnic!"But why picnic near there?"1It's not like you could eat the tree, right?")It's not like a gellatinous juniper,"Or a crunchy confier,"!Or the splendiferous spruce."It's just a tree?"5Then again, you don't have to let that stop you."When in doubt, eat it!"INYU: So I heard that a Pikachu ate all the color from your picnic..."SI don't see this as a problem, but I guess we gotta protect the pretty colors."HSo anyway you need one 100% organic Zygarde to continue the picnic?"_I'm not here to judge anyone's dietary choices, but I don't think those cells cook well..."!Well, when in doubt, eat it!"ARC: And here he is!"The man of the hour!"ARC: And here she is!"The lady of the hour!"ARC: And here they are!"The savior of the hour!"ARC: \PN!!!!"Always knew you'd do it."uThere's no words enough to express our thanks, so instead the memories we make from here on out will have to do."\With the Champion back in our back pocket, there's no fight we can't both pick and win."'ARC: But there's a lot to explain."%Why don't you come on over here?"pARC: I'd ask where in the world you've been, but for better or worse, I've got a few guesses on the matter."&Lemme cut straight to the chase--"-Meteor's out, but the chaos is still in."fThe good news is that any grunts that weren't turned in turned over a new leaf, and the admins..."#Well, ain't none of them left."!Not even Lin, thanks to you."FAnyone who still had ties in the higher ranks is on our side now."0It's a total team KO if ever I've seen one."-The bad news is that the damage is done.">Their goal of opening the New World ultimately succeeded."HThanks to you, it didn't get so far as overwriting this one, but..."3To put it simply, they're starting to overlap."zThe unformed New World has been leaking into ours for quite some time now, causing this, that, and the other problem."mFor one thing, the energy from the New World has awoken new heights of potential in Pok√©mon everywhere."zWhere it was impossible to go above Level 100 before, Pok√©mon have been sighted growing to as high as Level 150 now."8Double the worlds, double the power-- or somethin'."+An' there's one other... complication."gYou know how there's supposed to be some Pok√©mon out there that there's only one of in the world?"Yeah, so... about that."Not... anymore."AIt seems like anything can appear or exist in the New World."Uh, so..."What I'm trying to say here is that yesterday fourteen Genesect fell out of the New World and were running amok on Main Street."[We already took care of them, so no need to worry about that, but-- you get the point."úAll sorts of Pok√©mon have appeared in all sorts of places, but Legendaries in particular, given their big power, tend to create problems when they show up."YFor instance, the TV station was totally trashed after a Zapdos spawned inside it..."cThose few seconds of the recording before it cut out were pretty incredible though, can't lie."eLots of the other leaders are already away hunting them and putting out Legendary-related fires."9If you're up to it, we can definitely use your help.">My bad for springin' this on you right when you get back."åAfter shit hit the fan, I decided I'd convert this place into a base of operations for dealing with these kinds of issues all over the city."sBy the old policy, only League Leaders and Champions would've been allowed in, but that was Ame's idea, and...",Well, this works out better now anyway."uThere's a lot of cool stuff in this place that might be worth checking out too, so by all means, take your time!"QWe've got an arena behind us that you can use to spar with the friendlies..."HThe Battle Pavilion's on your left-- free use for all trainers now."GNo end to the fights there, and you might see some familiar faces."eAnd finally, I rigged one of the dance floors into a pseudo-map of the region over on the right."xWe're using that to mark down where reports of New World Anomalies come in-- be it Legendaries or overlap points..."?So talk to the folks over there if you wanna help 'em out!"8Whatever you do, champ, it's good to have you back!"$Hit me up if you need anything!"ARC: Hey, Champ!"5What's this I hear about you capturing Meloetta?""Maaan, I wish I'd been there."ARC: ...")Hey, I know now's not the best time,"<But do you think sometime she'd want to do a show here?"-It'd liven up the place, and honestly..."=Collaborating with an artist like that would be a dream."2But after things have settled down, for sure."#Maybe float the idea past her?";In the meantime, keep up the good work as always, \PN."6ARC: Glad everything went well with the poachers.">I've got to admit, I wasn't so sure about this at first--"-Working with Pok√©mon poachers and all--"%But I'm glad it worked out well."I was surprised, actually."=They seem like a pretty good lot, all things considered."NA few of 'em have even been stopping by to battle it out at the Pavilion."DJust more proof that people can change for the better, I guess."[ARC: Man, when I offered to help out with the band, I wasn't expecting that to happen."Y...Even without the New World stuff, it's been a bit more than I expected, honestly."pThey're all working really hard, but between you and me, not one of those kids knows anything about mixing."It's been a lot."èI don't mind helping out, but... between running this place, organizing the Anomaly hunts, and the band, I feel like I'm in a bit over my head.";Maybe I'll see about trying to teach Hardy the basics."~He seems like a quick learner when it comes to music, and maybe if he picks up a few things I can stay more in the background."JStill be there to help out and all, but not have quite so much to do."7Ah... Sorry, \PN, I guess I was thinking out loud.".I'll talk to Hardy about it, don't worry."*You just focus on relaxing for a bit."Arce-- Uh."#Everyone knows you deserve it."1ARC: How've you been managing it all, Champ?"FSeems like you've been helpin' ou