hat place."=If it shows up again, make sure you fix it up real good."@ZERO: Can't say I blame you for not wanting in on this one."&Not that anyone else does, but..."...Yeah."EZERO: There are reports about power issues coming from the LCCC."3You'll need to go down there and check it out."]Personally, I feel like there's one obvious hotspot to check-- albeit an unpleasant one."/From the... Labradorra entrance, you know?"+ZERO: \PN, I'm glad you showed up now."XI don't know what's gotten into her all of a sudden, but Eve's getting ideas again."+She's trying to build the PULSE again."8And she's going on about finally making the cure..."?I don't think I gotta explain why I'm concerned right now."BFor obvious reasons, I don't wanna go anywhere near all that,"But I'm worried."4Do you think you could check in on them for me?"ZERO: A thousand thanks."|Eve told me she needs some particular ingredients for her theorized cure, so she's been looking for them in New World zones."7The latest one popped up in Seacrest's own garden."UI'm surprised the old coot didn't have a heart attack on the spot when he heard.".Guess there might still be time though..."cAnyway, Eve was just rushing off to that one when she mentioned having completed the redesign."Start there."And... maybe hurry."*ZERO: I can't say I don't understand."NYou might've been the best person for the job, but I'll ask someone else."I wonder who..."fZERO: Eve hurried off to a New World gate to find ingredients for her newest attempt at a cure..."VShe hauled off her latest device to the gate that spawned in Seacrest's garden..."0...Someone should probably go check on her.">ZERO: Unfortunately, there's still nothing on our radars."ZERO: ...Ah, hi again."%So, we've got a new situation..."9ZERO: ...Ah, hi. As usual, I'm glad you came around." I wanted to, uh, thank you."For helping Lumi."I heard it's going well..."That's good."-If anything happened to her or Eve, I..."#Well, I'm not sure who I'd be."...Uh, so anyway."!We've got a new situation...";...And that situation is the total lack of situations."$Everything's gone totally dark."lEither whatever's making the Anomalies has gone totally silent, or it's doing something to hide itself."TEither Lin's gone totally silent, or she's doing something to cover her tracks."ÅI'm not sure which I like the idea of better, but we haven't been able to detect a single Anomaly since the last round of things."5...Anyway, sorry, I don't have anything for you."Not for now."XWe had one small blip of something over at the meteor site, where you found Deoxys."ëBut we didn't find anything else there when we sent someone to Citrine to check, and it's unlikely something would reappear there so soon anyway."kMaybe something will change if we wait long enough, but for now we're either grounded or flying blind."1Hunting Lin down is just gonna have to wait."+ADRIENN: There's my favorite Champion!"AI didn't get much of a chance before, with everything, but--"0I wanted to find a minute to say thank you."2You're truly a Champion, through and through."2But of course, I always knew you could do it!"fI'm not sure how much I'll be able to stick around here, what with everything at the Grand Hall--"5The amount of paperwork has been astronomical..."-But I'll stop by whenever I can to help."CAnd you're always more than welcome to drop by the Grand Hall!"3I'm sure the Vulpix will love to see you, too!"4ADRIENN: Let's visit that place again sometime."(With the stars and all the pools..."It was quite incredible."$That feeling of timelessness..."#I have it only in my memories."I miss it so much."3And if there were anyone to indulge it with..."5ADRIENN: You're the hero of the day, once again.")I truly can't thank you enough, \PN."SThe train robbery was a... volatile situation, and you handled it wonderfully."iI suppose it's probably too much to hope for, that that Corin-Rouge fellow has learned his lesson..."0But I believe I'll hope for it nonetheless."VHe seemed to have good intentions, after all... just let things go a bit too far."+And thankfully, no one was badly hurt."eWe really should work on trying to figure out a solution to the water problem out in Train Town."0Just another thing to look into, I suppose."-Oh, but don't you worry about that, \PN."6I'll let you know if there's anything you can do,"7But in the meantime, please take care of yourself."QAnd let's hope that little troublemaking Pok√©mon is through with that, too."4We don't want things going missing around here!"'Enough things get lost as it is...".ADRIENN: You know, I can't help thinking."EWhile the circumstances might not be ideal-- look at this place."=All these people working together, making things better."It's inspiring, isn't it?"-Reborn's future really does look bright."*ADRIENN: Whatever you need, Champion."0If it's within my power, just say the word."9ADRIENN: I can't say this is my kind of environment."(The people, sure-- but the place..."It's... novel?"6ADRIENN: Let's have a rematch sometime, Champion."'We are all bettered by each other.")ADRIENN: How can I help you, friend?""Or were you just checking in?"LLUMI: From the sounds of it, you've been helping out a lot around here!"+I know everyone really appreciates it."HLUMI: Actually, there was something I was hoping to ask about that!"`I heard some people talking about Articuno, Zapdos and Moltres being sighted around Reborn!"Have you seen them?"LUMI: That's amazing!"$LUMI: Oh... I guess I misheard."]I've always loved stories about them- especially Articuno. It's so graceful and elegant!"2I'd really love to see it for myself someday."}\PN, if you ever manage to make friends with Articuno, do you think you could bring it here? I'd really love to meet it!"GLUMI: Now that we've come this far, I'm starting to have thoughts!"Dangerous thoughts!"FThoughts like, what kind of things do I want to do in the future?"MBefore I always kinda held myself back from thinking about those things."9Because, 