oal's help."(Normally we got another job, but..."5With crime on the fall, work's been a bit short."BA man's gotta do what he can, so I'd appreciate your pennies."$INSPECTOR: Don't be a stranger.;[" Torkoal huffs smoke at you."INSPECTOR: Howdy again."Need any of this?"INSPECTOR: Howdy."%Feel free to browse what we got."FEverything you see here is handmade with my buddy Torkoal's help."(Normally we got another job, but..."5With crime on the fall, work's been a bit short."BA man's gotta do what he can, so I'd appreciate your pennies."$INSPECTOR: Don't be a stranger.Iu;␀4[[y"Locked."#LUNA: Hello, \PN, and welcome."2We last parted ways not far from here before,"6Though it looked much different then, did it not?",Nothing can refuse the tides of change,"!Not even nothingness itself."eTo you, I am eternally indebted for preventing Lin from overwriting our world with this new one."But you must understand,"DThat I am also indebted to Lin for making this dream a reality."_I have always said that the beauty of darkness lies in its infinite potential, have I not?"7One never knows just what lies beyond arm's reach,"/Whether it is the warm embrace of a lover,"Or the maw of a demon."Here, both exist."2I believe there can be no finer edge to walk.""No finer pleasure to savor..."But I dally."4You are here for business rather than pleasure."Noel and Mother..."Anna, Noel and Mother..."!Rest assured, they are safe."Asleep, but safe."HAfter all, even the worst nightmare is safer than the waking world."%Still, is it not time they rose?"4As ever, \PN, the way forward is yours to take.":LUNA: As ever, \PN, the way forward is yours to take."jLUNA: One day, this germinal world will produce visions and landscapes far surpassing any among ours."kBut like an artist who's only just taken to the brush, what it can create right now is rather limited."oOver time, as it too grows with experience and history, its productions will become more and more complex,"ÑWith mountains as melodies and moments as motifs, each stroke it makes plays over each other as if building up to a melodious canon."ZI can only hope that I will still be around to hear its performance at its crescendo."(For now, it is no such grand thing,"WBut more like two songs played over each other, each vying for its listener's ear.";You will find our world twisted together alongside it."FIn particular, it seems to have tangled up in my Master's estate."Look there."=LUNA: It is still possible to step into our world there."LPockets of that world have been isolated behind and among this reality."{It is how what should have been an ordinary trip to explore Master's castle ended up with each of them stuck in this realm."KBut that does not mean those pockets line up to what we see perfectly."NIf a door is locked, it may as well be as if nothing is behind it at all."3And in this case, that is very well the truth."CLike a lamp with no bulb, what we seek simply isn't there yet."LUNA: Fear not."qIn a world as unstable as this, I have no doubt that there is a way for us to connect the dots, so to speak."`Let us search and find what belongs behind each door, so that it may put itself into place."fLUNA: Let us search and find what belongs behind each door, so that it may put itself into place."NLUNA: With this, two ends of our worlds have been stitched to each other."pIt is perhaps unsurprising that the needle required for such a thing would have been left about this place."nI suspect that Lin may have intended the New World to serve as a sort of playground or toy box for her..."MAnd what a dangerous toy that is, isn't it, able to sew worlds together?")It is just to her liking, I imagine.",Nevertheless, there will be others now."*Let us hope that they can be reached."lLUNA: Needles may be dangerous, but I am not of the opinion that we should withhold them from children."NAfter all, it is only through experience that one will learn proper care."!LUNA: You saw Noel, did you?"EWorry not. I'm 