"smeargle help"""but smeargle not battle"""draw only"""human word ????"""secrteary ???"""smeargle human secrteary"""smeargle go human go"""goodbye human"""secrteary later""$Shinx is trapped in the cage..."OAll right, little guy, you just stay put until the real prize comes out..."Wait, who are you?!"#You're not too bad in a fight!"One down just like that?!"2It didn't have to damage the cage so badly..."Ugh..."'So the boss wants us to fall back?"_I'll trust you for now, but if it turns out you're lying, I'll haunt your dreams at night."=...Relax, they told me they were going to look for help."2I just didn't expect someone as frail as you."6But I already lost, twice over, so I'll head out.">If you're rounding up the others, be careful with Atreus." He can be a bit of a flirt."hYou'll find him over on that big ruin monument thing in the middle of the place, you can't miss it."ZJust go up four flights of stairs, down one flight and go to the farthest right side."vFor some reason someone graffitied those ruins with numbers and bright paint. Baby's first graffiti I'm guessing.";I guess you've got the client to deal with still, huh."?Said she'd wait for us to corral it towards the northeast.".Good luck on that one-- I don't envy you."$How did I only find a Geodude?!"pI was supposed to find some cute, defenseless Electric Type, and well, this was technically one of those..."But a Geodude?"6What kind of Pok√©mon am I gonna trap with that?!"EOh! I guess I might as well stop you from going any further too!")Defeat is lonely and hard to bear...""Darn, the prize was too fast!"Or was I too slow...?"That's three strikes, huh?")Wait, didn't you find Margo already?"!She was right near the exit!"JThe client isn't gonna be very happy about you coming, but oh well..."2She's somewhere northeast of here... I think."!I'm sure you'll lose anyway!"9After all, what is victory, but a goal out of reach?"RI'll head back-- I know the way, don't worry-- so just forget about me, okay?"#Lay down under my boot, beast!"???: Not so tough now, hm?"o???: If this was all it took for you to capitulate, you should've saved us the trouble in the first place."???: Oh, what the hell?"9I hired those grunts to do just a few simple tasks--"ELure the Pok√©mon here, weaken it a bit, and to keep pests away."How hard is that?"2I should've known not to hire scum from Orre."éBut those fools were the first team available, and with all the reports of Legendaries popping up in this region, I couldn't afford to wait..."'You get what you pay for, I guess."SNothing more can be expected from these bottom-of- the-bargain-bin foreigners."bBut once I have this Pok√©mon-- a Mythical like this valued for its speed and attack power..."7It'll be worth millions! And a powerhouse to boot."4Notice it's not zipping around now like before."It's because it knows."cIn the face of true power-- born leadership and control like mine-- any Pok√©mon would submit!"OIt's only natural, after all-- a Pok√©mon like this suits someone like me.",Mythical-- a class above everyone else!"RA lowborn such as yourself wouldn't understand, even if you are the Champion."Yes, I know."_But then, being the Champion, surely you must have some pretty valuable Pok√©mon yourself."This is my lucky day!"Enough!"#SHANNON: Ugh! To hell with it!"CI'm cutting my losses... I hope this beast rips you to pieces!"Zeraora is badly injured."6ARC: All right, step aside. Medic coming through."bARC: Medic might be a strong word-- but let's see if we can't jump start Zeraora's batteries."+Jolteon, put that Volt Absorb to work!".BRESLIN: Shame that wouldn't work on Ein."LARC: No need for sparks-- some TLC and time off and he'll be just fine."NBRESLIN: The rest of the crew's safe and extracted thanks to you as well."HARC: We saw that woman tumbling face-first into the woods just now."OSeems like she lives at the crossroads between inelegance and catastrophe.".BRESLIN: Bit of an understatement, there."4My team and I really appreciate your help, \PN."cWe've also been talking since this all started, and we're thinking about rebranding ourselves."#Something like noble poachers,"?Stealin' from those who want to cage and abuse Pok√©mon..."2Nothing's set in stone yet, but it's an idea.")ARC: A better direction, to be sure."/BRESLIN: I'll let you know what we decide."=Maybe stop by that Nightclub of yours from time to time."9Heard it's fancy-- maybe even a good place to train."0Especially if the Champion might be around.".For now, I'll leave you two to the catch.".We've no business with it anymore anyway."Good luck!")ARC: Well, someone's feeling better."ZERAORA: Ora!"8ARC: ...And it sounds like it wants to go with you."9I guess you earned its respect in that whole ordeal."gJust as well-- it's likely safer with you than staying wild and a potential target for that woman."ZERAORA: Zerrra!"ARC: That okay with you?"ZERAORA: Razza!!")ARC: What, you really don't want it?"GCan't say I understand it, but I'll respect your decision in turn."You sure about that?"-ARC: All right, if that's what you want."CIn that case, Zeraora, you mind tagging along with me instead?"HI'll keep you safe and sound just the same, sure as the sun shines."ARC: Thought as much."It's all yours, then."*ARC: Sounds like that's a wrap, then."-Thanks for tuning into this one with me."#I think we did some good here."0You ready to head back to the club already?"#ARC: Roger that; let's be off."$ARC: Then it's 'till next time."$Pichu is trapped in the cage..."&Geodude is trapped in the cage..."4Capture the weak ones to lure out the strong..."$Now we just gotta wait for it--"+Oh, right, gotta try and stop you too!"VAll right, you win for now... I was going easy on you anyway, 'cause you're cute."#Man, that speed is incredible!"Strong, too--"<It rescued the Pok√©mon in an instant just like that...">Well, I guess there's nothing to do but head on out, huh?"1You've still got some work to do, don't you?"!Go easy on Willow, will you?"'She's kinda in a slump these days."oSee that broken bridge directly across from here? She's on the other side. Someone should really fix that."iI'm pretty sure the number one cause of injuries is people falling over broken ancient ruin bridges."=The client's probably still waiting somewhere northeast.""She's a beauty-- and a brute."See ya!"0FERN: Ugh, get back here, you stupid pixie!"FERN: Now I've got you!"wIf you were just going to get cornered anyway, you may as well have saved me the trouble and not bothered running!"MEW: Mew?"FERN: Don't you mew at me!"AI've had enough of being embarrassed by you and your antics!"MEW: Mewmewmew~""FERN: That's it! You're mine!"%FERN: Don't even think about it!".FERN: That's right, just let it happen..."MEW: Mew!"FERN: Ugh, not again..."Get back here already!" FERN: Ugh... That one hurt."..."FERN: Hey, uh... \PN.""I think I'm locked in here..."<Do you, uh... mind coming down here and letting me out?"=FERN: Could you... maybe, come down here and let me out?"3There's probably a switch by or on the door..."There must be, right?"/CAL: Well, let's go ahead and get started."JNow that we've settled on a site, we'll each do proper introductions."8Afterwards we can get the tents up and take a rest."[Let's each of us begin by saying who we are, and what we hope to get out of this week."hFor my part, I'm someone who's just learning to take the first true steps towards agency and peace."pI've got a lot of self-discovery left to do, which is why I'm grateful, not just for the chance to be here,"fBut for the chance to lead this trip, and have some of my closest friends alongside me during it."yI hope that by the end of this week, I have a clearer picture of myself disconnected from the recent chaotic events,"ÇAnd that I will have earned the genuine trust and vulnerability of each of you, both as an individual and a leader in the Academy."7LETTIE: I still can't believe Victoria picked YOU."HCAL: I can hardly believe it myself, so I understand your concerns."îBut despite-- or, perhaps because of-- my past, I have the sincere belief that I can give my all to Apophyll Academy and live up to the opportunity."$Now, who would like to go next?"PRESTON: Sure, I'll go."cMy name's Preston, and I'm hoping to just have a nice week out in nature and unwind for a bit."CAL: And who are you?"0PRESTON: I... just said, my name's Preston."'CAL: I'm not asking for your name."Who are you?"PRESTON: Uhh..."VWell, I work as a system manager for a presevation initiative on Azurine Island--")CAL: Is your profession who you are?"PRESTON: I--"(Man, what do you want from me here?"SCAL: I apologize if I'm coming on strong here, but you've fallen for the trap.","System manager" may be your job title."OBut-- and you can answer 'yes' to this, if you'd like-- is it who you are?"+Who you want to represent yourself as?"íOr is it just a summative label of how you spend your time under the notion that one's profession is the thing most people want to know about you?"PRESTON: I, uh..."Well, shit."5CAL: Take your time. It is not an easy question."}But if we can't be faithful to ourselves in how we represent ourselves, how can we hope for anyone else to see us faithfully?"The work begins now."ESHELLY: Sorry that took so long! I got the rest of the firewood!"CARC: Looks like I pulled ahead of you somewhere along the way."Ein is safe, no sweat."\Breslin's taking care of him, and I'll be popping back to check on them in short order."EJust thought I'd take a brief survey of how things are out here."&The rest of their team isn't far."EThey've scattered through this area caging 'Mons left and right."Downright deplorable."It's all you, \PN."*I'm on support if you need a tune-up."ARC: Let me brush you up."Not a problem for me."6Got plenty of experience taking care of my folks."Let me see the squad."/Seems like I'm only on nursing duty today."ARC: Up and at 'em, champ."0Ah, a seasoned Trainer! Up for a challenge?"6Impressive! Perhaps we'll meet again somewhere..."?We both have our own aspirations to chase after, don't we?"%You look like a time and a half!"'Maybe even two times at this rate!" Stay safe out here, friend."9Not many get to travel this far off the beaten road."Yes"No0Iu;␀Ä[["
