tuation does not escalate, and to further study potential solutions once the guardian is obtained."†...And also, if we are attempting to acknowledge and express our emotions, I would be remiss in not including the fact that I am deeply worried about them both."/JULIA: Hey Rini, do you need a ride back?!"!FLORINIA: I beg your pardon?"JULIA: Off that island?"7Cuz like, I can paddle over there and pick you up."-FLORINIA: ...That will not be necessary.":JULIA: Oh! Right, you didn't want \PN to know, right?"pIt's not like she has Water Types on her, so that's actually how she got to that island in the first place."%Just floatin' over here with me."9But she faded the screen out so you wouldn't notice."$Cuz that would be embarrassing."FLORINIA: ...Julia."%There is no need for tall tales."-JULIA: It's actually a pretty short one!"Only like three sentences?"[Anyway if you're all good, there's another waterfall over there-- I'm gonna hit it up!"'FLORINIA: ...Anyway, the Rayquaza."yFLORINIA: In order to free Amaria and Titania from the grasp of the orbs' power, we will require a neutral guardian."Namely, a Rayquaza."TUntil it is obtained, I will remain here to monitor and preserve the situation."...Or rather, my friends.""FLORINIA: So you've returned."kWere you successful in procuring a Rayquaza to act as a neutralizing agent against the Orbs' energies?"*FLORINIA: ...Ah, so you did find one."That is... a relief."mI had begun to worry that counting on the arrival of one would qualify as a statistical improbability..."0...But perhaps luck was simply on our side."Let's waste no more time."IWould you care to correct your party in the likely case of conflict?"FLORINIA: Let's begin." FLORINIA: As you will then."dFLORINIA: Sending it out should be sufficient, but expect additional conflict after deployment."xI expect that the possessed subjects will not react kindly to any force that breaks the Orbs' connection over them."bThis speaker will remain from engaging in order to better monitor the specific factors and..."
