 with you, little miss wet blanket."7don't think i forgot about you trying to drown me."two can play at that game."{as if your entire gym wasn't already insufferable enough already, don't even get me started on your whiny personality."_boo hoo, you're knowingly keeping your girlfriend in a toxic relationship, woe is you?????"get out of here with that!"1let's start with our resident serial killer."<it was fun playing with you at your gym, but seriously?"5could you maybe stand to stab a FEW less people?"Mpretty sure even seven-year-olds know violence doesn't solve everything!"consider anger management."or therapy."4or maybe a nice, cool, relaxing drink of water!"<ANNA: ...hm, i wonder if she can swim in her condition?"7didn't expect the pokemon to just take off though."CANNA: admittedly i didn't expect the pokemon to just take off."6well, you can clean up the rest of your own mess.",clearly you're more than capable of it."ULIN: ...well, i wasn't expecting that thing to just dip, but that works i guess."feeling better already!"Blet's not think too much about if she can swim in that state."6FLORINIA: I don't... understand what's going on--"But will she be okay?"I--"/I can't swim, but-- can't we do something?"ÖANNA: those are some interesting words for someone who's working with the person responsible for everything bad that's happened here!"'now you're going to asX for help??"Vi've been tryXng to get everyone allied against lin since befXre any of you met!!"and here Xou are!"Si know ignorance is blXss, but you still have to deal with the rude XwakenXnX!"+frXnXly, i XXhoXXdn'X XvXn XXXX XXXXX!"<X XXXXX XX XXXX XXXXXX XX XXXXXX XXXX XXX XXXX XX XXX--""LIN: nah don't worry about it"#anyway, we got this from here."-imma kick back. this should be more fun!"8FLORINIA: It seems this isn't over yet after all..."sI may not be able to help properly, but at least allow me to restore your surviving Pok√©mon to full health...""TITANIA: KDKDSXG XXX TSCGG!!!"QuicXXLy-- DeFea