A: The patient appears to be wholely consumed by a new syndrome."pHer pupils have dilated, and she appears to need to lean forward at all times as if pulled in by something."~The patient reports single-minded purposeness-- a proclivity to dedicate herself entirely to and be possessed of a given task."üMost regrettably, the specifics of said task seem to be out of her control-- or else this affliction might have been a fortuitous development for productivity."FLORINIA: ...Indeed?"5The patient has been diagnosed with "Passion"..."A double-edged sword."ûOn one hand, even whimsically applied to the random subjects which this "Passion" seems to append itself to, it can prove a useful tool in many circumstances."òStatistics indicate that following "Passion" may result in an overwhelmingly significant number of benefits, ranging from production to personal health."_However, it would be more ideal were a different individual afflicted with this "Passion"."JFor this subject in particular to have developed it is a severe risk."1We shall consider the safest way to proceed."!-I have achieved confusion!-"`-She finally unlocked some positive emotions, but she doesn't seem happy about it at all!?-"-How could this be!?-"-You're almost there!-"-Give her the final push!-",FLORINIA: The logical fallacy inherent:"lDue to the subject's "Fear", she decided to repress various other emotional afflictions within herself."[However, the presence of "Fear" in and of itself belies one more, deeper, base desire."§An effective mechanism for survival, to be sure-- but where emotions are all, themselves, tools for survival, the suppression of them remains veritably maladaptive."ºIt is thus reasoned that the priority granted to "Fear" which permitted it to supercede all others and thus dissociate them from the subject must not have been a simple matter of survival."IGiven the circumstances, perhaps a social pressure or need instead--"But that would be..."FLORINIA: ...""Love.""FAll of this-- everything was hidden because this subject wanted--"B-because I wanted--"To be loved."4Not in the twisted way that Amy asked of Tania."!I didn't want that from her."I just wanted us--"All of us--"!To stay together as friends."Acceptance,"Belonging,"That kind of love."/It was always feelings getting in the way."Amy's depression."Tania's resentment."MJulie's... whatever it is that makes her drawn exclusively to disasters."My weakness."NI thought if-- I wasn't letting myself get so pulled down by my emotions,")If I hadn't burned Tania with them--"DAnd I knew it was a burden, but what else was I supposed to do?"0Maybe everything could have been all right." In hindsight, it was naive." It would never have worked."Tania's burden was Amy."JI didn't help, but it wasn't me who pushed her to the breaking point."#And I chose to internalize it."ZMaybe it was easier to internalize it than to accept that the situation was helpless."ÉControl groups exist specifically to dissolve illusions of false control, but we don't have that luxury for our own social circles."xIn the end I cut off my emotions-- the things that told me I should want to feel love-- for the sake of earning it."A devil's deal."It was stupid."It was so, so stupid..."FLORINIA: I should go." I have to process all this."[I feel guilt that you've been drawn into my emotional conflicts for this long already,"5But relief that I've at least acknowledged them."-Maybe doing so is all that is necessary."Farewell for now."FLORINIA: And thank you."WThough I would prefer it if you didn't share what happened here with the others...":It will probably be important for me to do so myself."-You have done it!-""-And now Latios is here too!-"LATIOS: Tioooooo~!"SLATIAS: -Thank you for going along with our game and helping the other human!-"0-To be honest, Latios was never corrupted!-"G-We were just playing a trick to encourage you to help that girl!-"h-Being trapped in those energy fields, what you call Anomalies, is kind of like living in a dream!-"-But we couldn't wake up!-"R-After you freed us from them, we felt a deep disturbance within that human!-"3-So as thanks, we wanted to free her as well!-"q-With my emotional senses, Latios's illusions, and you to talk her through it, I think she'll be just fine!-"LATIOS: Laaio~"5LATIAS: -We'll be happy to go with you now too!-" -Let's go on an adventure!-""FLORINIA: ...No, perhaps not."*It may yet be better not to go there."B-After we leave this place, my telepathy won't work anymore!-"f-It's sad, but you'll just have to trust in your heart of hearts that I'm always supporting you!-"-Let's go!-"#Latias wants to come with you."Accept Latias?"LATIAS: -Huh?-"#-There's no need to hesitate!-"\-If you're worried about not being able to hear me anymore, just look into your heart!-"i-If you listen closely to your feelings, I'm sure you'll always be able to understand what I'd say!-"LATIOS: Lio!"#Latios wants to come with you."Accept Latios?"LATIOS: Lo?"ANNA: Hi \PN!"Did you have a good time?"wI realized that just because things I do have unintended consequences, that doesn't mean the consequences are bad!"3This is kinda fun once you get the hang of it!"#Besides, I've been thinking..."Are we sure Lin's gone?"wIt's not like her to just lose and... well, accept it. There's always been some other game, or plan, or something.""She already had the one doll."Maybe she has a second!"GThat would explain all of the bad things that have been happening."Stay on your toes, okay?"!LIN: well, wasn't that nice?"9everyone's getting their own little therapy session."9and you know this wouldn't have happened without me."9would it really hurt you to show a little gratitude?"say thank you."LIN: ..."	wow."	wow!"'always the contrarian, aren't you."?you should get checked for oppositional defiance disorder."Rit's what adults say you get sick with when you don't do everything they say."and you're terminal."(are you feeling clever for that????