: Who'd have thought that letting you all run...">I mean, basically just disaster response, out of my club,"Would lead to all of this."@Sorry you ended up getting flung through time for all that,"/Hope it wasn't too long for you, at least."CI'm sure you'll do a great job with it when you get back, too."EOh, and watch out for some of the Legendaries when you get back."<I heard that dealing with a few of them got real weird." CAIN: Well, hey there, you~".Miss me so much you wanted to chat again?"EI can't blame you, hard to look away from someone as cute as me."!Y'know, I really missed you."4Shelly is a great person, and a great Champion."HMaybe even better than you would've been? I'll probably never know."?...But you were my friend, and you were there for so much.">You can hardly blame me for wishing you were still about."=Now you're here again, I guess all there is to say is..."^I hope your next ten years are as happy and fun as the last ten years were for all of us."Give 'em hell, \PN."RMake sure everyone knows that the day you got your starter at the Grand Hall?"HA truly magnificent trainer started their journey in Reborn proper."....I guess you and Victoria did too, huh?"5...Joking aside again, I'm sure you'll do great."Good luck out there."CAIN: Hey hey hey~"-Here I am talking to my favorite sister."0And my favorite time travelers show up too?"$Is today my lucky day, or what?"BAYA: Cain, everything's a favorite when you're that specific."CAIN: That's the point."3It's about letting everyone share in the love~"AYA: Hey \PN, hey Taka."$Good to see you both back safe."TAKA: Cain, Aya... Hey."-You both look well, nice to see you too."/CAIN: Well doesn't even begin to cover it!"AYou're talking to one of the region's most famous musicians."IAs well as her charming, brilliant, and all around very hot brother."!AYA: Modest as always, Cain.";But yeah, mine and Hardy's band is doing pretty great."DGotta be doing something right if I've got so many fans, right?"RI mea