 weirder when you go back to your time and look at everyone, knowing how we'll turn out."+Well, how we might turn out, at least.",Maybe your presence will change things?"cI know you made a difference to my life when you were here, so maybe you'll continue to do so."3Hey, but whenever our band starts getting big?"*You better buy tickets to every show."cMaybe one extra dedicated fan will help me get comfortable with it all even faster than I did."(And thanks for coming back, really."Cain really missed you."We all did."5Even if it's only brief, it's lovely to see you."BENNETT: \PN, hello."*Shelly always said you would be back.""And I tend to trust her word."Whether it's about the New World, Legendary Pok√©mon, or anything else really, she tends to know what she's talking about.".But you'd probably expect me to say that."BI've never met a Bug Type specialist I didn't get along with."=...Well, except that cop or whatever he was from Aevium."XI swear, you try to buy parts to repair your Genesect's cannon one singular time..."5And a lot of people start getting very agitated."RI can't even buy fertilizer for the plants anymore; Laura has to handle that!"BENNETT: ...Apologies."But I digress,"mThat little incident aside, my life has been remarkably peaceful since moving into the manor with Laura."jIt's nice that we are near enough Spinel, that it's easy for both our families to visit if they want."3...Although I'm quite content, visitors or no."8Laura's company is already so wonderful, after all."CLAURA: \PN, Elias, how delightful of you to come and greet us."BLAURA: \PN, Taka, how delightful of you to come and greet us."3Amaria was just seeking some of our expertise,",But we can all say hello while we help."6BENNETT: I'm glad you're both safe, welcome back."@AMARIA: Hi again, I'd love to chat more once I'm done here!"TAKA: Hey again, everyone."Uh, you all look well."!LAURA: I certainly think so!"Bennett and myself take care of numerous plants and insects, and I find