Azzie"Let's just battle!"No thanks.;[Y""By entering this room you hereby acknowledge that anything you see, hear, observe, experience, or vividly imagine as if it were unmistakably more real than the mutual delusion it must have been in these premises is not and cannot legally be held accountable for being canon."")A note below a row of broken clocks:"""How to make peace with time""#"Graveyard of Past Developers"""Kanaya,"/I still hope you're doing well out there.""E"You might never know how much of everything you've done for me,">As much as I'll try to find the words to express as such.">Maybe I'll never be able to do so fully, and that's okay."QBut I hope that one day I'm able to return the favor and thank you properly."(Wait for me in the starlight, too?"""Missed connections:"KOn the release day of Pok√©mon Gold and Silver, back in the year 2000,"bYou were just about to check out from the retail store with the last physical copy of Silver."HA kid appeared in line behind you, also looking for Silver version."OYou gave the kid your copy, and stepped out of line to get it another day."!You specified one condition:"IThat if they were ever in your position, they should pay it forward."_...Well, that never happened, and digital distribution is a thing so I doubt it ever will."9Hopefully you'll accept this game as payment enough?"Thanks for that."""T.D.R.,"/Well it took me a few years, but I did it."8If you happen to see this, maybe say 'hi' sometime."Max mark?"""starrynight,"8If you're still out there and kicking, let us know.":You disappeared so suddenly we were kind of worried."""Riku," I wish it had gone better.""AA collection of notes for what looks to be a future project.""Starlight Divide""ÅIf you look carefully, you can see the notes for a half dozen other prospective future projects hidden and scattered behind them."#None of them are intelligible."VIf only whoever wrote them ever had either enough time or the sense to chill out.""The Archivist"""Kurotsune""You feel a presence..."Face it head on?"Fantastic! Bye."1You suddenly felt as if you had gained a BP."*You felt that you now had \v[593] BP."
