mage from special attacks for five turns."dEnables the user to evade all attacks. Its chance of failing rises if it is used in succession."sSummons a heavy rain for five turns, powering up Water-type moves while lowering the power of Fire-type moves."bThe user lands and rests their body. It restores the user's HP by up to half of their max HP."XThe user creates a protective field that prevents status conditions for five turns."VThis full-power attack grows more powerful the less the user likes their Trainer."bIn this two-turn attack, the user gathers light, then blasts a bundled beam on the next turn."qThe user throws a stone or a similar projectile to attack. Flying Pok√©mon will fall to the ground when hit."gA strong electric blast crashes down on the target. This may also leave the target with paralysis."tA wicked thunderbolt is dropped on the target to inflict damage. This may also leave the target with paralysis."MThe user sets off an earthquake that strikes every Pok√©mon around them."VThis full-power attack grows more powerful the more the user likes their Trainer."jThe user drains the target's blood. The user's HP is restored by half the damage taken by the target."dThe target is hit by a strong telekinetic force. This may also lower the target's Sp. Def stat."`The user hurls a shadowy blob at the target. This may also lower the target's Sp. Def stat."fThe user attacks with a swift chop. It can also break barriers, such as Light Screen and Reflect."\By moving rapidly, the user makes illusory copies of itself to raise their Evasiveness."^A wondrous wall of light is put up to reduce damage from physical attacks for five turns."bThe user strikes everything around them by swamping the area. This may also poison those hit."fThe target is scorched with an intense blast of fire. This may also leave the target with a burn."PUnsanitary sludge is hurled at the target. This may also poison the target."iA five-turn sandstorm is summoned to hurt all combatants except the Rock-, Ground-, and Steel-types."oThe target is attacked with an intense blast of all-consuming fire. This may leave the target with a burn."lBoulders are hurled at the target. This also lowers the target's Speed stat by preventing its movement."VThe user confounds the target with speed, then slashes. This attack never misses."iThe user torments and enrages the target, making it incapable of using the same move twice in a row."VThis attack move doubles its power if the user is poisoned, burned, or paralyzed."tCloaking themselves in flame, the user attacks. Then, building up more power, the user raises their Speed stat."mThe user goes to sleep for two turns. This fully restores the user's HP and heals any status conditions."gIf it is the opposite gender of the user, the target becomes infatuated and less likely to attack."lThe user attacks and steals the target's held item. The user can't steal it if already holding an item."^The user makes a swift attack on the target's legs, which lowers the target's Speed stat."oThe user attacks the target with a song. Others can join in the Round to increase the power of the attack."pThe user attacks the target with an echoing voice. If this move is used every turn, its power is increased."kThe user attacks the target at full power. The attack's recoil harshly lowers the user's Sp. Atk stat."XThe target is hit with wings of steel. This may also raise the user's Defense stat."tThe user heightens their mental focus and unleashes their power. This may also lower the target's Sp. Def stat."pThe user draws power from nature and fires it at the target. This may also lower the target's Sp. Def stat."gA restrained attack that prevents the target from fainting. The target is left with at least 1 HP."cThe user shoots boiling hot water at their target. This may also leave the target with a burn."oThe user flings their held item at the target to attack. This move's power and effects depend on the item."rThe user attacks with an electric charge. The user may use remaining electricity to raise their Sp. Atk stat."pThe target is taken into the sky, then dropped on the next turn. The target cannot attack while in the sky."cThe user swings their body around violently to inflict damage on everything in their vicinity."?The user suppresses the target and makes its move go last."TThe user shoots a sinister, bluish-white flame at the target to inflict a burn."qThe user nimbly strikes the target. If the user is not holding an item, this attack inflicts massive damage."uThis move prevents both the target from using a held item and its Trainer from using items on it for five turns."kThe user attacks everything around themselves by causing a tremendous explosion. The user then faints."ZThe user slashes with a sharp claw made from shadows. Critical hits land more easily."rThe user stores power, then attacks. If the user moves after the target, this attack's power will be doubled."KThe user stabs the target with a sharp horn. This attack never misses."iThe user charges at the target using every bit of their power. The user can't move on the next turn."XThe user polishes their body to reduce drag. This can sharply raise the Speed stat."sThe user flashes a bright light that cuts the target's Accuracy. It can also be used to illuminate dark caves."`The user stabs the target from below with sharpened stones. Critical hits land more easily."gAfter making their attack, the user rushes back to switch places with a party Pok√©mon in waiting."LThe user launches a weak jolt of electricity that paralyzes the target."pThe user attacks with a high-speed spin. The slower the user compared to the target, the greater the power."`A frenetic dance to uplift the fighting spirit. This sharply raises the user's Attack stat."hWhile resisting, the user attacks the opposing Pok√©mon. This lowers the Sp. Atk stat of those hit."TThe user hypnotizes themselves into copying any stat change made by the target."tThe user strikes everything aroun