RavenIu;␀u[[^"$Battling... battling's my game!"Nobody here can beat me!"$Hey, check out my awesome team!"Time for a sweet battle!"This should be fun!"Get ready to lose!""I don't just study, you know!"(Let's see who has the better moves!"0I seek to be a master of the battling arts."&I will never give up until I win!",I've learned all I know from my mother!"3Show me your true intentions with this battle!"-Don't look at me like that! I'm hip too!"4I shall show you the power of my dear partners!"Age before beauty!")If I win, you can have a Sweet Kiss!"(I need a battle, and I need it now!"'Isn't this facility just fabulous?"You've got nothing on me!"You look pretty weak." I'm destined to defeat you!";I'm so glad I live in a world where there are battles!")Don't ever take Pokemon for granted!" I'm always in high spirits!"Surf's up!"/Me and my Pokemon have been training hard!"Wait, a battle?"&Isn't it fun, battling like this?"#I'm warning you, I won't lose!"$Let's relax with a nice battle.",What makes you think you're so special?""Let's have a Water Gun fight!"I love surfing!"1My Pokemon and I are perfectly synchronized!"&Don't get caught in the undertow!"-I've won every match I've been in today!"Meet my wonderful Pokemon!"7Are you a rising star, or will you crash and burn?")My Pokemon and I are the dream team!"+I don't know how to feel about this..."#Hah, you don't stand a chance."Every Pokemon is precious!"3I just graduated from Clown College, you know!"I'm an artistic genius!"Prepare to be entertained!" Pokemon love kind Trainers."Let the dance begin!"$Let us both truly give our all!"Look! Bugs!"0I try and learn a lesson from every battle!"Why is it so hot in here?"+Prepare for the battle of the century!""Come on, let's spar a little!"<In battling, as in all things, discipline is important."?I've just finished my daily meditation. Care for a battle?"Okay. I can do this."9I've been hunting for a good opponent for weeks now!"I'd rather be fishing..."/My Pokemon will show you a true challenge!"6You seem a decent Trainer. I hate to destroy you."Have you heard of me?" It's my duty to defeat you!"My party is ready to roll!"<No one in the Magma Gang's ever been able to defeat me!"Hey, you! Battle me!"&I am a single melancholy flame..."!Aren't these shoes adorable?"%This establishment has no class!"(Show me your passion for this role!")Haven't I seen you somewhere before?"%Would you like to hear a secret?"GI'm a Coordinator in my spare time. Show me your Pokemon's appeal!"*My brother couldn't beat me- can you?" What is that strange smell?"*Sometimes I wish I were a princess..."'Let me play you this song I wrote!"Hello, I love you!"3Hey, have you heard Hardy play? I'm a big fan!"+It's such a fine day, don't you think?"#Heh heh. This is gonna be fun."!Well, hello there, gorgeous!"Water you looking at?" Don't think ya can fool me!"'Do I look intimidating? Be honest."4My intuition's telling me you're pretty strong!"7Battling's just another kind of mountain to climb!"Hey- are you okay?"-Are you expecting an effortless victory?"IStatistically speaking, battling here is safer than 82.6% of places.":Hey, check out my new Pokenav! It's the latest model!"$No excuses! Prepare for battle!"#I'm faster than you'd believe!"What's that look for?"Now, watch carefully."Oh, hey! Long time no see!"!Here it is, my one big shot!"OMy sister bet me I couldn't win ten battles here... I've already won nine!"Give it your all!"'You're not with Interpol, are you?"Oh, I love your hair!""I prefer battling at night..."5There's not much I like more than a good battle!"DI'm training to be a lifeguard. Can I practice while we battle?"CHmm. Do you think this would be a good place for a field trip?"*Say... you don't recognize me, right?"*I'm so mad! I got fired this morning!"I'm bored. Entertain me!"<Just be careful with my Pokemon. They're very precious!"2I hope you will not be hurt when I crush you!",Have you seen my wife? Her name's Lucy!"#There's something about you..."(A quick victory, then I'll go home."Ugh, so much homework..." I'm Victoria's biggest fan!""Something smells around here."%Battling's good for your health!"KExcuse me, which way to the men's room? This hotel is a bit confusing!""I'll wipe the floor with you!"9Can we battle quietly? I'm waiting for a phone call."Battle mode: engaged."!I know you from somewhere..."My battling is remarkable."I can mimic any Pokemon!"1Have you ever met a real telekinetic before?"0My teacher has assured me I will win today.".This is a dangerous place. Leave at once."7You won't find a cuter Trainer anywhere in Reborn!"-My wit is stronger than even my Pokemon!"-You don't know our true purpose, here...".My Pokemon are all perfectly disciplined."#Our battle shall be legendary!"3I've borrowed my boyfriend's Pokemon for this!"/You're bound to be entertaining to battle."4I wish to see how youngsters battle these days."Can you dig my sound?"IWe need to talk. Your behaviour here has not been chivalrous at all!"3I'm thinking of quitting to become a musician."You're quite striking!" You don't know my secret..."!This place makes me nervous."1Can we hurry? I'm missing my favourite show."$Hey, what's the food like here?"!Have you ever been to Hoenn?"You look pretty tired."FYou really think you can beat me? Plumeria's my cousin, you know!"+Your secret can't be hidden forever...")Don't mind me, just here to clean..."8Hold still! I need to get a picture of this moment!"EWh- a battle? Why do you want to battle me? I'm just an orderly!"I'm done holding back!"<I'm not sure this was the right part-time job for me..."<Hey, have you read the latest issue of 'Blaziken Mask'?"2You want to know why I joined the Magma Gang?"$Brace yourself for a Heat Wave!"4I keep telling the boss we need new uniforms..." Don't take this personally.")Normally, I wouldn't do this, but..."&I'll show you my fighting spirit!"%This is my 17th match this week."Check out my new shoes!""I have